window.FWN_PRODIGIOUSLY_AMAZING_WEAPONSMITH_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_PRODIGIOUSLY_AMAZING_WEAPONSMITH_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":4101,"title":"Chapter 4101 Why Don’t This Little Beauty Follow Me (1)","paragraphs":["4101 Why Don’t This Little Beauty Follow Me (1)","This time, even An Mingyan couldn’t maintain a calm expression.","He originally thought that even though his and Meng Qixing’s strengths were somewhat different from those of the three opposing experts, at least Meng Yue’er and the others should be no different from the weaker teammates in the opposing them.","Unexpectedly, the average strength in his team was stronger than his team.","Now it was going to be troublesome.","An Mingyan glanced at Meng Qixing beside him, with a very worried expression on his face, “Young Master Meng, it seems that we are definitely going to lose this time. In this case, when you make a move later, you should be careful and protect yourself. Don’t get yourself seriously injured in such a fight.”","Since the outcome of being eliminated cannot be avoided, there was no need to work too hard.","Although they were in the big array on Paradise Island, their bodies are protected to a certain extent, so they will not be fatally injured.","However, when it comes to life and death, it was still possible to be seriously injured.","Being careful, had no harm in itself","Meng Qixing looked sad and nodded, “Alright, I understand. Then I’ll go first.”","“Well, let’s go.”","Meng Qixing came to the centre of the clearing, and the Empyrean Fox Cultivator on the opposite side had already defeated three people in a row. This was the time when he was most proud. When he saw him, his expression was a little arrogant.","“Hey, so soon, the fourth person will come up? Since you are in such a hurry to die, then hurry up! I never thought that the strength of the White Fen Clan and Ice Snakes was so weak. A chance to sweep away the heavenly geniuses? Hahahaha...”","He raised his head and laughed exaggeratedly.","With a straight face, Meng Qixing said in a cold voice, “Stop talking nonsense and watch the punches!”","He didn’t hesitate at all. As soon as he finished speaking, his fists flew out.","The cultivator on the opposite side didn’t expect that he would strike so quickly and decisively. He didn’t react for a while, so he couldn’t even talk about defence.","With a “bang”, Meng Qixing’s fist slammed into his face.","The cultivator of the Empyrean Fox Clan was beaten to the side on the spot, blood flowed from the corner of his mouth and he fell to the ground.","There was an uproar in Jing Shaojue’s team, and some even shouted, accusing Meng Qixing of a sneak attack.","Meng Qixing looked calm, “Sneak attack? How can this be called a sneak attack? Didn’t I just say that the fourth match will officially start? I am standing here as a living person, so he can’t see me or what? It is obvious that he himself talks too much nonsense and is not ready for battle at all, so how can he say that I am doing a sneak attack?”","“Damn it, who knew that you...would make a sudden move! I don’t accept it! Let’s compete again!” The cultivator of the Empyrean Fox Clan shouted.","To him, this was a blow to the head.","How proud he was when he won three in a row just now, how embarrassing he was now!","Before the excitement was over, he was punched in the face and lost! It really doesn’t get more frustrating than this!","Moreover, he thought from the bottom of his heart that he should not have lost in the first place, and it was all because he was not prepared.","Before Meng Qixing had time to express his opinion, Jing Shaojue had already grabbed the man’s clothes, and said coldly: “Alright, let’s go aside, isn’t it embarrassing enough?”","“Shao...Young Master Shaojue? I...I really just...”","“Alright, stop talking nonsense! The Seven-star Young Master of the Ice Snake Clan is a heaven-level genius after all, do you still want to beat him?”"]},{"number":4102,"title":"Chapter 4102 Why Don’t This Little Beauty Follow Me (2)","paragraphs":["4102 Why Don’t This Little Beauty Follow Me (2)","“It’s too much to look down on a heavenly genius!”","Jing Shaojue had a cold face, and a disdainful smile appeared on the corner of his mouth.","“What... what? He is a heaven-level genius?”","Hearing this, the cultivators of the Empyrean Fox Clan came back to their senses. They didn’t dare to provoke Meng Qixing anymore. They quickly lowered their heads and returned to their team.","Jing Shaojue glanced at Meng Qixing, but he spoke to An Mingyan: “Young Master Mingyan, it seems that there is really no one in your team! So soon, it’s Meng Qixing’s turn to play! Unfortunately, his In my opinion, strength is still not ranked, I am afraid it will not help you at all! Today you will definitely be sent out!”","An Mingyan knew that although Jing Shaojue’s words were harsh, they were the truth.","So, even though he was extremely aggrieved, he couldn’t find any way to refute it!","“Who is out, we have to wait and see after the fight! Is it too early for Young Master Shaojue to say such a thing now? Or... you are actually very worried that you will lose to us, so you said such a thing on purpose. Come to attack the confidence of our fighters?”","Huang Yueli couldn’t bear to watch anymore, she walked out from the shade of the tree, and said calmly.","Jing Shaojue frowned immediately, and said displeasedly: “It’s just a human race, and you dare to talk to me like this, are you courting death?”","However, after he saw Huang Yueli’s face clearly, Jing Shaojue’s face showed obvious astonishment, he was stunned for a while, and then suddenly smiled.","“Hehe, let me just say, why did An Mingyan insist on bringing a human woman in the team? It turns out...”","He unscrupulously looked Huang Yueli up and down, as if he was looking at an item in an auction house, “She is really a stunning beauty, even if I, this Young Master, have never seen such a beauty! Beauty, follow a waste like An Mingyan has no future, he will be sent out today! Why not follow me, at least, I can guarantee you to pass the elimination round and enter the semi-finals! If you serve me well, after the end of the God Realm’s Grand Meet, maybe I will also bring you back to the White Tiger Clan and be my concubine, how about that?”","After hearing this, Huang Yueli’s smile disappeared instantly, and her eyes were filled with coldness.","No matter where you go, you will meet such lustful scum!","“You want me to follow you? It’s simple, as long as you can beat me, I will agree.” Huang Yueli said with a sneer.","Jing Shaojue couldn’t help laughing, “There are too many men who can win you, little girl! However, since you don’t believe in my strength, I don’t mind showing it to you. Wait a minute, I’ll let you get to know me better!”","As he said that, he urged his team members, “Who is the second one to end? Hurry up, hurry up! If you lose, you lose, it doesn’t matter. I will end everything up in person later, and let the little beauty see for herself, is An Mingyan the best, or am I the best!”","The team members under him all started booing.","“Young Master Shaojue is really lucky. You can meet such a beautiful woman in this filthy place!”","“Little Beauty, stop talking and just follow our Young Master, right? An Mingyan, that trash, looks like a soft-legged shrimp at first glance, can he satisfy you?”","“That’s it!”","An Mingyan’s face flushed red with anger, and he felt very guilty towards Huang Yueli.","He was the one who pulled Huang Yueli into the team, but in the end he was about to be eliminated."]},{"number":4103,"title":"Chapter 4103 Why Don’t This Little Beauty Follow Me (3)","paragraphs":["4103 Why Don’t This Little Beauty Follow Me (3)","If because of this, she was actually played by a beast like Jing Shaojue, then he has really committed a crime!","I’m afraid I will feel guilty in my heart in the future.","The second cultivator on Jing Shaojue’s side soon came to an end.","I don’t know if it was intentional perfunctory, but this cultivator didn’t intend to fight hard at all, and was knocked out by Meng Qixing after a few hits.","Immediately afterwards, the third person performed exactly the same.","The fourth cultivator is the cultivator of the White Tiger Clan. Although he is not as powerful as Jing Shaojue, he was more than enough to deal with Meng Qixing.","Meng Qixing had already prepared for a hard fight, and even thought it through, most likely he would be defeated here.","But who would have thought that this fourth cultivator was no different from the previous three. He just punched a set of punches laughing and joking, and then was beaten down by him with very exaggerated acting skills.","The same goes for the fifth cultivator.","Not long after, Meng Qixing stood alone in the middle of the open space, looking around in a daze. He still couldn’t accept that he suddenly became such a master.","Actually, in just half an hour, one person defeated five opponents!","One to five!","If it was really possible to accomplish such a feat in the ring, even if it is not a formal competition, it will be enough for people to proudly go out and brag about it for a while.","However, Meng Qixing didn’t feel any excitement in his heart.","Because, he already knew very well that Jing Shaojue was not defeated by him at all, and even, the other party never took him seriously.","It was clear that they were not serious at all and the purpose was to speed up the progress of the competition and give Jing Shaojue a chance to show his skills in front of the beauty!","Sure enough, after the fifth cultivator was defeated, he immediately ran to Jing Shaojue and said with a smile, “Lord Shaojue, am I fast enough? Now it’s your turn to play!”","He thought he was flattering very well, but Jing Shaojue didn’t give him a good face.","“Tsk, don’t you guys look like you? Although I said I want to fight An Mingyan quickly, but it doesn’t mean I want to fight that Meng Qixing! You can’t do anything, get that trash out first! You still have to waste my strength to beat him! What use are you for?”","“Well...”","It was only then that everyone realised that they were being flattered, and their expressions became a little stiff.","“Forget it, anyway, it won’t waste much effort, I’ll solve it myself!” Jing Shaojue said, and walked to the centre.","Meng Qixing naturally listened to all their conversations, and couldn’t help showing a look of despair on his face.","The people from Jing Shaojue really didn’t take it seriously!","The only reason why they are so confident is naturally because they were strong enough to kill him in seconds!","And when Jing Shaojue stood in front of him, Meng Qixing became even more desperate.","Jing Shaojue exuded incomparably sharp metal attribute profound energy, and his whole body was like a blade, ready to go.","Even if he hasn’t made a move yet, as an opponent, he could feel a slight sting.","That was the damage caused to him by the coercion of profound force that escaped into the air.","Meng Qixing felt his legs go weak at that time.","“What? Are you going to throw in the towel and get out, or do you want me to beat the shit out of you before you get out?” Jing Shaojue said disdainfully."]},{"number":4104,"title":"Chapter 4104 Why Don’t This Little Beauty Follow Me (4)","paragraphs":["4104 Why Don’t This Little Beauty Follow Me (4)","Although Meng Qixing was afraid in his heart, he was still a righteous person after all.","He also heard Jing Shaojue’s blatant words towards Huang Yueli just now, and felt that he had an obligation to protect the girls in the team. Although he definitely couldn’t win, he couldn’t just walk away like this.","So, he still bit the bullet and said: “This... since... since it’s a group arena, we have to fight... for a while, right?”","“Brother! What are you talking about? Come down, come down!” Meng Yue’er couldn’t help but yelled, “That woman is not from our clan, she doesn’t care about our business whether she lives or dies? Why do you have to risk this for her? What if you get injured? Come down quickly!”","However, Meng Qixing pursed his lips, but still didn’t say a word.","Jing Shaojue sneered and said, “If you have the guts, then I’ll let you go happily.”","He took a sudden step, and struck Meng Qixing’s chest with all his might!","Meng Qixing had been on the alert all along, and when he saw the opponent making a move, he immediately put on a defensive stance.","When Jing Shaojue made the move, he didn’t have much skill, so Meng Qixing happened to be in the right position.","A gleam of joy flashed in his eyes, and he just wanted to be happy that his judgement was correct.","But who knows, in the next breath, he won’t be able to laugh anymore!","Jing Shaojue’s attack power was so fierce that it directly shattered his defensive cover!","Although the palm was somewhat hindered, it still accurately landed on Meng Qixing’s chest.","Meng Qixing couldn’t resist at all, and flew backwards, spitting blood in mid-air.","“Brother!” Meng Yue’er turned pale with fright, and hurriedly chased him to see his situation.","Jing Shaojue had a relaxed expression on his face, it seemed that he just sent Meng Qixing flying, and it didn’t take much effort at all.","He smiled, and his provocative eyes fell on An Mingyan, “Young Master Mingyan, I don’t know if the next one will end up, is it you or... this Little Beauty?”","“It’s me!”","‘It’s me!”","The two spoke at the same time.","An Mingyan was obviously stunned for a moment, then turned his head to look at Huang Yueli, “Young Miss Li, didn’t you agree just now? Let me make the first move. If I can’t deal with it, we can talk about it later?”","Huang Yueli shook her head with a smile, and said: “It was just now, now is now. I now feel that I was too arrogant when I said that earlier! With my strength, I should strike before you, Young Master Mingyan!”","That’s what I said, but the real reason is that she was really too lazy to make a move before, so she put herself behind An Mingyan.","Now, Jing Shaojue has completely violated her taboo, she can’t wait to get out of the game quickly and beat him to death!","Moreover, looking at the way Jing Shaojue dealt with Meng Qixing just now, this guy’s moves were very aggressive and An Mingyan’s strength was not known. If there was any accident, An Mingyan may end up very badly!","Huang Yueli still has a good impression of An Mingyan, and everyone knows him because of fate. She doesn’t want An Mingyan to pay the price of serious injury because of her.","However, An Mingyan had a completely different idea.","Hearing Huang Yueli’s words, he shook his head desperately, “No, no! Young Miss Li, you will be the last one. It’s all agreed, how can you change your mind? It’s too late for you to regret it now, just follow the previous order!”","He was a gentleman, and he was afraid that Jing Shaojue would do something shameless to Huang Yueli, so he was determined to do his best to deal with Jing Shaojue."]},{"number":4105,"title":"Chapter 4105 Really Misjudged! (1)","paragraphs":["4105 Really Misjudged! (1)","Huang Yueli wanted to say something more, but An Mingyan had already strode to the middle of the open space.","“Alright, your next opponent is me!” He looked at Jing Shaojue sternly.","Jing Shaojue was a little surprised, “Tsk tsk, Young Master Mingyan, I’m going to look at you with admiration now, you do not only have just ordinary feelings for a woman, are you prepared to give up your future? I’m really curious, What kind of charm does she have that can fascinate you like this. After I eliminate you all, I will be able to experience it well, hahahaha...”","Hearing Jing Shaojue’s arrogant laughter, An Mingyan’s face turned ashen.","“Shut up, I don’t have such dirty thoughts as you! Stop talking nonsense, since it’s a competition, let’s start!”","Jing Shaojue laughed a few more times before he stopped laughing, but his gaze towards An Mingyan was still full of disdain.","An Mingyan gritted his teeth, a powerful profound force suddenly burst out from his body, and suddenly attacked Jing Shaojue!","Jing Shaojue underestimated the enemy too much and was caught off guard by him.","The long sword in An Mingyan’s hand slashed directly across his shoulder.","Jing Shaojue’s expression changed immediately. Obviously, he did not expect An Mingyan’s speed to be so fast!","However, his gaffe only lasted for a few breaths, and soon, a smile appeared on his face again.","“He he, I underestimated you. A cultivator with wood attributes can have such a fast speed. You are indeed one of the top heaven-level geniuses! You must have put in a lot of hard work in terms of body skills, right? But, it’s quite a pity, no matter how fast your speed is, what’s the use of such a low attack power? You see, this small wound you left doesn’t affect me at all.”","Jing Shaojue’s words are not false at all.","Although An Mingyan caught him off guard, he managed to injure him.","However, the wound was very shallow, nothing more than a flesh trauma. To a cultivator with rich combat experience, it was no different from being bitten by a mosquito.","Although the attack did not have the desired effect, An Mingyan’s expression was still calm and focused.","Without saying a word, he clenched the long sword in his hand, and soon made a second move!","This time, Jing Shaojue was already prepared, so he dodged in a timely manner.","An Mingyan was not discouraged at all, and made thirty or fifty moves in succession, beckoning and attacking.","Huang Yueli watched from the side, and couldn’t help shaking her head secretly.","An Mingyan’s basic skills are indeed very solid. It can be seen that he usually practices very hard.","However, the disadvantage of the wood attribute is too obvious. His speed is not much different from Jing Shaojue, so when he has the upper hand, he can only occasionally hit the opponent.","But his attack power is really bad. These few hits only left Jing Shaojue with a few shallow wounds and a few drops of blood.","There was no effective damage at all.","If this continues, An Mingyan will soon be defeated.","Sure enough, after dodging a few moves, Jing Shaojue gradually grasped the rules of An Mingyan’s moves, and simply accepted the move. At the same time, he changed his defensive posture into an attack.","An Mingyan stabbed Jing Shaojue’s shoulder with a sword, and before he could be happy, he felt a strong metallic energy suddenly approaching his chest!","The metal attribute was extremely destructive, and against the soft wood attribute, they were completely polar extremes.","An Mingyan only felt a surge of energy and blood rush up in his chest, and retreated several steps in succession before barely standing still."]},{"number":4106,"title":"Chapter 4106 Really Misjudged! (2)","paragraphs":["4106 Really Misjudged! (2)","Jing Shaojue laughed out loud and didn’t give him any time to catch his breath, and immediately made another move.","When An Mingyan had the upper hand, he still couldn’t gain an advantage.","Now being attacked by Jing Shaojue one after another, it is even more difficult to resist. He was forced to retreat step by step, and was about to be forced into the woods.","All the team members on An Mingyan’s side were downcast, and some even covered their eyes, unable to bear to watch.","Originally, they had high hopes for An Mingyan.","Although they knew that the wood attribute was different from the metal attribute, and the difference in cultivation was not too big, wood attribute fighters would probably lose, but at least there was still a glimmer of hope in their hearts.","But now...they have to accept the reality that they are really going to be eliminated.","Just when everyone was almost desperate, Jing Shaojue’s expression suddenly changed.","“Damn it!”","With his shot, his body suddenly soared into the air!","Everyone was taken aback and turned around quickly. In the end, they saw Jing Shaojue’s body being rolled up by a thick vine and hanging in the air.","And An Mingyan’s body exuded extremely pure wood-attribute energy, which was sending it to an ivy plant below Jing Shaojue with all its strength.","Huang Yueli was also taken aback for a moment before she understood.","It seems that An Mingyan was a very adaptable cultivator.","He was forced to the edge of the woods by Jing Shaojue, so he simply took advantage of the terrain and directly stimulated the growth potential of the ivy with wood attribute energy, causing it to suddenly grow a thick vine, which swept Jing Shaojue away.","Jing Shaojue obviously didn’t expect such a thing to happen, his face was extremely ugly, and he struggled desperately in mid-air.","“Damn it, damn it! Let me down, let me down!”","However, these vines couldn’t understand human words, and they were still under An Mingyan’s control, wrapping him tightly, and getting tighter and tighter.","It was so tight that Jing Shaojue even felt that the air in his lungs was squeezed out little by little, and the ribs in his chest seemed to be broken.","When An Mingyan’s team members saw this scene, their emotions, which had already fallen to the bottom, suddenly recovered, and they were all very excited.","“Young Master Mingyan, you are really amazing!”","“Don’t listen to him, don’t let him down, just hang him like this, hang him to death!”","“Throw him into the poisonous mist, they have already lost!”","Seeing the smiles on everyone’s faces, Huang Yueli couldn’t help shaking her head secretly.","“It’s too early to be happy now, isn’t it? Jing Shaojue’s ability should be more than that, right?”","Things were just as she said.","An Mingyan was doing his best to control the vines, trying to throw Jing Shaojue into the poisonous mist, but Jing Shaojue’s expression changed, and the profound strength around him rose again.","“Boom” came a loud noise!","The entire vine was completely blown away by Jing Shaojue’s fierce metal profound energy!","The profound energy that An Mingyan sent into the ivy was swallowed back into his body, causing him to spit out a mouthful of blood in an instant and fall to the ground.","Of course, Jing Shaojue wasn’t completely free.","Blowing up those vines also consumed a lot of his profound energy, and he fell from such a high place all of a sudden, and was somewhat injured.","However, none of his injuries were serious. Compared with the backlash suffered by An Mingyan, it can be said to be a world of difference.","Soon, he got up from the ground and walked towards An Mingyan."]},{"number":4107,"title":"Chapter 4107 Really Misjudged! (3)","paragraphs":["4107 Really Misjudged! (3)","“How about it? Do you want to continue the competition? I don’t want to become enemies with the White Fen Clan, so let’s go here. Take your team members and go to the poisonous mist by yourself.”","Jing Shaojue waved his hand, his expression full of arrogance.","“By the way, leave that Little Beauty to me.” His eyes turned to Huang Yueli, looking her up and down, his eyes were full of covetousness.","Although he is one of the top geniuses of the Ancient God Clan, and has an outstanding status in the family, there were countless beauties rushing to follow him, which can be regarded as countless people.","However, he has never seen a beauty like Huang Yueli before!","Being able to get her was one of the biggest achievements of this elimination round.","An Mingyan was obviously very unwilling, and gritted his teeth, “No, no...you can’t treat Young Miss Li...”","“What? Are you really planning to die for a woman? Let me tell you, if the fight continues, I won’t be able to show mercy. You know that even in a large array, sometimes people will be killed , you really insist on continuing the fight?” Jing Shaojue sneered.","Before An Mingyan could speak, Meng Yue’er couldn’t help shouting: “Young Master Mingyan, you...don’t do this, you are a body of gold, how can you take such a big risk for a human?”","Even Meng Qixing frowned, “Young Master Mingyan, let’s go to the poisonous mist. If Young Miss Li doesn’t want to, she can choose to retire. Is it possible that Young Master Jing can still insist?”","An Mingyan still shook his head, “No, I can’t do this kind of thing. Jing Shaojue, let’s continue...”","“Wait!”","Just when Meng Qixing and the others were extremely anxious and unable to do anything, a voice suddenly sounded behind them.","“Young Master Mingyan, you clearly lost just now, so you can’t play tricks, right? If you lose, you lose. You have to admit it.”","An Mingyan was obviously stunned for a moment, because it was none other than Huang Yueli who said this!","“Young Miss Li, you...you are...”","He never thought that Huang Yueli would say such a thing.","Meng Yue’er said in a strange way: “Young Master Mingyan, you heard that too, right? Young Miss Li probably wants to follow Young Master Jing herself! Some women just want to see who is strong and has a high status, and they can’t wait to stick to it! You still do it for her! Why bother to gamble next time!”","Huang Yueli ignored Meng Yue’er’s ridicule and walked directly to the centre of the clearing.","When Jing Shaojue saw the beauty walking towards him, his eyes almost went straight.","“Haha, Young Miss Li, you are very knowledgeable about current affairs! Don’t worry, if you follow me, I will not treat you badly. Come here first and let me give you a kiss...”","Jing Shaojue went to meet him, and without even thinking about it, he wanted to touch Huang Yueli’s face.","That beauty’s little face was fair and tender, smooth like tofu, and it had already made his heart itch.","But who knows, before his fingers touched the beauty’s face, he saw the figure of the girl in front of him flash.","Immediately afterwards, he felt a strong force coming from his buttocks, and his body suddenly fell forward.","There was a “plop”.","Jing Shaojue fell to the ground in the posture of a dog eating shit, with his face facing the ground, making a big hole.","And on his butt, there is a very delicate footprint.","This scene happened so suddenly that none of the cultivators present could react, and they all stared blankly at the ground."]},{"number":4108,"title":"Chapter 4108 Really Misjudged! (4)","paragraphs":["4108 Really Misjudged! (4)","Jing Shaojue was stunned.","It took a while before I came back to my senses and realised that he had been kicked.","This time, he actually didn’t fall hard, and he wasn’t even injured as badly as the ones stabbed by An Mingyan. However, this posture was really embarrassing, so embarrassing!","Jing Shaojue jumped up from the ground all of a sudden, and shouted angrily, “Who dares to plot against me behind my back? Don’t want to live anymore?”","Huang Yueli stood in front of him, with a smile on her lips, and said unhurriedly: “Young Master Shaojue is really joking, how can you say it’s a conspiracy in a formal ring competition?”","Jing Shaojue was startled again, then frowned, “It was you just now?? How is that possible?”","Previously, Huang Yueli was clearly standing in front of him, but the force that kicked him down came from directly behind him.","If it was Huang Yueli who made the move, she would have to dodge behind him at that moment, and then make the move immediately.","If it’s really her, this agility is not at the level that ordinary people can achieve.","Jing Shaojue frowned and looked around, and found that other people were standing far away from him, so he had to accept this fact.","The frivolous look on his face faded a bit, and he looked at the girl in front of him for the first time, “You really did it?”","Huang Yueli said calmly: “Can it still be false? Alright, don’t waste time, let’s start the competition quickly!”","“Competition? What competition?” Jing Shaojue frowned suspiciously.","Not only him, but the other cultivators present also looked dazed when they heard Huang Yueli’s words, unable to react.","Huang Yueli’s eyes were filled with impatience, “Hey, let me tell you...you are all stupid, right? Didn’t you agree just now? Our two teams are in a group arena match, and if all the members of one side lose, it is considered a loss. Whoever loses will voluntarily jump into the poisonous mist, isn’t it?”","Jing Shaojue nodded, “That’s right, so you have already lost.”","“Which eye of yours saw us lose? Isn’t it obvious that our team has six people? There’s a sixth one!” Huang Yueli frowned.","The cultivators present all stared at her blankly, and gradually came to their senses.","“Wait, so speaking of it, indeed five people on An Mingyan’s side has participated? This Young Miss Li hasn’t!”","“What? What’s the situation? An Mingyan isn’t the last one?”","“That’s right, there is indeed someone else on An Mingyan’s side, and he hasn’t lost yet!”","“Even if that Young Miss Li can still participate, so what? Just because she is a delicate human beauty, can she defeat our Young Master Shaojue?”","After Jing Shaojue understood, he also looked relaxed.","“Tsk tsk, Young Miss Li, you actually come in person and compete with me? I don’t think so? Why do such a rude thing when you are such a juicy little girl? If you get hurt, I will be distressed.”","Huang Yueli looked at the winks he threw over to her and almost vomited out last night’s meal.","It was true, ugly people do more tricks!","She suppressed her nausea and said, “The rules of the competition are like this. If you dare not fight with me, you just admit defeat! You can go to the poisonous mist yourself!”","When Jing Shaojue heard this, he laughed out loud, “Hahaha, Young Miss Li, are you... are you trying to make me laugh on purpose? Ask us to admit defeat? Alright, since you insist on fighting me for one match, I naturally have to accompany you!”"]},{"number":4109,"title":"Chapter 4109 Really Misjudged! (5)","paragraphs":["4109 Really Misjudged! (5)","Jing Shaojue walked to the centre of the clearing with a frivolous and wanton smile on his face.","“Young Miss Li, then I’m going to make a move. But don’t worry, I’m an affectionate person and I won’t deal a heavy blow. As for you, you can hide as much as you can. If you can’t, just say a few words to beg me for mercy, and I will not really hit you hard...”","He was still talking triumphantly there, thinking that he was personable and generous, and he would definitely make the Little Beauty feel a little bit of admiration for him.","But who knows, before he finished speaking, a silver light suddenly flashed before his eyes.","Jing Shaojue immediately felt the danger and hurriedly retreated back to dodge.","The experience he gained in actual combat over the years saved him.","The blade of the long sword passed through his arm, and blood gushed out immediately. However, at least he managed to avoid the fatal position on his chest and abdomen.","Jing Shaojue’s expression changed in an instant. He couldn’t believe it. He was hurt by the Little Beauty opposite without even seeing how she moved.","Moreover, the wound was so deep that it almost sliced off a piece of flesh from his arm. It was completely incomparable to An Mingyan’s limp sword move just now!","“You... little girl, your body skills are pretty good, and your sword speed is also very fast! It seems that you have really put in a lot of effort in swordsmanship! There are not many swordmasters amongst the humans, who is your Master?”","Jing Shaojue’s face became more serious.","Although, he still felt that the main reason why he would be injured was that he was bewitched by the beauty just now. In fact, his strength was naturally far higher than Huang Yueli’s.","However, the angle of Huang Yueli’s sword was very tricky, and it was silent, which indeed showed extremely advanced sword skills, which made him a little curious.","Huang Yueli said with a smile: “My Master never taught me swordsmanship, I learned it from my Husband!”","“So, your Husband is a master of swordsmanship...” At this point, Jing Shaojue suddenly felt that something was wrong, “Wait, what did you just say? What Husband? Are you married?”","Huang Yueli nodded, “That’s right.”","Jing Shaojue’s eyes widened, his face full of disbelief.","However, it didn’t take long for him to calm down, and a sneer of disdain appeared at the corner of his mouth.","“Alright, I know you don’t want to follow me, so you made up this kind of lie, but you can’t lie to me! For a cultivator of your age, and such a talent, look at the Spirit Armament you use, you must be from a powerful human force. How could you get married at such a young age? What kind of Husband is a master of swordsmanship... He he, so what? Under my hands, you can only kneel down and beg for mercy!”","Huang Yueli couldn’t help laughing, “You’re quite confident in yourself, aren’t you?”","If Li Moying heard such words, she probably wouldn’t be angry, but would just find it ridiculous.","She didn’t lie just now, her swordsmanship was indeed taught by Li Moying.","Li Moying has studied swordsmanship intensively since he was a child, and his attainments in swordsmanship, even in the God Realm, few people can match him.","Huang Yueli didn’t really like swordsmanship that much, but after staying with Li Moying for a long time, sometimes out of curiosity, she also learned a few tricks.","Huang Yueli didn’t want to reveal her identity, so she decided to use a few sword skills to fight Jing Shaojue.","Unexpectedly, Jing Shaojue misunderstood her."]},{"number":4110,"title":"Chapter 4110 Really Misjudged! (6)","paragraphs":["4110 Really Misjudged! (6)","Of course, Huang Yueli had no intention of explaining.","She flicked her wrist casually, drawing a few dazzling glints of her long sword.","“Stop talking nonsense, if you don’t make a move, I will.”","Jing Shaojue had no idea what kind of little witch he was facing, and he was still pretending to be magnanimous.","“All right, all right, Young Miss Li, please first, please first! I can let you do three tricks first, and after three tricks, I will...”","Jing Shaojue was halfway through speaking when his expression suddenly changed.","Huang Yueli’s long sword had already pierced his chest, and within an inch, it would pass through his chest.","Jing Shaojue hurriedly tried to dodge, and at the same time, waved his hands in Huang Yueli’s direction!","The powerful metal profound energy was extremely strong, forming waves of air currents that surged forward and hit Huang Yueli’s fragile sword edge.","The cultivators onlookers suddenly let out an exclamation.","“Young Master Shaojue’s shot is too heavy, isn’t it?”","“It’s over, it’s over, that Little Beauty is miserable!”","An Mingyan’s face was even paler, and he couldn’t bear to watch it any longer.","Huang Yueli’s swordsmanship was indeed very outstanding, but the fact that she was able to hurt Jing Shaojue was obviously because Jing Shaojue did not really make a move.","But now, Jing Shaojue was cornered and used his true strength all at once.","How could this be something that a human cultivator like Huang Yueli could resist?","However, a scene that no one expected happened.","The metal profound energy collided with Huang Yueli’s long sword, making a buzzing sound.","However, the long sword in Huang Yueli’s hand didn’t break, and even didn’t shake a bit, it was still stretched out straight!","The seemingly fragile sword edge was extremely tough and indestructible!","Jing Shaojue’s profound strength stopped in mid-air, unable to push it out, he froze for a moment.","When he made the move just now, he already regretted it, and was worried that he would kill the Little Beauty on the spot.","Unexpectedly, Huang Yueli not only did not fall down, but also took this move head-on!","Just as he was in a daze, Huang Yueli flicked her wrist lightly and a green light shone from the bottom of her wrist, and then moved forward along the blade of the long sword, wrapping the whole sword in the middle.","She stretched her wrist forward and stabbed out with the long sword. Jing Shaojue’s sharp and fierce metal profound energy was cut open like tofu under her sword’s edge.","“Ughhh!”","Jing Shaojue’s profound strength was defeated, and he suffered backlash immediately, his face turned pale.","Looking down in shock, he discovered that Huang Yueli’s sword had once again pierced his chest.","Jing Shaojue wanted to dodge, but it was too late.","With a “pfft”, the sword’s edge pierced into Jing Shaojue’s chest, and bright red blood splashed out.","“Young Master Shaojue!”","“Stop! Stop quickly!”","The team members on Jing Shaojue’s side uttered terrified screams one by one, wanting to come up to save him, but they were standing too far away, and there was no time to come over, so they couldn’t help showing expressions of despair.","However, Huang Yueli didn’t intend to kill anyone. The long sword pierced his chest less than an inch, so she listened and stopped.","“What’s with all this howling like ghosts? I know this is a group fight, not a life-and-death match. How could I kill people casually? Shut up!”","She held the long sword in one hand, and picked her ear with the other, complaining impatiently.","Jing Shaojue’s people quickly shut their mouths, with panicked expressions on their faces."]},{"number":4111,"title":"Chapter 4111 Really Misjudged! (7)","paragraphs":["4111 Really Misjudged! (7)","Although in front of them was still that delicate Little Beauty human cultivator, but now, no one dares to say anything against her!","Because, the long sword in Huang Yueli’s hand was still at Jing Shaojue’s chest!","If there was any slip up due to loss of attention or even a trembling hand, it could stab Jing Shaojue to death.","Jing Shaojue was even more tongue-tied, staring fixedly at Huang Yueli. The expression on his face was a mixture of shock, surprise, fear and confusion...","He couldn’t believe that he was actually defeated by a little girl from the human race!","Moreover, within two moves, he was stabbed in the chest by the opponent’s sword. If the opponent hadn’t shown mercy, he would already be a corpse now!","How was this possible?","If it weren’t for the wound on his chest that was burning like fire, Jing Shaojue would have thought he was having a nightmare!","He was one of the most outstanding genius cultivators of the Ancient God Clan, and he can be ranked among the top ten geniuses among the young cultivators of the White Tiger Clan!","How could it be possible to lose to a human?!","“You, you...”","Jing Shaojue opened his mouth, but couldn’t even utter a complete sentence.","Huang Yueli glanced at him, “Let’s stop all this awkward gawking. Let me ask you, did you lose this match? Do you admit defeat?”","Jing Shaojue choked.","He immediately realised that if he admitted defeat, their entire team would be eliminated.","He couldn’t say that.","Of course, the more important reason is that if he were to admit defeat to such a weak-looking beauty, he... really couldn’t bear this face.","“You don’t admit defeat, right? Well, if you don’t admit defeat, then...” Huang Yueli paused.","Then he continued: “Then I can only let you go to hell!”","As she spoke, she flicked her wrist, and the long sword stabbed towards Jing Shaojue’s heart.","Jing Shaojue was almost scared to death, and quickly yelled, “I admit defeat, I admit defeat! Young Miss Li, you...don’t be impulsive! If you kill me, the White Tiger Clan will definitely retaliate against you in the future!”","Huang Yueli stopped her hand in time and put away the long sword.","“Isn’t it better to admit defeat early? Had to waste so much of my saliva! Really!”","Jing Shaojue almost spat out a mouthful of blood on the spot!","He never expected that Huang Yueli would be so resolute that she would kill someone if she wanted to!","Generally speaking, shouldn’t the second half of the sentence be “If you don’t admit defeat, then fight again?” How did Huang Yueli become “I’ll send you to hell if you don’t admit defeat”?","After Huang Yueli heard that Jing Shaojue had conceded, she stopped talking to him.","She turned and walked towards An Mingyan, “Young Master Mingyan, it’s good luck! I’ve dealt with Jing Shaojue, where do you think we should go next?”","An Mingyan was still in a sluggish state, unable to recover, let alone answering Huang Yueli.","Huang Yueli frowned, “Young Master Mingyan?!”","She yelled several times before An Mingyan suddenly woke up, “Ah? Li...Young Miss Li! You...you really defeated Jing Shaojue!”","Seeing his expression of seeing a ghost, Huang Yueli couldn’t help being a little funny.","“I said... Young Master Mingyan, you are also a genius of the Ancient God Clan. You have seen the world. It’s just an informal competition, not a formal competition. Is there any need to be surprised like this?”","An Mingyan still had a look of astonishment on his face, “What did you just... just do? You are also of the wood attribute, right? Why can you defeat metal attribute cultivators?”"]},{"number":4112,"title":"Chapter 4112 Really Misjudged! (8)","paragraphs":["4112 Really Misjudged! (8)","Huang Yueli was startled, and then remembered that in order to conceal her identity as much as possible just now, she used wood attribute profound strength.","Her wood attribute was actually not too strong. In terms of cultivation skill, she is not much different from An Mingyan.","Moreover, An Mingyan’s affinity and ability to use wood profound energy was far beyond her reach.","Through some extreme manipulation methods, she easily defeated burst of Jing Shaojue’s metal profound energy.","Such a thing was very common to her, as instinctive as eating and drinking, but to An Mingyan, it was quite a shocking thing.","The White Fen Clan was not war driven, and has always used their ancestral elixir techniques as their main inheritance. Therefore, most geniuses were not as enthusiastic about fighting skills as other clans.","When they can’t beat others, they often comfort themselves by saying that the wood attribute was not suitable for combat.","But seeing Huang Yueli make a move today, she gave An Mingyan a shocking lesson!","Huang Yueli smiled, and said: “This is just a little fighting skill. With Young Master Mingyan’s cultivation, as long as you practice hard, you can definitely do it. In fact, the wood attribute does not only have the ability to heal. It may not be very tough but I wouldn’t say that it’s much worse than metal.”","“Let’s talk about this later, we’ll deal with Jing Shaojue and them first.”","Only then did An Mingyan remember the business, and nodded, “Let me deal with this matter. Don’t worry, the White Tiger Clan won’t take their word for it.”","He walked towards Jing Shaojue and said a few words to him.","Jing Shaojue was filled with unreconciliation, but he still led his team members, turned around and walked in the direction of the poisonous mist.","However, before he left, his eyes still lingered on Huang Yueli’s face reluctantly.","Huang Yueli frowned, “Tsk, if you lose, you lose. You keep looking at me, do you want to remember my face to take revenge? A big man with such a small belly?”","An Mingyan felt that she was a little funny when he heard this.","“Young Miss Li, you... oh, you made a mistake! I think Young Master Shaojue really likes you...”","The corner of Huang Yueli’s mouth twitched, “Young Master Mingyan, you must have read it wrong! Jing Shao is definitely just looking for fun, I have seen this kind of arrogant face of a dude a lot!”","An Mingyan shook his head and said: “That was just now...he thought you were an ordinary woman under my protection, so he was attracted to you. Seeing your extraordinary strength now, he must have other thoughts.”","The cultivators of the Ancient God Clan valued talent and strength the most.","The love for the strong was engraved in their bones, and they have received such edification since childhood and their aesthetics were highly consistent.","Not to mention Jing Shaojue, even An Mingyan was quite moved after seeing Huang Yueli’s demeanor just now.","However, An Mingyan knew that his strength was not as good as Huang Yueli’s, so he quickly threw this notion out of his mind.","But Jing Shaojue has always been used to being domineering. Even if he lost this time, he actually didn’t feel that he was inferior to Huang Yueli, but felt that he was careless.","Therefore, he did not intend to hide his thoughts at all.","Huang Yueli’s eyes widened and she looked at An Mingyan.","“Young Master Mingyan, what you said can’t be true, right? If Jing Shaojue is really interested in me... Alas, he is really miserable! He will definitely be taught by my Husband so that he can’t take care of himself. It’s too miserable! ”","Hearing this, An Mingyan was obviously taken aback, “You...you’re really married?? Didn’t you just talk nonsense on purpose?”"]},{"number":4113,"title":"Chapter 4113 Really Misjudged! (9)","paragraphs":["4113 Really Misjudged! (9)","Huang Yueli shook her head, “What nonsense? Of course it’s not nonsense! I’ve already...”","She originally wanted to say that she had been married for more than two years, but suddenly remembered that An Mingyan was from the Ancient God Clan, and it would be bad if he leaked the word and spread it to the Sacred Phoenix Clan.","So, she changed her words: “Anyway, I’m going to get married soon, and my future husband is a very jealous person.”","“You...you...but you are only twenty years old, right? Are you twenty years old?” An Mingyan looked her up and down suspiciously.","Huang Yueli said indifferently: “It’s not important, anyway, I’m going to get married.”","Hearing this, An Mingyan couldn’t help showing a bit of worry, “This...Young Miss Li, maybe I’m overthinking, but I still want to remind you...”","“What do you want to remind me of?” Huang Yueli asked strangely.","An Mingyan said: “You also saw Jing Shaojue’s appearance when he left just now. He must not be reconciled to being defeated by you, and he is deeply in love with you. He will definitely come to you in the future. If he knows that you are going to get married, maybe he will kill your fiancé. Jing Shaojue has always been ruthless, because he is from an Ancient God Clan, he can do anything, you must be careful!”","Huang Yueli was stunned for a moment, and then said with some amusement: “Young Master Mingyan, you really don’t have to worry about me. I just said that if Jing Shaojue dares to come to me, he must be the one who is unlucky! My husband is very strong. I think he will still cherish his life.”","“Young Miss Li, don’t be careless! I know you are very powerful, and the man you are willing to marry is definitely not bad. However, behind Jing Shaojue is the entire White Tiger Clan. His brother Jing Shaoyuan is the number one master of the generation of the White Tiger Clan, and has the strength to compete for the top three in the God Realm’s Grand Meet. If you offend him, even if you are from the top forces of the human race, you will not be able to please!”","Seeing that Huang Yueli was a human, An Mingyan deduced that her husband was also a human cultivator.","No matter how talented a human cultivator was, he can’t afford to offend the Ancient God Clan.","He had good intentions, and was grateful to Huang Yueli for saving their team’s spot in the competition this time, so he tried his best to persuade her.","Seeing that Huang Yueli couldn’t explain this clearly, she could only falter and haw a few times before dismissing An Mingyan.","“Alright, the eye-obscuring guy has left, we should continue on the road, right? How are your injuries recovering?”","Huang Yueli walked to the edge of the forest and glanced at the few people who retreated just now.","These people all looked up at her in a daze, unable to say a word, obviously they hadn’t recovered from the shock just now.","After a while, Meng Qixing finally recovered his voice, but his speech was still intermittent.","“You...you...Young Miss Li...you really...ahem, really defeated Young Master Shaojue just now?! But...”","An Mingyan coughed twice and interrupted him, “But what? Didn’t you guys see it with your own eyes? Are you still asking this kind of question? Are you still doubting Young Miss Li’s strength?”","“No, no, no... how could we doubt Young Miss Li’s strength!” Meng Qixing shook his head like a rattle.","However, it was because they saw it with their own eyes that they were even more surprised.","Especially him. He personally fought against Jing Shaojue just now, but he was defeated in one move."]},{"number":4114,"title":"Chapter 4114 Really Misjudged! (10)","paragraphs":["4114 Really Misjudged! (10)","Moreover, when Jing Shaojue dealt with him, he obviously didn’t care, he just waved his hand casually.","But even so, he was completely unable to bear the unparalleled profound force, and he almost could not hold on and was defeated.","There was no suspense in the defeat, and there was not even a chance to delay for a while!","He never dreamed that Jing Shaojue, who seemed so powerful and invincible, could not even contend three moves before Huang Yueli!","In fact, what Meng Qixing didn’t know was that Huang Yueli was already deliberately suppressing her own cultivation, and she was very restrained in her actions.","Otherwise, Jing Shaojue probably wouldn’t be able to even take a slap from her!","It took a lot of effort for the other cultivators to accept this fact.","While everyone was resting, An Mingyan walked to the edge of the forest, observed the terrain, and walked back.","“It doesn’t feel very safe here, the concealment is too poor, and it’s easy to be discovered by others. We can’t spend the night here, so let’s hurry up!”","After he finished his opinion, he suddenly changed the subject and looked at Huang Yueli, “Young Miss Li, what do you think?”","Although he still wears the title of captain, An Mingyan has already started to ask Huang Yueli for her opinion before making a decision.","For the strongest in the team, their opinions had always been the most important.","An Mingyan did this entirely out of instinct.","And the other people in the team were not dissatisfied at all, they all looked at Huang Yueli together, waiting for her to make the final decision.","Huang Yueli nodded, “Alright, it’s getting late, we have to hurry up before we leave.”","As soon as she finished speaking, everyone immediately stood up and prepared to move.","Even Meng Yue’er, who had always disliked her and made all kinds of criticisms, stood up reluctantly.","After the previous group fight, although Meng Yue’er looked at Huang Yueli with admiration, she actually hated Huang Yueli even more.","Because she could tell that An Mingyan looked at Huang Yueli with a little more enthusiasm than before. If Meng Yue’er was dissatisfied with her only because she suspected Huang Yueli was interested in An Mingyan before the group fight, then now, she can already believe that it is An Mingyan who has thoughts about Huang Yueli!","Of course, it is the instinct of the Ancient God Clan to love the strong, and she can’t change anything, but she will still secretly scolded her in her heart.","“What’s the matter? Even my brother was fooled by that woman! She’s actually not that powerful at all, and it’s not because of how strong she is in fighting that she can defeat Jing Shaojue. I think it’s because Shaojue fell for her. Her beauty trick will only fail if she underestimates the enemy. Tsk tsk, how could even Young Master Mingyan be tricked by her!”","“However, let her be proud for a few days. After we reach the central area, we will encounter more and more opponents. Her beauty trap will not work sooner or later!”","It’s a pity that Meng Yue’er’s curse never came true.","After defeating Jing Shaojue’s team, their team seemed to have been favoured by the goddess of luck.","Walking all the way towards the central area, during the several days of travelling on the way, they did not encounter a strong team challenge again.","Occasionally, they ran into provocations from a few short-sighted teams, but the difference in strength was too great.","Just Meng Qixing and the others dismissed them, not even An Mingyan made a move, let alone Huang Yueli.","Just like that, on the fifth day of the competition, their team arrived at the centre of Paradise Island."]},{"number":4115,"title":"Chapter 4115 Another Woman Without Dignity (1)","paragraphs":["4115 Another Woman Without Dignity (1)","The central area, as the name suggests, was an open space with a radius of about ten miles in the centre of Paradise Island.","And outside this open space, there was a dense forest.","As the poisonous mist gradually spreads, it won’t be long before the central area will become the safest place on Paradise Island.","At the same time, it will be the most dangerous and fiercest place to fight.","Without the shelter of the forest, cultivators fighting in the central area don’t even have an obstacle to hide from. Every battle will be very fast and intense.","Only the real strong can only be revealed under such circumstances.","Walking to the edge of the woods, everyone in the team stopped walking when they saw that the central area was within reach.","An Mingyan turned to look at Huang Yueli, “Young Miss Li, the central area is ahead, what are your plans?”","Huang Yueli blinked her eyes, “What else can I plan? We’ve already arrived at this place, our team should be disbanded, right? After all, everyone has their own clans and influence, so there must be cultivators from the same clan waiting here .”","“That’s right, Young Miss Li, it seems that you are very familiar with the God Realm’s Grand Meet!” An Mingyan smiled and said, “When we get to the central area, we are indeed going to join our clan’s forces, but I was wondering if you would you like to go with me to the White Fen Clan?”","“White Fen Clan? But I’m not a member of the White Fen Clan?” Huang Yueli was a little surprised.","An Mingyan explained: “I may be a little offensive by saying this, but... I don’t know which major force of the humans you are a disciple of, but no matter which force it is, it is very difficult to survive the final stage of the elimination round!”","“You should know that there are not many masters of the humans, and there are so many forces, and the relationship is complicated. Until the last moment, The Ancient God Clans will attack the human cultivators and eliminate them first! If you follow your own forces, the possibility of passing the elimination round is very small, even if you are so strong, it is still very dangerous, I am not scaring you!”","“However, if you are willing, I can take you to the White Fen Clan. As a cultivator of the White Fen Clan, other Ancient God Clans will show mercy to you. As long as there are no accidents, you will be able to pass the elimination round. You saved me and my two clansmen, our White Fen Clan also knows how to repay their kindness.”","After listening to An Mingyan’s remarks, Huang Yueli finally understood.","Daring... An Mingyan was afraid that she would be eliminated and wanted to help her.","She smiled and shook her head, “No need, Young Master Mingyan, there is really no need! Don’t worry, I will definitely pass the elimination round. We will be separated after we leave the forest. We will see each other again if we are destined.”","Seeing her resolute attitude, An Mingyan frowned, knowing that she couldn’t be persuaded, so he could only give up.","The six people got out of the forest, they waved goodbye to each other, and walked towards their respective forces.","Huang Yueli stood on the sidelines and observed for a while, and found that in this land, the human race and the god race were clearly divided into two parts.","The Ancient God Clans occupied the three directions of South, East and West.","Each Ancient God Clan has established its own camp, with clear boundaries, and the camps are very neat. There are people patrolling the gates, and their own clan emblems were displayed, so that the clansmen who come to meet can recognize them at a glance.","But the human clan was completely different."]},{"number":4116,"title":"Chapter 4116 Another Woman Without Dignity (2)","paragraphs":["4116 Another Woman Without Dignity (2)","The number of humans was obviously more, but they could only occupy the Northmost corner.","Except for a few big forces, the other human clans could only set up tents in the fringe area, which looked very chaotic.","However, Huang Yueli did notice that the camps of the powerful human forces in the middle looked very organised, but they were not as extravagant as the ones of the Ancient God Clans, and everything else was pretty much the same.","“Such a force should be able to cultivate a few amazing talented cultivators, right? I don’t know if we will meet in the finals.”","After the several people in the team separated from each other, An Mingyan and the others turned left without hesitation and walked towards the camp of the Ancient God Clan.","Out of curiosity, Huang Yueli looked at the human camp a few more times.","When the humans saw her, the eyes of the cultivators at the gates of the major forces lit up.","Although Huang Yueli suppressed her own strength, she was definitely considered a top genius among the humans.","Moreover, she was still such a stunning beauty!","It aroused discussions among those cultivators on the spot, and soon someone even walked towards her and spoke to her.","“This Lady, may I know which faction you are from? Is it Heaven’s Crest Pagoda, or Myriad Demon Thorp? Your cultivation seems to be quite strong, is it close to the Heart Profound Realm?”","“This Lady, did you come here with cultivators from the Ancient God Clan just now? Why are you with them?”","“Seeing that you are alone, are you a descendant of a hermit strongman? If you don’t belong to any power, why not join us?”","“Uh, this, ahem...”","Huang Yueli was speechless for a while, not knowing how to answer.","If she had known earlier, she wouldn’t have been so curious. She had to be curious and looked around, but now she did not know what to do.","At this time, Meng Yue’er, who had already walked to the gate of the Ice Snake Clan’s camp, also heard the movement not far away, so she simply stopped and turned her head to look over.","She couldn’t help but sneered, “Tsk tsk, the human clan is after all the human clan! Although she pretended so much along the way, she still doesn’t show her original shape now? She can only hang out with the people of the human clan. I think she will be eliminated sooner or later!”","Hearing it from the side, Meng Qixing couldn’t help frowning and stopped her, “Yue’er, what are you talking about? Young Miss Li helped us a lot along the way, how can you talk like that?”","Meng Yue’er looked unwilling, “Where did I say something wrong? That’s the truth!”","Along the way, she never saw Huang Yueli pleasing to her eyes.","However, after automatically defeating Jing Shaojue, all the cultivators in the team respected Huang Yueli very much, and she didn’t dare to speak ill of Huang Yueli publicly, so she could only hold back.","After holding back for several days, she finally couldn’t bear it anymore.","At this moment, Huang Yueli finally avoided the cultivators surrounding her, and walked towards the Ancient God Clan area.","Seeing this, Meng Yue’er couldn’t help but walk out, stopped in front of her, and sneered.","“What’s the matter? Li Yuehuang, didn’t you swear just now that you don’t need Young Master Mingyan to help you? Now you’re back on your word? It seems that you finally understand that you are just a human clan. If you want to pass the elimination round, you have to ask our Ancient God Clans to come out to help you!”","Huang Yueli was startled, and glanced at Meng Yue’er, “It’s none of your business, get out of the way!”","Meng Yue’er sneered and said, “I won’t let you go. I won’t let you go to Young Master Mingyan, it will only hurt him! Even if he is the object of the family’s efforts to cultivate, but if you, from the human clan insist to stick your thick face along, you will still have to pass through his clan and also cause him to offend his own clan!”"]},{"number":4117,"title":"Chapter 4117 Another Woman Without Dignity (3)","paragraphs":["4117 Another Woman Without Dignity (3)","Hearing this, Huang Yueli was extremely surprised, and then burst out laughing.","“I said...Meng Yue’er, are you thinking too much? Why did I go to the camp of the Ancient God Clans to join An Mingyan? Could it be that you really want to go to the camp of the White Fen Clan, but unfortunately they didn’t invite you? Are you disappointed?”","“You...!” Meng Yue’er was stabbed in the sore spot by her words, and her expression turned a little ferocious.","“If you don’t look for Young Master Mingyan, who else can you look for? You are just a human clan, even if you have some strength, but you don’t know how many people like you are in our God Clans! Who will take you seriously? Young Master Mingyan has a good heart, so he wants to give you a hand.”","Meng Yue’er’s face was full of disdain, she didn’t believe Huang Yueli’s words at all, and felt that she was just being stubborn.","Huang Yueli shrugged, “It doesn’t seem to be your business, does it? Are you going to let me go? Do you want to fight with me here? I made it clear in advance that we are no longer teammates, but competing for places to appear competitors. It is reasonable for me to knock you out directly.”","Meng Yue’er’s expression changed all of a sudden.","Although she looked down on Huang Yueli’s background and belittled Huang Yueli in various ways, but if she really wanted to fight Huang Yueli, she would never have the guts.","Even Jing Shaojue fell into this woman’s hands inadvertently. How could she, Meng Yue’er, be her opponent?","Seeing Meng Yue’er’s aggrieved face, unable to speak, Huang Yueli smiled coldly, walked over while brushing past her.","Meng Yue’er felt extremely uncomfortable, and couldn’t accept that she was so ignored by a human!","“Damn bitch, I want to see what kind of power you can gain if you don’t go to the White Fen Clan! The thighs of the Ancient Gods are not as easy as you think.”","Meng Yue’er stared at Huang Yueli’s back without blinking her eyes.","Actually, she was not the only one staring at Huang Yueli.","Regardless of whether it was the Ancient God Clan’s camp or the Human Clan camp, there were countless pairs of eyes on Huang Yueli, watching her every move.","This was a very competitive arena. Every newcomer entering the centre will be scrutinised by the major forces, guessing and judging their strength.","And Huang Yueli was particularly eye-catching.","At a young age, her strength doesn’t look weak, and she was expected to be among the top 1,000 seed players entering the semi-finals.","Besides, she was so beautiful, enough to make all male cultivators want to move.","Everyone was very curious, wanting to know which faction such a beauty with both talents and looks belonged to.","Huang Yueli walked around Meng Yue’er, looked up at the direction, and walked towards the south.","There, stands the largest camp in the entire central area, and it also had the best facing.","Although everyone was from the Ancient God Clan, the area occupied by the Cloudy Qilin Clan was more than double that of other Ancient God Clans! Moreover, it also occupies the geomantic treasure land in the south.","There was not only the highest concentration of heaven and earth profound energy, but also the only spring in the central area.","The Cloudy Qilin Clan was so domineering and arrogant, but even the most hot-tempered White Tiger Clan, no one dares to jump out and fart.","Because, everyone knows that right now, in this camp, lives the only god-level genius in the God Realm——Li Moying!","On Paradise Island, where only cultivators under the age of 50 can enter, he was the well-deserved number one master."]},{"number":4118,"title":"Chapter 4118 Another Woman Without Dignity (4)","paragraphs":["4118 Another Woman Without Dignity (4)","Moreover, maybe the top masters of other Ancient God Clan may not be able to compete with him.","In the God Realm where the strong are respected, it is not an exaggeration for a strong man like Li Moying to receive any special treatment.","Huang Yueli glanced at the surrounding environment roughly, and immediately understood. She couldn’t help but curl her lips up.","Her husband was becoming more and more like he was in the lower realm back then, very strong and domineering.","However, she just likes him like this.","Huang Yueli walked straight towards the camp of the Cloudy Qilin Clan. The cultivators around thought she had gone the wrong way, but after seeing her steady pace, they realised that she was really going to join the Cloudy Qilin Clan!","For a while, many people showed disdain.","“Tsk tsk, another one who actually wants to find the protection of the Cloudy Qilin Clan again... These people are too whimsical, right? The Cloudy Qilin Clan is indeed very powerful now, but there is no shortage of masters at all, and all cats and dogs go there to defect, don’t they ever think why should they accept them?”","“That’s right! Probably another woman who wants to hook up with Young Master Li just because of her beauty?”","“To be honest, this little girl is indeed very beautiful, but just because of this, do you want a peerless genius like Young Master Li to look at her differently? That is thinking too much! What kind of woman has Young Master Li not seen? Hmph, how did she think she could get into his eyes?”","“Isn’t it? Besides, now is an important moment for the God Realm’s Grand Meet. How could Young Master Li delay the business because of women?”","Seeing that Huang Yue was only a few steps away from the camp of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, all the cultivators showed playful smiles on their faces.","Meng Yue’er was even more excited. She didn’t even blink her eyes, just waiting to see Huang Yueli be chased away by the guards of the Cloudy Qilin Clan.","“Unexpectedly, this Young Miss Li is even more stupid than I imagined! It’s not good for her to go to any faction, and she wants to go to the Cloudy Qilin Clan! She will soon know how to write the word ‘shame’!”","Under the gaze of everyone, Huang Yueli stopped at the gate of the Cloudy Qilin Clan’s camp.","“It’s going to happen, it’s going to happen!”","Meng Yue’er looked excited.","In the end, she saw the young cultivators at the entrance of the Cloudy Qilin Clan’s camp, all of them standing up straight.","Then, they neatly bowed towards Huang Yueli and saluted at the same time.","“Young Miss Li!”","Li Tianyi, the most important guard around Li Moying, had a respectful expression on his face, and told Huang Yueli: “Young Madam, the Young Master has been waiting for you for a long time, and has been very worried about you. If you don’t come soon, he will go out to find you himself!”","Huang Yueli raised the corners of her lips and shook her head, “He just likes to make a fuss. Why worry about me? Paradise Island is full of young cultivators, who can do anything to me?”","Li Tianyi agreed with Huang Yueli’s words, but he didn’t dare to respond casually, so he could only laugh wryly: “Young Madam, don’t say that, the Young Master loves you so much that he is always worried about you.”","“That’s right.” Huang Yueli thought that she would soon see her Husband who had been separated for several days, and a smile appeared on her delicate face, “Is Moying in the camp? Hurry up and take me to see him!”","She followed Li Tianyi into the camp of the Cloudy Qilin Clan.","The cultivators who were waiting behind her to see her jokes were all petrified.","Although when Huang Yueli and Li Tianyi were talking, both of them lowered their voices, outsiders couldn’t hear them clearly.","However, at least they all have eyes, and they all saw the cultivators of the Cloudy Qilin Clan saluting to Huang Yueli!"]},{"number":4119,"title":"Chapter 4119 Another Woman Without Dignity (5)","paragraphs":["4119 Another Woman Without Dignity (5)","Which of the cultivators of the Ancient God Clan weren’t arrogant, let alone the Cloudy Qilin Clan who was now in the limelight.","Even the offshoots of the clan, when they see other Ancient God Clan, they can’t wait to turn their nostrils to the sky.","Paradise Island was full of the most outstanding geniuses of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, how could it be possible to show such respect and give such a great gift to a human girl!","What was the identity of that girl? ?","Meng Yue’er’s eyeballs almost fell out after witnessing the scene.","“This... this... how is this possible? She is just a human!”","Meng Qixing glared at his younger sister, and said displeased: “I told you earlier, this Young Miss Li doesn’t look simple, I told you not to mess with her! You still don’t listen to me. Remember now, no matter what Young Miss Li’s identity is, you stay away from her. Otherwise, even I will be implicated by you!”","...","“Dear Husband, the most beautiful, cutest and most understanding lady in your family is here, why don’t you come out to greet her?”","In the camp of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, Li Moying was cultivating in his tent.","Hearing the girl’s sweet voice, he was shocked. He immediately got up and walked out with big strides.","Huang Yueli threw herself into his arms and said excitedly, “Moying, do you miss me?”","Li Moying looked at the delicate face of his beloved in his arms, her dole eyes staring at him, her gaze full of admiration for him.","His gaze became deeper, and a smile flashed in his eyes.","He wrapped his arms around Huang Yueli’s slender waist, hugged her tightly, and lowered his head to kiss her slightly blushed face.","“Well, I’ve been missing you.”","Hearing her husband’s deep and sexy voice say such words, even Huang Yueli with a thick skin feels a little hot on her face, so she quickly buried her face in Li Moying’s chest. At the same time, she took the opportunity to rub her face and took some liberties.","The guards following the two of them all had expressions of being struck by lightning.","They all regretted it very much. Why did they follow the Young Madam to be courteous when they had nothing to do, and they insisted on sending her in!","What were they going to do now? They’ve been abused miserably by the Young Master and Young Madam with such public display of affection.","Ughh, it felt as if their eyes were going to go blind!","After getting close for a while, Li Moying let go of the lady in his arms slightly, and scanned her carefully from tip to toe.","“Little Li’er, why did it take you so long to come here? Did something happen on the way?” He frowned.","Seeing his worried expression, Huang Yueli quickly shook her head, “It’s all right, it’s just that I was unlucky. When I randomly teleported, I was teleported to the edge of Paradise Island. It’s really a bit far to come here. However, everything went well on the way.”","Although she still saw a few flies like Jing Shaojue along the way, she really didn’t pay attention to these people.","After hearing this, Li Moying confirmed that she was indeed unscathed, so he was relieved.","“That’s good. Now that you’ve reached the central area, you should take a good rest and adjust your state. On the last day, there will definitely be a big fight!”","“Yeah, I know!” Huang Yueli nodded repeatedly, not afraid at all, but rather excited.","Regardless of the fact that Li Moying is in charge of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, no one dares to mess with them now.","However, on the last day of the competition, the situation will definitely be different.","There are only a thousand places to pass the elimination round, and cultivators from so many forces were eyeing them."]},{"number":4120,"title":"Chapter 4120 Another Woman Without Dignity (6)","paragraphs":["4120 Another Woman Without Dignity (6)","Although Li Moying was powerful, he was only one person after all, and it was impossible to take care of everyone in the Cloudy Qilin Clan.","After all, there’s only one chance for everyone to compete in the God Realm’s Grand Meet!","In order to get a higher ranking, everything will be thrown in!","Li Moying watched his little fox’s busy eyes which kept darting around, and could completely guess what she was thinking. He raised his hand to pinch the tip of her small nose, and shook his head helplessly.","“I know, you’ve wanted to move for a long time. However, you’d better take it easy when the time comes, you don’t want to reveal your identity in the elimination round, do you?”","Huang Yueli murmured: “Got it! Why are you making me sound like some kind of a violent person? I don’t like fighting, it’s because others insist on coming to trouble me, I have no choice...”","Li Moying chortled.","His little fox seldom takes the initiative to attack, but her mouth was too vicious. If anyone offends her, that person would definitely be ridiculed severely, making that person so angry that he or she could not help but want to hit someone.","He doesn’t know if she did it on purpose.","Li Moying brought his wife back to the tent, originally intending to continue to cultivate.","However, when the geniuses of the Cloudy Qilin Clan heard that the future Young Madame had arrived at the camp, they rushed over to pay their respects one after another.","Although the status of these young cultivators in the family was quite high, compared with Young Master Li, they were still far behind.","More importantly, the matter between Huang Yueli and Li Moying was only recently reported.","These cultivators have never had the chance to meet this legendary future Young Madame.","Out of politeness and awe on the one hand, and out of curiosity on the other hand, Huang Yueli was completely reduced to the object of onlookers.","After everyone came, they all stared at Huang Yueli fiercely, and after watching, they all had expressions of admiration.","Huang Yueli’s expression became increasingly ugly.","Seeing that his little fox was about to go mad, Li Moying coughed heavily: “Alright, you have already met Young Miss Li. We still have to cultivate next, you can go.”","The cultivators who were overwhelmed by Huang Yueli’s beauty just woke up like a dream, and hurriedly said goodbye and left.","They couldn’t wait to go far, and as soon as they stepped out of the gate, they couldn’t help discussing secretly.","“Listen to you talking nonsense here! I heard from my grandfather that Young Miss Li is a god-level genius of real value, and she matches the Young Master very well in every way. It’s a match made in heaven!”","“I really envy the Young Master for being able to find such a lady.”","“Speaking of which, the Young Master drove us away in such a hurry, and even said that he wanted to ‘cultivate’ with Young Miss Li, hehe, wouldn’t it be that kind of cultivation?”","Although they had lowered their voices, how could Huang Yueli and Li Moying’s five senses which were so keen not hear them?","At first, Li Moying was quite happy when he heard them praise his wife.","But when he heard the end, his expression changed, “These little bastards! They really deserve a beating! Tianyi, go grab that kid and beat him up!”"]},{"number":4121,"title":"Chapter 4121 Another Woman Without Dignity (7)","paragraphs":["4121 Another Woman Without Dignity (7)","Because of Liu Buyan’s slanderous words, for more than a month he was nowhere close to being able to enjoy “that kind of cultivation”!","He really didn’t have any vision at all, and he had to step on the Young Master’s pain all at once.","Being beaten up was not wrong at all!","...","For the next day and night, Huang Yueli and Li Moying quietly cultivated in the tent.","Of course it was not “that kind of cultivation”, but a serious meditation to gather Qi and adjust the flow of profound energy in the body.","The final day of the competition is about to enter. Although it is impossible for them to be eliminated, it was not so difficult to protect so many people from the Cloudy Qilin Clan.","Sure enough, in the early morning of the seventh day, before dawn, Li Tianyi hurried out of the tent.","He didn’t dare to come in and disturb the two of them, for fear that he would bump into something he shouldn’t have seen, so he could only speak respectfully outside.","“Young Master, Young Madam, it’s not good! Something happened!”","Li Moying suddenly opened his eyes, “What’s the matter?”","Li Tianyi said: “Just now, a flare was raised in the southeast direction. It seems that members of our Cloudy Qilin Clan are in danger and are asking for help from the experts of the clan.”","A powerful force like the Ancient God Clan would equip their cultivators with items such as signal flares before they entered Paradise Island. Once they were in danger, they could contact each other and rescue each other.","However, in most cases, such things were simply psychological comfort and wouldn’t play much role.","After all, if the two sides were separated by hundreds of miles, even if they saw the signal, they would never be able to rush there in time. Moreover, if they weren’t strong enough, they might not be rescued, but themselves might get dragged down instead.","Because of this, when An Mingyan and the others were in distress a few days ago, they didn’t even think about firing a flare.","Because it was really useless.","But the situation is different now.","The poisonous mist keeps spreading, and the area of the safe zone keeps shrinking. The cultivators who can still send out rescue signals at this time must be very close to the central area, and it is estimated that they are only an hour away at most.","If they rush there right away, maybe they could still be saved.","However, after hearing what he said, Li Moying didn’t even lift his eyelids, “If you are willing to save people, you can do it yourself. What does it matter to me?”","“So what?” Li Moying snorted coldly, not paying attention to the Patriarch and Elders at all.","Huang Yueli was sitting cross-legged opposite Li Moying, she was also cultivating just now.","However, as soon as Li Tianyi spoke, she stopped the flow of profound energy and listened to the two of them talking.","Hearing this, she couldn’t help showing some confusion, “Wait, what are you two talking about? Who is this person who sent the rescue signal?”","Hearing Li Tianyi’s hesitation in speaking, she instinctively told her that there must be something wrong with the person who asked for help!","“This...” Li Tianyi quickly closed his mouth, not daring to speak.","A trace of panic also flashed in Li Moying’s eyes, “Ahem, lady, this matter is not important, I don’t plan to save anyone anyway, let’s continue to cultivate.”"]},{"number":4122,"title":"Chapter 4122 Another Woman Without Dignity (8)","paragraphs":["4122 Another Woman Without Dignity (8)","Li Moying wanted to brush off the matter.","“Little Li’er, I feel that the profound energy fluctuations in your body have become stronger again. Has it improved again these days? My wife’s cultivation talent is really too strong.”","However, the more he behaved like this, the more Huang Yueli felt suspicious of him.","She blinked her eyes, fell into contemplation for a while and suddenly understood.","“I see, the person who asked for help...couldn’t be Li Zijun?”","Li Moying almost choked on his own saliva, “Ahem, Little Li’er, how do you know?”","“Why don’t I know?” Huang Yueli glared at him and said angrily: “After this person sent a distress signal, Li Tianyi and the others insisted on coming to you instead of saving the person on their own initiative, this goes to show that the person who called for help is very talented, and the reason that the flare was released is means that the opponent is stronger! This makes your guards feel that only you can save the person. Therefore, the person who calls for help must be a top heaven genius.”","“In addition, I just asked who this person is, and you immediately acted so guilty, which means that this person should be a woman, moreover, she is also a woman who has had conflicts with me.”","“There are only a dozen top heaven-level geniuses in your Cloudy Qilin Clan. Li Zijun is the only one who can meet other requirements, right?”","Li Moying was stunned, then shook his head and sighed, “Oh, I really can’t hide anything from you...”","With such a smart wife, it’s impossible for him to do anything bad.","Of course, he didn’t have any double-mindedness, so he wasn’t afraid of his wife’s supervision.","Huang Yueli lifted her chin, and snorted, “Of course! Besides, who do you think I am? Am I so narrow-minded? Although Li Zijun offended me, but now, after all, she is a heaven-level genius from your Cloudy Qilin Clan. In the elimination round, it will affect your family’s competition results, can I tell you not to save her?”","Li Moying frowned slightly, “Little Li’er, don’t get me wrong. I don’t want to save her, it has nothing to do with you.”","Of course he knows that his little fox has a big heart. To put it bluntly, he won’t take a mere Li Zijun seriously.","Otherwise, it would be impossible for Li Zijun to come to participate in the God Realm’s Grand Meet.","At that time, at the training grounds, Li Shihong had already proposed that Li Zijun’s qualification to participate in the God Realm’s Grand Meet should be disqualified, and she should face the wall for ten years as punishment. It was Huang Yueli who interceded for her so that Li Zijun could stay here.","However, Li Moying himself was upset when he saw Li Zijun.","Dare to bully his wife, did she treat him as a dead person? Still want him to rescue her? Hmph!","Thinking of this, he snorted coldly, “I’m not strong enough, and I’m not wronged if I’m eliminated. How can I save you? Well, Tianyi, you can step back. Wife, let’s continue...”","“Continue? What are we going to continue?!” The corners of Huang Yueli’s mouth twitched.","After hearing this, the people outside thought that the two of them were doing something indescribable in the tent, so they didn’t want to save Li Zijun!","It is estimated that the central area will soon become chaotic."]},{"number":4123,"title":"Chapter 4123 Another Woman Without Dignity (9)","paragraphs":["4123 Another Woman Without Dignity (9)","Only after seeing Huang Yueli standing up neatly and straightening her hair in front of the mirror did Li Moying get up unhurriedly and follow behind his wife.","“Well, if you want to save her, of course I’ll listen to you...” In any case, the wife has the final say in their family, “But...”","“But what?” Huang Yueli turned her head and raised her eyebrows in doubt.","Li Moying sighed, “I think Tianyi and the others came here on purpose. I’m afraid they didn’t want me to save people at all, but wanted you to go.”","“Me?!” Huang Yueli’s eyes widened in surprise, and she pointed to her nose.","Li Moying nodded, “Today is the last day of the competition, and various battles will break out in the central area immediately to eliminate the redundant cultivators. So, I can’t actually leave here. As long as I leave to save people, these clansmen in our camp will definitely become besieged by other Ancient God Clans immediately.”","Originally, without the existence of Li Moying, who is against the sky, the strength of the Cloudy Qilin Clan would be about the same as that of other Ancient God Clans, so it would not be so hated.","But now, they have a god-level genius.","As soon as Li Moying leaves, all the Ancient God Clan will form a group to besiege the Cloudy Qilin Clan, and first eliminate as many of them as possible.","This is also human nature. After all, when Li Moying comes back, they will have nothing to do with the Cloudy Qilin Clan. So, of course, they have to take advantage of this opportunity to act first.","Huang Yueli also understood this truth. As soon as Li Moying said it, she realised it.","However, she didn’t take it seriously at all, and said with a smile: “What’s the big deal? It’s just saving someone.”","With her strength, she could leisurely go around Paradise Island. Saving people was actually effortless. It is nothing more than less time spent in cultivation.","However, Li Moying still had a face full of reluctance, “Why waste time on such idle people? You are my wife, shouldn’t you be with me?”","Huang Yueli looked at his tense side face, shook her head amusingly, leaned over and kissed him quickly on the cheek, and said: “I’ve been with you all day and night! I’ll only leave for an hour, I’ll be back soon!”","With that said, she lifted the curtain in front of the tent door and walked out.","Li Moying’s face was still not very good-looking after being kissed by his wife.","Why did it feel like Huang Yueli sent him away like a kitten or puppy?","Moreover, for some reason, he always felt an ominous premonition, and instinctively didn’t want to be separated from his wife.","But this feeling is really unreasonable. Among the young cultivators on Paradise Island, none of them has the strength to hurt him and Little Li’er.","Going out to save someone was no different from going out for a stroll.","Could it be that he really thought too much?","Li Moying followed Huang Yueli and walked out.","When Li Tianyi saw the two of them, he felt relieved, and exhaled exaggeratedly.","He was really afraid that the Young Madame would be jealous and refused to save Li Zijun!","Although the Young Master didn’t need to explain to others, and he didn’t dare to speak out, but it still affected his prestige in the clan to some extent.","All the cultivators in the camp surrounded them.","Huang Yueli said directly: “I have already told Brother Moying about the matter of someone asking for help. This matter is not difficult to deal with. I will set out to save people now.”"]},{"number":4124,"title":"Chapter 4124 Another Woman Without Dignity (10)","paragraphs":["4124 Another Woman Without Dignity (10)","Li Tianyi and the others had seen the perverse talent and strength of the Young Madame first hand and after hearing what she said, they were relieved and surrounded her to compliment her.","“Young Miss Li, are you really going to save people? How many people are you going to take? Since the Young Master is staying here to sit in command, the camp must be safe. You can bring a few more experts, like Master Tianyi and the others...”","Huang Yueli shook her head, “No need, I can go there by myself, it will be faster.”","She didn’t want to be separated from her husband for too long at all, so she planned to make a quick decision.","“But...Young Miss Li, isn’t it too risky for you to do this?”","“Yes, if something happens to you, how can we explain it to the Young Master?”","“Li Zijun can be regarded as a first-rate genius. There are very few in our clan who can surpass her in strength. Anyone who can drive her into a corner and even send out a signal bomb must be a peerless genius with extraordinary strength. You must not underestimate the enemy!”","Hearing these words, Huang Yueli felt a little helpless, and turned to look at Li Moying, hoping that he could speak for her and clarify.","Unexpectedly, Li Moying also nodded, “You’d better take a few people with you, Tianyi will follow you, and then bring...”","“I don’t need to bring people, they are too slow! Don’t you want me to come back earlier?” Huang Yueli pouted and interrupted him.","She should have known earlier that her husband would make a fuss if she was involved.","Hearing this, all the cultivators present looked at Li Tianyi in astonishment.","The commander of the guards next to the young lord is actually one of the most outstanding geniuses of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, but in the end... Huang Yueli thought he was too slow!","Could it be that the rumours were true, was she really as powerful as the Young Master?","Li Tianyi lowered his head in shame after being stared at by so many people.","Huang Yueli didn’t pay attention that much, she smiled flatteringly at Li Moying, “Alright, I’m leaving now, don’t be upset, I’ll be right back!”","“Alright, be careful on the road.” Li Moying said reluctantly.","“Yeah, I know, I know!”","Huang Yueli waved her hand indifferently, and was about to leave.","“Wait, I’ll send you.” Li Moying grabbed her hand from behind.","Huang Yueli was really speechless, “No need? I’m just heading off somewhere nearby, there’s no need to send me!”","Li Moying took her by the hand and walked outside the camp with her.","Big and small battles were happening everywhere, and the slightly weaker cultivators have been mercilessly eliminated.","Some forces were even completely eliminated, and even the camps were levelled.","The battle was so fierce, but Li Moying’s appearance still attracted the attention of many people.","“Young Master Li...it’s Young Master Li who came out!”","“Is it really Young Master Li? I’ve been here for two days, and this is the first time I’ve seen him come out!”","“Even Young Master Li has appeared. Could it be that the Cloudy Qilin Clan is also preparing to join the battle? But it’s too early, right? Don’t the Ancient God Clans usually wait until the last two hours to make a move?”"]},{"number":4125,"title":"Chapter 4125 Save (1)","paragraphs":["4125 Save (1)","The appearance of Li Moying caused panic.","Many cultivators had reached the point of life-and-death struggle. Seeing him, they couldn’t help but stop in the midst of battle and were on full alert.","Although they knew that it would be useless for them to be on guard against a peerless genius like Li Moying, this was their instinctive reaction.","Li Moying ignored these idlers at all, and kept holding his wife’s little hand tightly, sending her outside the camp before stopping.","“Little Li’er, do you really not need me to accompany you?”","Huang Yueli had tried several times to pull her hand back, but she was unsuccessful.","After finally getting outside, Li Moying not only did not let go, but also said such things.","The corner of her mouth twitched, “Alright, Young Master Li, if you don’t let me go, your clansmen will be lost. When I rush over, maybe even the day lily will be cold!!”","Li Moying took a deep look at her, and then let go of her hand.","At this time, the entire central area was already silent!","Many people still remember the scene when Huang Yueli arrived a day ago.","At that time, this outstanding beauty attracted the attention of various forces. Many powerful human forces wanted to draw her into their camp. However, she declined all of them and walked towards the camp of the Cloudy Qilin Clan without hesitation.","Everyone thought that she would be kicked out on the spot, but in the end, she was invited in respectfully by the guards of the Cloudy Qilin Clan.","At that time, many people were guessing her real identity.","But no matter how they guessed, they couldn’t guess that Huang Yueli was actually Li Moying’s woman!","“I’m going, what... what’s going on here? Am I dreaming? There are so many heaven’s proud girls who have a crush on Young Master Li, and I’ve never seen him look at any of them! Now this is considered What’s going on? You actually hold the girl’s hand and don’t let go??”","“This is too incredible...”","The location that Li Moying randomly teleported to was very close to the central area, so he arrived here on the second day of the competition, and gradually gathered the arrived Cloudy Qilin Clan cultivators, and established a camp.","In fact, before this competition, Li Moying hadn’t shown himself in front of the major forces in the God Realm. Most of the geniuses had never seen him at all.","So, in the beginning, it wasn’t that no one in the central area challenged him.","It’s just that after Li Moying made a thunderous attack, everything calmed down...","In the face of absolute strength, even these arrogant Ancient God Clan geniuses can only bow their heads and admit defeat.","At the same time, many female cultivators also moved their minds, thinking of various ways to get close to Li Moying.","From their point of view, with a peerless genius like Li Moying and such an outstanding personality and appearance, it is worthwhile to follow him even as a concubine.","It’s a pity that no matter how they explicitly hint, Li Moying treats them as if they don’t exist.","After almost all the cultivators from the Cloudy Qilin Clan arrived, they simply stayed in the camp and did not come out.","Now, on the last day of the competition, Young Master Li finally showed up!","However, there was an extra girl beside him, no to mention, the two of them were still so close. Think of Li Moying’s frosty expression when he faced the daughters of various powers a few days ago...","The contrast was so great that it was completely unbelievable. They even thought there was something wrong with their own eyes and recognized the wrong person."]},{"number":4126,"title":"Chapter 4126 Save (2)","paragraphs":["4126 Save (2)","Huang Yueli sensed the gazes of the people around her, guessed the reason, and couldn’t help but smirk.","At this moment, she suddenly felt a tug at her wrist and she was pulled back again.","Li Moying quickly pecked her lips before letting her go.","Huang Yueli was caught off guard, and was successfully attacked. She was a little annoyed immediately, and glared at Li Moying. She threw him away, fully utilised her agility skills and quickly ran into the woods.","And all the cultivators on the scene were already petrified at this time.","For a moment, they even forgot that they were killing each other just now.","“Well I’ll be... What did I see just now? What I saw must be a fake Young Master Li...”","“Before the elimination round started, I heard rumours that Young Master Li already had a fiancée and was born in the human clan. I thought it was someone lying to me. Could it be true?!”","“As Young Master Li, why did he find a human woman as his fiancée? Could it be that he is just like those vulgar ordinary men who only look at appearances?”","“It’s not surprising to just look at the face, right? Since ancient times, heroes have been harmed by beauty, and Young Miss Li is really a stunning beauty...”","Li Moying kept staring at Huang Yueli’s back until he could no longer see her before he reluctantly pulled his gaze away.","But his brows were still furrowed. For some reason, he felt uneasy.","“Young Master?” Li Tianyi reminded him when he saw that he had not moved.","Li Moying said: “You should follow to see if there is any situation, come back and report to me right away.”","“Yes!”","Li Tianyi responded respectfully, turned and left.","...","At the same time, at the periphery of Paradise Island.","Huang Sanbai was walking back and forth with his hands behind his back, with an anxious expression on his face. Standing beside him was Steward Jin with a nervous and cautious expression.","“Steward Jin, have you checked out Li Yuehuang’s situation? It’s already the last day! If this goes on, my plan will come to nothing!”","“Damn it! She has already arrived in the central area! Why didn’t I find her whereabouts a few days earlier? Now, it is impossible for her to come out. Is there really no other way?” Huang Sanbai cursed in frustration.","But who knows, when he really arrived on Paradise Island, things were far from being as simple as he thought beforehand.","Paradise Island was huge, and there were a lot of cultivators on the island, at least hundreds of thousands of people.","Trying to find Huang Yueli among so many people was simply finding a needle in a haystack.","Moreover, they didn’t have much time, only seven days in total.","During these seven days, due to the elimination system of rounding the competitors with the poisonous mist, the closer to the mist, the fewer cultivators and the easier it was to find someone.","However, if Huang Yueli reached the central area before being found, then he would have no chance to make a move.","After all, there were many cultivators in the central area, and the cultivators of the Cloudy Qilin Clan will definitely stand by Huang Yueli’s side.","Even if he makes a move, he may not be able to kill her, and there will be tens of thousands of witnesses."]},{"number":4127,"title":"Chapter 4127 Save (3)","paragraphs":["4127 Save (3)","At that time, even if he wants to turn black into white to justify himself, there would be no way out for him.","It was the last day and he was 99% certain that Huang Yueli had joined Li Moying!","The fact was exactly as he thought and the news brought by Steward Jin just confirmed it.","Although he had a premonition, Huang Sanbai still felt extremely depressed.","“Damn, let this dead girl escape again this time! This is really a big problem. When she leaves here, she will definitely be with people from the Cloudy Qilin Clan every day. Next, the competition will be held in succession. It’s impossible to find another chance. Am I destined to fall into her hands?”","Huang Sanbai was so anxious that he almost fainted.","At this moment, Steward Jin’s eyes lit up suddenly, and he yelled loudly.","“Elder Huang, there is chance, there is a chance! The person I arranged for sent me a voice transmission, saying that Young Miss Li left the central area alone for some reason...”","“What?! There is such a thing?”","The good news came so suddenly, Huang Sanbai couldn’t believe his ears.","Steward Jin nodded, “It should be true. I speculate that she may be going to rescue the trapped cultivators of the Cloudy Qilin Clan. It won’t take long for this to be done, Elder Huang, if you have something to do, I’m afraid Hurry up.”","“I’ll just go there. This time... I really have to trouble you!” Huang Sanbai made a decisive decision without hesitation.","Steward Jin wanted to persuade him a little, but in the end he just let out a long sigh and didn’t speak.","...","Paradise Island.","Huang Yueli carried a token on her body to help her point out the direction of Li Zijun and others.","After leaving the central area, her footsteps were fast, and she arrived in a quarter of an hour where it would take more than half an hour for ordinary geniuses to reach.","From a distance, she heard the clashing sound of weapons.","Violent profound energy fluctuations swept all around, many trees were directly overturned and in some places, even the ground was cracked.","It could be seen at a glance how fierce a battle took place here just now.","Li Zijun took four Cloudy Qilin Clan cultivators and hid behind a towering giant tree, barely resisting the attack from the opposite side.","Li Zijun’s tone was extremely firm, “No, we finally got here, how could we be eliminated just like that! If we didn’t even pass the elimination round, we wouldn’t even rank in the top 1,000? Everyone, hold on! The distress signal has been sent out, and someone will come to rescue us soon!”","With such strength, yet she was eliminated in the elimination round? How could this make her happy?","However, the others weren’t as optimistic as she was.","“Young Miss Zijun, our enemy is... not anyone else but Huang Beicheng, who is also known as the first genius of the Sacred Phoenix Clan! Even Young Miss Leyun was not his opponent at the beginning! Unless the Young Master comes in person, no one will be able to save us. We can only implicate them and be eliminated together!”"]},{"number":4128,"title":"Chapter 4128 Save (4)","paragraphs":["4128 Save (4)","Li Zijun also understood this, but she still held some hope in her heart.","“Then...then at least the Young Master can deal with him! It’s the last day now, most of the clansmen must have reached the central area, and the Young Master must be able to guess that I’m the one who is trapped! I also understand that the enemy before us is powerful and only he can deal with it!”","The girl frowned, but still couldn’t agree with Li Zijun’s point of view.","“But...but...Young Master, if he leaves the central area, it will be bad for the other cultivators in the clan. He will definitely not casually...”","Before she could finish speaking, there was a sneer from the other end of the giant tree.","“I’ve said it before, have you made up your mind? It’s better to come out quickly and go to the poisonous mist by yourself. If it weren’t for the sake of the few of you being women, I would have disabled you a long time ago, and I can still make you struggle until now?”","The person who spoke was a man in his thirties, and his cultivation was already at the middle stage of the Heart Profound Realm.","To be able to achieve such a level of cultivation at this age, his strength was still higher than that of the number one expert of the White Tiger Clan, Jing Shaoyuan!","As soon as he opened his mouth, the next few followers behind him couldn’t wait to flatter him.","“Young Master Beicheng, you really know how to cherish jade. You are so kind, even when facing a woman from the Cloudy Qilin Clan, you are willing to show mercy. You are really admirable!”","“Hehe, isn’t that right? Our Sacred Phoenix Clan has always been kind, which is different from the Cloudy Qilin Clan!”","“I say... Li Zijun, you can be regarded as a beauty, and your strength is not bad, how about you just follow our Young Master Beicheng? I heard that your Young Master Li doesn’t like you at all, so don’t waste your time any further!”","Li Zijun looked ashamed and indignant, “Don’t daydream, the hypocrites of the Sacred Phoenix Clan really make me sick! I will never surrender to you. When the Young Master comes, he will definitely show you some colours! ”","Hearing what she said, Huang Beicheng not only didn’t panic at all, but even laughed out loud.","“At this time, do you think that Li Moying will risk leaving the camp of the Cloudy Qilin Clan for you alone? This notion of yours should be extinguished! Besides, I am not afraid of him coming, but I am afraid that he will not come! Hmph, he’s been hailed as a so-called super genius but he’s just an Ascendant from the Lower Realm, I’ve long wanted to see him!”","The followers also laughed.","Li Zijun’s face flushed with anger.","It was fine for her to be inferior to others, but these people dared to insult the Young Master!","She started to wonder if the Young Master can kill them all with one finger?","After Huang Beicheng persuaded for a long time, Li Zijun didn’t intend to admit defeat, and he finally lost his patience, “Forget it, although I don’t like to attack women, but if you don’t know yourselves, then you can’t blame me.”","With a lift of his right hand, a fire dragon appeared from mid-air, rolling towards Li Zijun and others!","At this moment, Li Zijun was very upset.","Unexpectedly, the geniuses of the Sacred Phoenix Clan were already so strong, but she was only thinking about how to hook up with the Young Master!","Now that the strength gap between the two sides has reached such a degree, could she really be left with no other choice and be eliminated?","“Stop!”","Just then, a sweet voice sounded."]},{"number":4129,"title":"Chapter 4129 Save (5)","paragraphs":["4129 Save (5)","Both sides who were engaged in battle could not react in time.","However, just as his fire dragon rushed in front of Li Zijun, it suddenly seemed to hit a wall, unable to move forward even a metre!","Huang Beicheng’s expression immediately changed.","“What happened?!”","Before he could figure it out, a powerful force rushed towards him. His fire attribute energy couldn’t bear it at all, and he was directly defeated.","Huang Beicheng’s was shocked in his heart as the violent backlash made him spit out a mouthful of blood on the spot and his body was thrown backwards.","“Young Master Beicheng!!”","The cultivators of the Sacred Phoenix Clan all let out a horrified cry as they rushed towards the direction where he landed.","But Li Zijun and the others stood there in a daze for a while, not realising what happened.","The recoil force that Huang Beicheng received was enormous, but as the current number one genius of the Sacred Phoenix Clan, his strength was indeed extraordinary and he used a special technique to shield at the critical moment. Upon landing, the wound he had was not too heavy.","He struggled to get up, stared at the direction of the giant tree, and shouted sharply: “Li Moying! Are you here? Why are you hiding in the corner and making a sneak attack? Do you dare to come out and fight face to face!”","Although at that moment just now, he seemed to have heard a girl’s voice.","However, Huang Beicheng’s first reaction was that the person who fought against him just now was Li Moying!","In his heart, only Li Moying can beat him.","Behind the giant tree, there was a disdainful sneer, “You actually want to confront my husband head-on? Who do you think you are? You deserve to fight him? Hmph!”","Hearing this voice, Huang Beicheng froze for a moment.","It never occurred to him that it was a girl who answered him.","Immediately afterwards, a slender girl stepped out from behind the giant tree.","She was wearing a long flowing dress and walked gracefully. Even though the surrounding dust was whirling around her, her body was still spotless.","She raised her chin slightly and looked towards Huang Beicheng.","The girl in front of him was really beautiful!","This was the aura that only top wood attribute cultivators had.","Huang Beicheng originally claimed to be a romantic young man who cherished jade, but when he saw such a beauty, he even lowered his voice a bit, “This...this lady, may I ask who you are...”","Huang Yueli glanced at him, “Aren’t you going to confront my husband?”","“Your husband...? Are you married?”","Huang Beicheng’s eyeballs almost fell off. After thinking about it, he recalled what Huang Yueli said just now, and was even more shocked.","“You...you and Li Moying...”","At this moment, Li Zijun and the others also came to their senses, and came out from behind the giant tree.","With Huang Yueli, a god-level genius here, they were no longer afraid of Huang Beicheng.","Li Zijun stepped forward and said, “Huang Beicheng, do you think that our Cloudy Qilin Clan has only one god-level genius? Then you are so naive! This Young Miss Li is our Young Master’s fiancée, and she was the one who made the move just now!”","She looked at Huang Yueli with a complicated expression, and couldn’t believe that Huang Yueli would rush over to save her!"]},{"number":4130,"title":"Chapter 4130 Save (6)","paragraphs":["4130 Save (6)","In the Cloudy Qilin Clan, she provoked Huang Yueli several times, and later, she completely offended the future Young Madame in the training place.","Moreover, because she had conflicts with Huang Yueli, many people in the clan did not dare to get close to her, and even deliberately alienated her.","Of course, Li Zijun’s own strength was still very good, so at most, the clan ignored her but no one dared to do anything rude to her.","But for Li Zijun, who has always been the proud daughter of heaven, such kind of vague hostility had already made her very uncomfortable.","Even so, Li Zijun did not dare to complain to Huang Yueli at all.","A god-level genius... She was already in a different world with the others and she could not afford to offend her. If she had known earlier that Huang Yueli was a god-level talent, she would not have had the urge to provoke her.","Besides, Huang Yueli also helped her.","After the gambling in the place of experience, Li Shihong originally wanted to disqualify her from participating in the God Realm’s Grand Meet, but it was Huang Yueli who stopped him.","Otherwise, it would be impossible for Li Zijun to appear on Paradise Island.","Huang Beicheng’s eyes widened, his face was full of astonishment, and he couldn’t even speak.","“Wh... what?! Don’t tell me, the one who made the move just now... is...how is it possible? Isn’t Li Moying’s fiancée a waste who can only brag?”","A few days ago, Li Moying took his fiancée to queue up to sign up, and the rumour that the test array was destroyed in the end has become widely known.","Almost no one believed that Li Moying’s fiancée was a god-level genius. They only thought that his vision was too poor to actually fall in love with such an unreliable woman.","The cultivators of the Sacred Phoenix Clan were gloating even more. They joked about this after every meal and they had already described Li Moying as a brainless man who relied on his lower body to think.","As a result, now listening to what Li Zijun said... Could it be that Li Moying’s fiancée was really a god-level genius? ?","How can this be?","Huang Beicheng stared at Huang Yueli, his mind already full of violent storms.","After thinking about it, he still felt that Li Zijun’s words could not be true.","Probably because Li Moying didn’t come, they were afraid that he would continue to attack, so they deliberately made up such words, trying to scare him away!","If he really left because of Li Zijun’s words, he would really become the laughing stock of the Cloudy Qilin Clan!","Thinking of this, Huang Beicheng sneered, “What you said sounds convincing, even I almost believed it. Unfortunately, I am not a fool, how could I believe such outrageous things? Don’t try to lie to me. You must be eliminated today!”","Just now when Huang Yueli came back from the shock, he attributed his failure to being too careless and being attacked by surprise.","Li Zijun’s complexion became ugly, unable to bear such power.","Huang Yueli pulled her behind her, stood up and faced Huang Beicheng, a trace of coldness flashed in her eyes.","“That’s not necessarily the case!”"]},{"number":4131,"title":"Chapter 4131 No One Can Save You (1)","paragraphs":["4131 No One Can Save You (1)","The profound pressure around Huang Yueli’s body suddenly soared.","The wood energy collided heavily with the fire energy of Huang Beicheng.","There was a deafening explosion!","The violent vibration knocked the cultivators with lower cultivation levels in the two teams to the ground, rendering them unable to get up for a long time.","Huang Beicheng’s face suddenly became extremely pale.","Under the impact of Huang Yueli’s profound energy, even though he had tried his best, he still couldn’t stabilise at all. He retreated several hundred steps in succession before he fell down on the ground.","Several bones in his body were broken, his meridians were also injured and the corners of his mouth were bleeding.","“You, you...”","Huang Beicheng clutched his chest, his whole body was throbbing violently, and his mind was even buzzing.","The serious injury of the body was secondary, the more serious trauma came from the mind.","Huang Beicheng has always boasted that he was one of the most outstanding geniuses in the God Realm.Even for Li Moying who was a god-level genius from the Cloudy Qilin Clan, he still was faintly unconvinced in his heart. He always felt that the gap between the two sides could not be as big as the rumours said. If they were to engage in a face to face battle, maybe he was even better!","But who knows, he hasn’t even seen Li Moying’s face now, and he fell into the hands of such a weak and slender girl.","“How is it possible? You...how can you be so strong?!”","Huang Yueli glanced at him, then said lightly, “Strong? It’s not that I’m strong, it’s that you are too weak.”","In order to avoid revealing her identity in front of Li Zijun and the others, she deliberately used the wood attribute to fight against Huang Beicheng this time.","Her wood attribute talent was nothing more than a heavenly level, and she usually practices casually, mainly for the convenience of alchemy.","When she made the move just now, she was still a little worried, for fear that she would lose out.","Fortunately, the result was still satisfactory to her.","After hearing her words, Huang Beicheng vomited another mouthful of blood on the spot.","This time it wasn’t because of the injury, it was purely out of anger.","He has always been more sympathetic to the fairer sex, and he doesn’t like to attack women. It’s not because he respects women, but because he thinks women are weak. Even with the same talent, he still feels that female cultivators were weaker than male cultivators.","The cultivators of the Sacred Phoenix Clan around Huang Beicheng showed horrified expressions one after another.","This news was simply too terrifying.","What should the Sacred Phoenix Clan do in the future? Wouldn’t it be that there will never be a bright future?","Of course, they were the most unlucky ones.","Falling into the hands of Cloudy Qilin Clan cultivators, they didn’t know how the other party will torture them...","“What are you standing there for? Hurry up and get out into the poisonous mist, lest I have to do it myself.” Huang Yueli curled her lips.","Hearing this, all the cultivators of the Sacred Phoenix Clan were taken aback.","This girl actually let them go? Is there a mistake? Why don’t you beat them up and humiliate them first or something?","Huang Yueli glanced at them strangely, “What? Do you really want me to do it myself?”","“No, no, no...” Several people shook their heads hastily, helped up Huang Beicheng that had fallen to the ground, and were about to leave.","But at this moment, Huang Yueli suddenly felt that danger was approaching.","The next moment, an astonishingly fierce aura rushed towards her back!"]},{"number":4132,"title":"Chapter 4132 No One Can Save You (2)","paragraphs":["4132 No One Can Save You (2)","This force was so powerful that the hairs on Huang Yueli’s back stood on end.","However, the cultivator behind her was determined to take her life, and followed her closely like a shadow.","Seeing that she avoided the most sudden first attack, the opponent made a second move and a third move...","There were bursts of screams from around.","“Young Miss Li!”","“This... what’s the situation?”","“Who is it? Young Miss Li, quick, run away!”","Huang Yueli turned a deaf ear and concentrated all her attention on dodging the opponent’s attack while looking for opportunities to counterattack.","The strength of the other party far exceeded her expectations, but fortunately she was now in a forest with complex terrain, and she skillfully used these trees to cover her and deal with the attacker behind her.","She didn’t know how far she ran, and the screams of Li Zijun and others behind her could not be heard, so she found an opportunity to seize the opponent’s opening, and the long sword suddenly thrust out, hitting the opponent’s chest!","The man let out a muffled snort, and quickly backed away, dodging Huang Yueli’s back move.","However, Huang Yueli was able to take this opportunity to turn around and see her attacker clearly.","This person was wearing a black robe. His whole body was wrapped in black cloth, even his face was covered by black cloth, only his eyes were exposed.","“Who are you?” Huang Yueli snapped.","However, the other party did not answer. After a pause, he continued to attack her.","This time, Huang Yueli was on guard, she was not as embarrassed as before, and formally fought the opponent with a few tricks.","However, she soon realised that something was wrong. This person’s strength was really too strong!","If it was outside Paradise Island, she might not be the opponent’s opponent at all, because from this short fight, she could feel that the opponent was at least a strong person above the middle stage of the Dao Profound Realm.","Fortunately, now that they were affected by the Paradise Island array, their cultivation had been suppressed to the early stage of the Heart Profound Realm, so Huang Yueli was able to fight with each other.","Huang Yueli quickly looked around, making sure that Li Zijun, Huang Beicheng and the others had been left behind, and then a strong fire attribute energy burst out quickly, and counterattacked towards the opponent!","And the enemy on the other side obviously didn’t want to hide their strength anymore.","The two sides were evenly matched, and each took a few steps back, staring at each other.","“Haha, Huang Yueli, we meet again! You are indeed a smart person.” Seeing that his identity had been exposed, Huang Sanbai simply tore off the black cloth on his face.","After thinking about it for a while, Huang Yueli understood the cause and effect, “You actually managed to sneak into the Paradise Island Array just to kill me? Why, the last plan to sow discord didn’t work, you have nothing to do, so you can only take risks like this? Do you think you can cover up what you did by killing me? Don’t forget, this is Floating Sea! Do you think the Island Master is a dead man?”","Huang Sanbai sneered and said: “I don’t need to bother you. Your current identity is Li Moying’s fiancée. As long as I can kill you, I will become a hero of the Sacred Phoenix Clan. The Patriarch will naturally use the power of the whole clan to protect me. Tell me, can the Island Master still be an enemy of the entire Sacred Phoenix Clan?”"]},{"number":4133,"title":"Chapter 4133 No One Can Save You (3)","paragraphs":["4133 No One Can Save You (3)","Huang Yueli’s face darkened, “Elder Sanbai is really calculating! Even I can’t help but admire you.”","The Floating Sea has strict rules and regulations. The Island Master has controlled the Floating Sea for many years with absolute strength and strong means.","Therefore, she really never thought beforehand that Huang Sanbai would actually have such abilities and be able to sneak into Paradise Island.","The person who let him in would most probably die, she even wondered what kind of relationship was it that made that person take such a big risk to help him.","However, it was pointless to pursue this.","Huang Sanbai showed a haughty look on his face, “The matter has come to this point, it is useless for you to resist any longer. You should hurry up and capture it! As long as you obediently cooperate with me and hand over Empyrean Foxang Jue, I will naturally give you a good time.”","Huang Yueli sneered coldly, “You have a good idea, but unfortunately... this is Paradise Island, even if you are a strong person in the middle stage of the Dao Profound Realm, you can’t show your full strength, do you really think you can kill me? ”","Huang Sanbai couldn’t help but raise his head and laughed loudly.","“Huang Yueli, you are too naive to think like this. The strength of Dao Profound Realm cultivators is not only reflected in their cultivation! Even if you are a god-level genius, you are still too young after all, don’t think...”","Before he finished speaking, he suddenly felt a silver light flash in front of his eyes, and hurriedly backed away.","It turned out that while he was speaking, Huang Yueli flipped her fingers, and the long sword had already stabbed out without a sound.","After all, Huang Sanbai was a cultivator in the Dao Profound Realm, and his movement and reaction was very fast, hence he avoided the vital parts in time.","However, he was still stabbed in the shoulder by Huang Yueli. This time, she struck fast and hard, leaving a wound that was deep enough to see the bones, and blood kept gushing out.","Huang Sanbai’s face changed abruptly. The complacency just now was like a slap on his face.","He was in pain, as shame and anger filled him, making the ferocity hidden in the depths of his heart explode.","“Damn girl, you actually dare to sneak attack! Hmph, I’ll let you see the true strength of Dao Profound Realm cultivators right now!”","Huang Sanbai tightly held the long sword with his right hand, and gestured with his left hand, and the rich profound energy of heaven and earth began to surge towards him.","Huang Yueli’s expression also became serious.","It has been hundreds of years since Huang Sanbai stepped into the Dao Profound Realm, and it was definitely not comparable to ordinary cultivators who have just entered the Dao Profound Realm.","Even if the cultivation base is the same, Huang Sanbai has cultivated for many years and has mastered a large number of top-level profound skills of the Sacred Phoenix Clan, and his strength was extraordinary.","Moreover, what worries Huang Yueli the most is that Huang Sanbai looks too confident!","She didn’t think that Huang Sanbai would be so stupid.","His strength has been suppressed to the early stage of the Heart Profound Realm, and he dare not say that he was 100% sure of defeating Huang Yueli, let alone his current goal is to kill her!","Therefore, Huang Yueli speculated that Huang Sanbai must have some other cards in his hand.","It’s just that, at this moment, she racked her brains and couldn’t figure out what the hole card was.","When Huang Yueli was distracted for a moment, she was hit by Huang Sanbai, her chest burst with blood, and she almost vomited blood.","She quickly got rid of distracting thoughts, focused, and dealt with Huang Sanbai’s attack.","The two quickly went through dozens of moves, and Huang Yueli gradually gained the upper hand.","As time went by, Huang Sanbai’s face became more and more ugly, and he was extremely shocked!","He never expected that Huang Yueli’s strength would improve so quickly!","The first time the two fought against each other was only half a year ago."]},{"number":4134,"title":"Chapter 4134 No One Can Save You (4)","paragraphs":["4134 No One Can Save You (4)","At that time, Huang Yueli had just ascended to the Upper Realm not long ago, she only had a cultivation level in the middle stage of the Mind Profound Realm, and the profound skills she cultivated were all inheritances left over from the Lower Realm, so they couldn’t compare with the exquisite martial arts of the God Realm.","If not for the fact that she had a Phoenix as her contract beast which was out of his expectations, the grass on Huang Yueli’s grave would have grown quite tall by this time.","Later, they fought again, at the edge of the secret realm near Forest Shade Town.","At that time, Huang Yueli’s strength had advanced by leaps and bounds, and even under the repeated attacks of Huang Shuangyu and the others, she could delay for a long time.","It’s just that Huang Sanbai attributed all of this to Li Moying beside her, thinking that she was able to persevere until the end mainly because of Li Moying’s protection.","However, today’s fight made Huang Sanbai really feel scared from the depths of his heart.","On Paradise Island, Huang Yueli used the most common Spirit Armament, but she was able to easily withstand every attack he made, and gained the upper hand more and more.","Huang Sanbai could even feel that if he continued to delay, he might be defeated by Huang Yueli today.","The talent of a god-level genius has actually reached such a perverted level!","Cold sweat broke out on Huang Sanbai’s forehead. Because of anxiety and fear, there were more and more flaws in his moves.","Huang Yueli also seized the opportunity and rushed to attack, causing Huang Sanbai to retreat steadily.","Just when she felt that the situation was improving, Huang Sanbai suddenly showed a strange smile on his face.","Huang Yueli saw it and couldn’t help being startled.","Huang Sanbai was about to lose, yet he still laughed?!","But almost at the next moment, she knew why Huang Sanbai was smiling.","A thick green mist with a faint fishy smell rushed over here at some point.","Moreover, the poisonous mist spread very quickly, like a tide, rushing over.","Huang Yueli’s face changed slightly.","She almost forgot that the biggest threat on Paradise Island was actually the poisonous mist!","Moreover, as the competition entered the final day, the poisonous mist spread much faster than the previous few days, and within a few hours, it would completely cover the central area.","If she gets caught in this poisonous mist, she will lose her ability to move in an instant, and even if she was not killed by Huang Sanbai, she will lose her qualifications for the competition.","But what she didn’t expect was that Huang Sanbai didn’t dodge and was stabbed in the chest by her.","“Huang Yueli, where do you want to go? Enter the poisonous mist for me!”","Huang Sanbai went all out, burning all the profound energy in his body, desperately attacking Huang Yueli, and even made no defence at all.","Huang Yueli had already guessed his plan, and also burned her profound energy, trying to break through his obstruction.","However, Huang Sanbai had already made preparations, how could she be given this opportunity?","In addition, the poisonous mist spread faster and faster, Huang Yueli accidentally stepped into the range of the poisonous mist.","Almost at the same time, she felt that the profound power in her body was rapidly draining, and her body began to become stiff.","She clenched her teeth, trying to use the last bit of strength she had left to use her agility skills to escape."]},{"number":4135,"title":"Chapter 4135 No One Can Save You (5)","paragraphs":["4135 No One Can Save You (5)","However, Huang Sanbai actually followed her into the poisonous mist and blocked her.","The feeling of weakness soon permeated every part of her body.","Huang Yueli exhausted all her willpower, trying to stand firm, but the poisonous mist from Paradise Island was too poisonous and she still succumbed to it and gradually fell to the ground.","The moment she fell to the ground, Huang Yueli’s first reaction was to take out the distress token.","At this point, saving her life was the most important thing. Whether she will be eliminated was no longer her concern.","It’s just that, even if the distress signal was sent out through the token, it will take some time for the steward to rush over.","At this point in time, although it was impossible for the poisonous mist to poison her to death, Huang Sanbai is still eyeing her...","The moment she took out the token, suddenly, a flame lit up from midair and directly bombarded her token.","This token is not a Spirit Armament at all, it is very fragile, and it was burned to ashes in an instant.","Huang Yueli was startled, and then her face sank.","Although the steward may not be able to arrive in time, this was her only hope of survival after all...","“Hehe, god-level genius, how do you feel now? Aren’t you exceptionally talented, so lucky that you can escape from death several times? Now? What else can you do?”","In the thick green mist that seemed to be unable to disperse, Huang Sanbai slowly walked over,,all the wrinkles on his old face squeezed together as a smug smile emerged on his face.","Although Huang Yueli couldn’t move, the poisonous mist didn’t have any erosive effects on her mind, and she was still thinking clearly.","Huang Sanbai was able to move freely in the poisonous mist!","It seems that he made up his mind from the very beginning, relying on this poisonous mist to bring her down, so he prepared an elixir that can detoxify in advance.","This also proves from another angle that there must be Huang Sanbai’s person among Floating Sea’s stewards.","Because such a kind of detoxification pill can only be obtained by people from Floating Sea, and it was a secret of Floating Sea. In order to prevent cultivators from cheating in the God Realm’s Grand Meet, the control of the pill was very strict.","Before Huang Yueli came to Floating Sea, she had studied with Liu Buyan and wanted to make a detoxification pill.","It’s a pity that they have never been exposed to this kind of poisonous mist before, and they don’t even have samples of the poisonous mist, so they naturally have no way to start.","“Hmph, you have finally fallen into my hands! This time, no one can save you! As long as I can get the Sky Phoenix Ring, I will be the Patriarch of the Sacred Phoenix Clan. I’ve waited too long! If you can contribute to my ascension to the Patriarch’s throne, it’s worth dying for.”","A trace of disdain flashed in Huang Sanbai’s eyes, and he sneered coldly: “What? Death is imminent, what are you still planning? Think you can fool me?”","Having said that, when he heard the word ‘Sky Phoenix Ring’, he still subconsciously withdrew his hand, and the long sword stayed three inches from Huangyue’s heart, and did not stab immediately.","It was hard for him to catch Huang Yueli, and he was only one step away from getting the Sky Phoenix Ring."]},{"number":4136,"title":"Chapter 4136 No One Can Save You (6)","paragraphs":["4136 No One Can Save You (6)","At this time, he did not dare take any risks.","If the Master of the Sky Phoenix Ring died, would it automatically leave her body?","What if it doesn’t work?","Huang Sanbai’s heart skipped a beat, even though he knew that Huang Yueli was delaying time, he still couldn’t help asking: “How can I get the Sky Phoenix Ring? Tell me clearly! Hand over the Sky Phoenix Ring and I will let you have a quick death.”","Huang Yueli rolled her eyes and laughed, “Elder Sanbai, do you think I’m stupid? If I tell you, I’ll be doomed? I can only tell you that if you kill me, you will definitely not get the Sky Phoenix Ring!”","Huang Sanbai’s face instantly turned livid.","“Are you kidding me?! Do you think you can’t do anything if you don’t tell me? Sure enough, you came from the lower realm. I don’t know how many tricks the God Realm has! Even if you don’t want to tell me, I just need to use the soul search technique, and I can still do it.” Get the information I want from your memory.”","Hearing this, Huang Yueli’s pupils suddenly dilated, and a trace of panic appeared in her eyes.","Seeing this, Huang Sanbai sneered, “How is it? Now you finally know how to be afraid, right? The person whose soul is searched suffers terribly during this process. I heard that it’s as if ten thousand sharp knives were being stabbed into the brain, each stab excruciating. Not only that, after the soul search is over, this person will directly turn into an idiot. But you don’t have to worry, I will definitely kill you anyway, it’s better than letting you, a god-level genius of the Ancient God Clan, turn into a crazy woman and run around. Otherwise, if you are insulted by those lowly bred men outside, you will lose face to our Sacred Phoenix Clan!”","He looked down at Huang Yueli who was lying on the ground from a high position, and spoke in a condescending tone, as if it was her honour to be killed by him.","Huang Yueli gritted her teeth and said, “Huang Sanbai, you...you dare!”","“Why wouldn’t I dare?!”","With a ferocious smile on his face, Huang Sanbai put away the long sword in his hand, bent down, and moved closer to Huang Yueli.","He stretched out his hand to the top of Huang Yueli’s head, just about to perform the soul search technique on her.","But before he touched Huang Yueli’s hair, he suddenly felt a huge energy burst out from Huang Yueli’s body.","“What happened?!”","Huang Sanbai’s expression changed and hurriedly dodged, trying to dodge backwards.","However, the distance between him and Huang Yueli was too close, and he thought that Huang Yueli was completely helpless, so he was not prepared at all.","Caught off guard, he was directly bombarded in front of him by the sudden burst of fire attribute energy.","Huang Sanbai’s body was like a kite with a broken string, and it flew straight out for an unknown distance.","Because the mist was so thick, Huang Yueli couldn’t even see where he flew to.","After solving Huang Sanbai, a smile appeared on the corner of Huang Yueli’s mouth.","The moment she came into contact with the poisonous mist, Huang Yueli knew that she might not be able to escape this time, so she simply closed her five senses and isolated the remaining profound energy in her body from the outside world.","Then, she tried to lure Huang Sanbai closer, and then burst out the profound energy in an instant.","In this way, even Huang Sanbai couldn’t resist, even if he didn’t die, he would be seriously injured.","However, this move also completely overdrew Huang Yueli’s profound strength.","The poisonous mist poured into her body continuously.","Huang Yueli coughed for a while as her eyes fluttered close."]},{"number":4137,"title":"Chapter 4137 Why Are You So Naive? (1)","paragraphs":["4137 Why Are You So Naive? (1)","In the forest, Li Zijun and others were stunned by the sudden situation.","Everything happened so fast that no one had time to react. They could only watch in a daze as Huang Yueli started fighting with the man in black who suddenly appeared.","In fact, even if they reacted quickly enough, they wouldn’t be able to help at all.","The skills of Huang Yueli and the man in black were obviously far superior to them, and the speed of the two’s fighting was astonishingly fast.","Only Li Zijun and Huang Beicheng could barely see the silhouettes of the two of them, but there was absolutely no way to intervene.","While fighting, Huang Yueli and the man in black moved quickly, like a whirlwind passing in front of them, and disappeared into the depths of the forests not long after.","It wasn’t until they left that the cultivators present gradually came to their senses, all of them were full of astonishment.","“This...what the hell is going on? Who the hell was it just now? Why did a person suddenly appear to attack Young Miss Li?”","“No, this is terrible! The man in black is so strong! I don’t think Young Miss Li may be his opponent. What should we do now? Let’s go and save her right now?”","“Rescue? How to save? A cultivator who can fight Young Miss Li inseparably can crush us to death with one finger! Even if we follow, we will only hold back Young Miss Li!”","Li Zijun and the girls in her team all looked nervous and worried.","Huang Yueli had just rescued them, and none of them had a chance to say thank you, but suddenly, such an astonishing change happened!","Although they also knew that with their strength, it was impossible to save Huang Yueli.","But, let them stand here and watch Huang Yueli fight to the death, wasn’t that unreasonable?","Fortunately, Li Zijun reacted a little faster than the others, and quickly made a decision, “If there is anyone else who can save Young Miss Li, it is only our Young Master! We should hurry up and go to the Central area and report this matter to the Young Master.”","“Ah, yes, yes!”","The other girls also reacted and nodded.","They turned around and were about to leave.","But at this moment, a figure rushed out from the side, just blocking their way forward.","“Ladies, are you leaving now? It’s a pity... I won’t let you leave! You should obediently go to the poisonous mist by yourself, and don’t force me to be violent.”","Li Zijun’s expression changed suddenly when she saw Huang Beicheng popping up suddenly!","“Huang Beicheng, you... what do you mean? You lost to Young Miss Li just now! It’s you who should go into the poisonous mist, right?”","Hearing this, Huang Beicheng couldn’t help laughing, “Hahahaha, you ladies are all talented cultivators of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, and it’s not the first day coming out to experience the world, why are you so naive? Young Miss Li did beat me just now, but now that she can’t save her own life, do you think I will be so stupid as to give up?”","Li Zijun’s face was pale.","Actually, there was no need for Huang Beicheng to speak so bluntly.","As soon as he stood up, Li Zijun already guessed his plan.","It’s nothing more than that Huang Yueli is in danger now and can’t control them anymore, Huang Beicheng was going to renegade!","Although he seems to be of low character in doing so, it was also human nature.","If Huang Yueli was not here, Huang Beicheng was the strongest one present!"]},{"number":4138,"title":"Chapter 4138 Why Are You So Naive? (2)","paragraphs":["4138 Why Are You So Naive? (2)","In front of him, Li Zijun and others can only be bullied!","They had already resigned to their twist in fate for them to enter the poisonous mist and be eliminated. Although they were not reconciled, they could only admit that they are inferior to others.","But the news of Young Miss Li’s distress could not reach the Young Master’s ears in time.","If the best rescue time was missed, and Young Miss Li was really killed, how can they have the face to see the Young Master?","The expression on Li Zijun’s face changed again and again, and she gritted her teeth and said, “Huang Beicheng, what did your Sacred Phoenix Clan do? Your clan sent that man in black just now, right? Your clan has a god-level genius as well? Well, it’s a clear violation of the rules! Are you not afraid that you will become the public enemy of the Ancient God Clans?”","“Young Miss Zijun’s words are ridiculous. I don’t know where that lady of yours provoked such a powerful enemy, and even went to Paradise Island to hunt her down! I think she must have failed too much in her usual life. Of course, it may also be caused by your Young Master... Don’t just pour dirty water on our Sacred Phoenix Clan.”","Huang Beicheng showed disdain and said solemnly.","Of course, he did not know anything about Huang Sanbai’s plan.","Now he was actually more puzzled than Li Zijun. He doesn’t understand why someone would suddenly fall from the sky and take away that Young Miss Li just when he was about to be eliminated!","Could it really be the peerless genius hidden in the clan?","He couldn’t figure it out, but he still understood one thing.","That means he won’t be eliminated!","Moreover, he had to stop Li Zijun and the others.","Whether or not they were eliminated is a trivial matter, the key is that Li Moying must not be allowed to come and save people!","He had seen Huang Yueli’s astonishing strength just now, and knew what kind of devastating blow would be brought to the Sacred Phoenix Clan if such a talented girl really combined with Li Moying.","Now God is helping them, let that girl Li be hunted down, if he doesn’t seize this opportunity, he will become a sinner of the Sacred Phoenix Clan when he returns.","Li Zijun looked at Huang Beicheng’s aggressive appearance, and her heart turned cold.","It’s over, it’s really over now!","Huang Beicheng doesn’t even need to do anything, just eliminate them.","As long as there is a delay of several hours, Huang Yueli will most likely be dead.","Huang Beicheng showed a smug smile, “Alright, ladies, don’t hesitate, any further delay will not benefit us all, so please...”","Just when Li Zijun was in despair, suddenly, a scream came from the woods.","“Young Miss Zijun! You are actually here!”","Li Zijun felt that the voice was a bit familiar, so he turned around in astonishment, and couldn’t help being startled.","“Tianyi...Commander Tianyi?”","Naturally, she would recognize the commander of the guards beside Li Moying, but why did he appear here?","But Huang Beicheng couldn’t recognize Li Tianyi at all.","His status in the Sacred Phoenix Clan was extremely high, and he was equivalent to the existence of the Young Master. To be able to catch his eyes, he must be a first-class genius, such as Li Zijun, a second-class genius in the God Clan, he is not a genius at all. Just no impression.","He frowned, “Who are you?”","When Li Tian saw him, he was taken aback, “Huang Beicheng?! It’s you! No wonder you were able to stop Young Miss Zijun! Young Miss Zijun, how are you doing?”","Li Zijun hurriedly yelled, “Commander Tianyi, hurry up and go find the Young Master!”"]},{"number":4139,"title":"Chapter 4139 Why Are You So Naive? (3)","paragraphs":["4139 Why Are You So Naive? (3)","Li Tianyi never expected that Li Zijun would be so excited when she saw him.","He didn’t understand why, hence he did not leave, but even kindly explained to Li Zijun.","“Young Miss Zijun, the Young Master can’t leave the camp now, but you don’t have to worry, the Young Madame has already come to save people in person. It’s just...she obviously left before me, and her footsteps are much faster than mine. She should have arrived before me, how is she still not here?”","He knew that Huang Yueli didn’t like others following her.","Therefore, even if Li Moying ordered him to follow Huang Yueli, he deliberately walked a little slower and kept a distance so as not to be an eyesore to the Young Madame.","In the end, he followed and he arrived, but the Young Madame was nowhere to be seen.","Li Tianyi looked puzzled, and Li Zijun was so anxious that she was on the verge of screaming.","Seeing this, Huang Beicheng laughed loudly, “Tsk tsk, you are still daydreaming here, thinking that Young Miss Li will come to save people? Let me tell you, Young Miss Li has already come here just now, and she really defeated me, but a man in black suddenly appeared out of nowhere and he is extremely powerful. Even your Young Miss Li is no match, he was chasing her all the way, so now the both of them have disappeared but from the look of things...I think.. Young Miss Li is most probably gone!”","“What? What did you say?!”","Li Tianyi cried out in shock!","Li Zijun didn’t know the inside story, so she didn’t know how serious the matter was.","However, as Li Moying’s most trusted guard commander, he was very clear that the man in black was 99% related to Huang Sanbai!","Even if it wasn’t him himself, it must have been sent by him.","Huang Sanbai had ten thousand reasons to put Huang Yueli to death. If he sneaked into Paradise Island, then their Young Madame would really be in big trouble!","Li Tianyi’s face suddenly changed, and he immediately said: “Young Miss Zijun, let’s go quickly! We must tell the Young Master the news as soon as possible!”","However, before he could turn around, a fiery blade rushed towards his chest!","“Want to leave? It’s too late! Unexpectedly, there are still people who throw themselves into the trap. Now I have eliminated one more Cloudy Qilin Clan bastard, hahaha!”","Huang Beicheng’s loud laughter came from behind him.","Li Tianyi reacted immediately, and swayed suddenly, dodging the attack of the fire blade.","Huang Beicheng couldn’t help but let out a “Huh”, with a look of surprise on his face.","He thought that Li Tianyi was just a little-known ordinary cultivator of the Cloudy Qilin Clan. Even if he was Li Moying’s bodyguard, he was just running errands for Li Moying, and his strength must be very average.","After all, the real top genius in the family, who would be willing to follow others as a bodyguard?","Therefore, he only used 60% of his power to release a fire blade, thinking that this would be enough to seriously injure Li Tianyi.","But who knows, not only was Li Tianyi not seriously injured, he didn’t even lose a single hair.","As soon as Li Tianyi was stopped by him, knowing that he would not be able to leave easily this time, his face suddenly became a bit serious.","However, he didn’t show any fear at all. He just said to Li Zijun beside him: “Young Miss Zijun, I will stop Huang Beicheng, please run ahead and you must tell the Young Master about the Young Madame’s distress!”","“Ah?!” Li Zijun was stunned for a moment, “But...”","However, with Li Tianyi’s strength, how could he stop Huang Beicheng?!","Before she could finish her sentence, Huang Beicheng already sneered and attacked Li Tianyi again.","“Just you? You still want to stop me?! It’s a fool’s dream!”"]},{"number":4140,"title":"Chapter 4140 Why Are You So Naive? (4)","paragraphs":["4140 Why Are You So Naive? (4)","Before he finished his words, a sea of flames ignited around Huang Beicheng.","The raging fire attribute energy burst out instantly, sweeping towards Li Tianyi.","Li Zijun’s face suddenly changed, “Commander Tianyi, quickly, retreat!!”","The fire attribute was also an attribute with powerful attack power. Even Li Zijun herself can hardly catch up with Huang Beicheng’s sudden attack, let alone Li Tianyi who was not as good as her!","Even if Huang Beicheng was injured by Huang Yueli before, and its strength was at most only 60% of its heyday, it was definitely not something Li Tianyi could compete with.","However, Li Tianyi did not seem to be frightened by such an attack at all. He had no intention of hiding at all. He clenched his long sword tightly with his right hand, as if preparing to attack Huang Beicheng.","Li Zijun couldn’t stand it anymore!","It’s over now, she thought Li Tianyi would at least bring Young Miss Li’s news to the Young Master when he came!","But she didn’t expect him to be so stupid that he would choose to fight Huang Beicheng at this point in time.","Did this not spell their doom?","Li Zijun bit her lips, made up her mind, and gestured to the girls behind her, signalling them to run away.","In any case, Li Tianyi probably won’t be able to escape. It would be great if any of them manage to slip through and escape.","As for Li Zijun herself, she also drew her long sword, wanting to help Li Tianyi block Huang Beicheng together.","She took a few steps forward, just about to look for an opportunity to attack.","But when she looked up, she was stunned by the scene in front of her!","Li Tianyi slashed the long sword with his right hand across the air, a dazzling lightning fell from the sky, merged with his long sword, and immediately met the sea of flames from Huang Beicheng!","When the two forces collided in the air, Huang Beicheng and Li Tianyi each retreated a few steps.","Such a result... they were actually evenly matched!","Li Zijun’s eyeballs almost fell out!","Li Tianyi’s strength almost surpassed hers. If she was not injured, she didn’t dare to say that she was stronger than Li Tianyi. Now that she was injured, she was even worse than him.","But, this...how was this possible?","Among the family’s geniuses, Li Tianyi can only be regarded as a second-rate to third-rate genius. In terms of strengths, only solid basic skills stand out. How could it be possible that after just over a year with Li Moying, his strength has improved by leaps and bounds? , to this extent?","Just when Li Zijun was stunned, Li Tianyi and Huang Beicheng had already fought dozens of rounds.","In the beginning, the two were evenly matched.","However, Huang Beicheng was previously defeated by Huang Yueli. Although the injuries he suffered were not fatal, they were quite serious. It was already very strenuous to forcefully stop Li Zijun and the others.","Now that he has used so many tricks one after another, his body was getting more and more exhausted and he was gradually losing.","On the other hand, Li Tianyi was very steady and cautious, not at all hasty and aggressive and no one could find any flaws.","Seeing that he couldn’t defeat the opponent, Huang Beicheng gritted his teeth and a burst of flames suddenly burst out from his body, heading directly towards Li Tianyi’s face!","Li Tianyi stepped back a few steps in a flash.","Huang Beicheng seized this opportunity, retreated violently to the rear, and at the same time shouted to his teammates, “Hurry up, everyone! Don’t be eliminated by them!”","“Damn it, you guys want to run? Stop!”","Seeing the reversal of the situation, Li Zijun suddenly became excited as she yelled and wanted to take advantage of the victory to pursue and keep the members of the Sacred Phoenix Clan.","Li Tianyi grabbed her tightly, “Young Miss Zijun, don’t waste time, let’s go back and find the Young Master!”"]},{"number":4141,"title":"Chapter 4141 Little Li’er Is Missing (1)","paragraphs":["4141 Little Li’er Is Missing (1)","Li Zijun snapped back to her senses and quickly said: “That’s right, I was completely confused!”","...","At this time, the central area was already in chaos.","As the elimination round entered the final moment, almost everyone couldn’t sit still any longer. They began to gather their forces and attack other contestants, hoping to eliminate them as soon as possible.","Only the Cloudy Qilin Clan who had been sitting by firmly, as no one dared to attack them.","Because, Li Moying was staying in the camp of the Cloudy Qilin Clan.","Although he had never made a move, the deterrence was still sufficient and no one dared to provoke a strong man like him.","What outsiders didn’t know was that the camp of the Cloudy Qilin Clan was not as peaceful as it looks from the outside.","At this time, Li Tian Er and several other guards were kneeling on the ground, trying to stop Li Moying, who was already on the verge of going berserk, and prevent him from leaving the camp.","“Young Master, Young Master! Please calm down! The Young Madame is extremely powerful. Except for you, it is impossible for anyone else to hurt her. You don’t have to worry so much.”","“Yes, Young Master! Young Madame is not only extremely powerful, but also intelligent and quick-witted. How could something happen on Paradise Island?”","“Although two hours have passed, how could something have happened to the Young Madame? Maybe she discovered some opportunity on the island, and it’s not necessarily true that she went to investigate it herself.”","“Young Master, if you leave now, the camp of the Cloudy Qilin Clan will be lost!”","Everyone talked and tried to persuade them.","It has been two hours since Huang Yueli left the central area to save people.","Originally, everyone thought that she would be able to rescue the person in an hour at most, but in the end, she didn’t even see her for such a long time.","Li Moying became visibly irritable.","The longer the time, the uglier his face became, and finally he couldn’t help but jump up, ready to leave the central area to find someone.","Upon hearing the news, the cultivators of the Cloudy Qilin Clan were all shocked, and hurried over to stop him.","To be honest, no one believed that something happened to Huang Yueli, and they all thought it was their Young Master who made a fuss.","How could Li Moying not understand what they said?","His face darkened, “That’s enough, you all get out of the way! You don’t even listen to my orders, what’s the use of you?”","Li Tian Er swallowed his saliva, trembling with fear, not knowing what to say.","It’s strange to say that not only did the Young Madame not come back, but his Elder brother also didn’t come back, which was indeed a bit unusual.","Just then, there was a sound of panicked footsteps outside the camp.","Li Tianyi and Li Zijun rushed in first.","They were so fast that they left other teammates behind.","As soon as he saw Li Moying when he entered the door, Li Tianyi plopped down on his knees and said loudly: “Young Master, it’s bad! The big thing is bad! The Young Madame was attacked by a black robed man just now and she’s now missing!”","“What did you say?!”","All the cultivators were stunned when they heard his words.","Li Tian Er was stunned for a moment, “Brother, what are you talking about? What black robed man? The Young Madame is extremely powerful, can’t she beat him?”","Li Zijun hurriedly stood up and said, “Young Master, I saw with my own eyes just now that this black robed man suddenly rushed out to attack the Young Madame, and he was extremely powerful and fast.”"]},{"number":4142,"title":"Chapter 4142 Little Li’er Is Missing (2)","paragraphs":["4142 Little Li’er Is Missing (2)","“Young Madame fought with him for more than a dozen moves in a row, but there was no clear winner. Later, they fought and entered the depths of the forest, but they couldn’t find it...”","Before she could finish speaking, Li Moying already dodged and rushed out of the camp.","Everyone was unprepared. When they regained consciousness, his figure had disappeared before their eyes.","All the cultivators present were stunned.","“What... what’s going on here? The Young Master just... just left?”","“Didn’t you listen to what Commander Tianyi just said? Something happened to the Young Madame!”","“The Young Master loves the Young Madame the most. Hearing that something happened to her, how could he still sit still?”","“But, then...then what shall we do?”","“How old are you? Can you compare with the Young Madame?”","A bunch of people surrounded Li Zijun and Li Tianyi, asking them about the details at that time.","Li Zijun said it quickly, and then, with a worried look on her face, “I’m not exaggerating at all, that black robed man is too skilled! If I didn’t know the rules of Paradise Island, I’m afraid I would have thought that he is a strong man in the Dao Profound Realm!”","“A strong Dao Profound Realm exponent? How is that possible? Isn’t it possible that only cultivators who participate in the God Realm’s Grand Meet can enter Paradise Island?”","“So, I just thought... But, no matter what the other party’s cultivation level is, he must be a master beyond our imagination. No wonder the Young Master is so anxious.”","“This is really weird! The Young Madame is already a god-level talent, who can match her? Is there a third god-level genius in the world?”","When Li Tianyi saw the crowd gathered together, he hurried over.","“Alright, stop guessing. This matter... is not as simple as you think! Let’s make arrangements for the next step.”","He knows the inside story, and has already guessed that this matter is related to the Sacred Phoenix Clan, but he couldn’t say it clearly.","Li Moying was not here, the highest status in the clan was Li Zijun, followed by Li Moying’s bodyguard, Commander Li Tianyi.","Everyone looked at Li Zijun.","However, Li Zijun turned to Li Tianyi, “Commander Tianyi, I don’t dare to command the Young Master’s guards, you should do it.”","The Ancient God Clans has always respected the strong.","After seeing Li Tianyi’s strength just now, Li Zijun’s attitude towards him was a bit more polite.","Li Tianyi did not refuse, and nodded immediately, “Alright, then I will not be polite. Everyone is divided into two teams and one will be led by Young Miss Zijun. Those who stay in the camp and are responsible for resisting the attacks of other forces around. After Young Master leaves, other forces will definitely seize the time to attack us, so you must be extremely careful.”","Li Zijun couldn’t help frowning when he heard the words, “This...there is no Young Master here. With my strength, I only bring half of the people...I’m afraid I won’t be able to hold the fort. Besides, we may not need this camp, perhaps with a more mobile operation, can we have more clansmen survive.”","The purpose of the battle is not to defend the camp, but to survive to pass the elimination round.","Li Tianyi shook his head, “If you don’t want to be eliminated, it’s better to stay in the camp. A large number of arrays have been set up around this camp, all of which were arranged by the Young Madame herself. It is definitely not something that other forces can take casually. So, here is the safest place.”"]},{"number":4143,"title":"Chapter 4143 Little Li’er Is Missing (3)","paragraphs":["4143 Little Li’er Is Missing (3)","Li Zijun’s eyes widened as she exclaimed with surprise: “Young Madame also knows how to arrange arrays?!”","Huang Yueli’s accident itself was not the scariest thing.","The most frightening thing is that if the Young Madame is injured, the Young Master will definitely be extremely angry. God knows what will happen then!","Li Tianyi picked out all of Li Moying’s bodyguards, and found a few other cultivators known for their agility, and the group set off quickly.","As soon as they left the camp, they were attacked extremely violently.","Obviously, after Li Moying rushed out just now, everyone realised that the opportunity had come, and they couldn’t wait to attack the Cloudy Qilin Clan!","“Everyone, don’t get carried away in fighting, let’s go out first and then talk!”","It took a lot of effort for Li Tianyi and the others to get rid of their attackers.","By the time they left the central area, the spread of the poisonous mist was almost reaching its limit.","Everyone searched around the edge of the poisonous mist, but they still didn’t see Huang Yueli’s figure, but they found Li Moying.","Li Tianyi rushed over in a hurry, “Young Master, how are you doing? Has Young Madame been found?”","Li Moying didn’t speak, his face was extremely gloomy, and the chill on his body was as sharp as a knife. It seemed that as long as he got close to him, he would be stabbed by his murderous aura!","And his gaze fell on a charred towering giant tree in front of him.","This tree was supposed to have luxuriant branches and leaves, but now, the trunk was densely covered with sword marks. All the leaves have been burned, and the trunk has turned pitch black.","Not only this tree, but the ground around it had similar traces. Many small trees were directly turned into scorched earth.","And in the air, there was a strong burnt smell.","Anyone can see that there was a fierce battle between fire attribute cultivators here not long ago.","Li Tianyi and the others all changed their expressions in shock.","Almost all of this area has been razed to the ground. What kind of power was needed to do this?","You must know that when everyone enters Paradise Island, their strength will be suppressed to the early stage of the Heart Profound Realm, and now these battle marks were not left by cultivators at the early stage of the Heart Profound Realm!","“Sure enough, it’s the Sacred Phoenix Clan! Everyone, let me search around carefully. If you see Young Madame or other suspicious people, come and report back immediately!”","“Obey!”","Not long after, they all came back to report.","“In the east, no suspicious signs.”","“I didn’t see the Young Madame in the south!”","“Northeast...”","Li Moying’s face became even more gloomy.","In fact, his speed was much faster than the guards. Just before Li Tianyi and the others arrived, he had already searched the surroundings.","As a result... nothing was found!","Neither Huang Yueli nor Huang Sanbai was seen, both of them disappeared!","The only thing that made him feel lucky was that although he didn’t see a living Little Li’er, at least he didn’t see a...","Li Moying said suddenly, “I’ll go to the poisonous mist to have a look, and you also go back to defend the camp, and try to keep as many cultivators in the clan as possible.”","With that said, he took a direct step and walked in the direction of the poisonous mist."]},{"number":4144,"title":"Chapter 4144 Little Li’er Is Missing (4)","paragraphs":["4144 Little Li’er Is Missing (4)","Since there was no one outside, the only explanation was that his little Li’er was forced into the poisonous mist.","“Young Master! You...please calm down! Once you enter the poisonous mist, you will lose consciousness immediately. Even if you are strong, you will not last long. It is impossible to find someone inside, and you will be eliminated because of this. Ah! Young Master!”","Li Moying snorted coldly, “Get out of the way!”","Being eliminated from the God Realm’s Grand Meet may be a very serious matter for others, and it can be said that their future was ruined, but he doesn’t care about it at all.","There was no need to rely on a competition to prove his strength. He came here just to accompany Huang Yueli.","Now that things like this have happened to Little Li’er, what was he still doing here?","Li Tian Er also fell to the ground, and persuaded: “Young Master, you really don’t have to do this! The Young Madame must have run into the poisonous mist at the last moment, but she didn’t die, but saved herself. I think she should have been teleported out of Paradise Island, although she was eliminated, her life is safe.”","“That’s right, Young Master, even if you enter the poisonous mist, you won’t be able to find anyone. The Young Madame must have been teleported away!”","Everyone tried to persuade Li Moying one after another, trying to stop him.","If Li Moying took the initiative to walk into the poisonous mist and was eliminated, then the Cloudy Qilin Clan’s God Realm’s Grand Meet would be useless.","Before the competition, he blew out such a big cowhide and mocked the Sacred Phoenix Clan for so long, but he was going to be slapped in the face!","However, Li Moying was unmoved in the slightest.","Seeing that they wouldn’t get out of the way, he simply turned around and rushed directly into the poisonous mist.","“Little Patriarch!!”","There were screams from the crowd, but they couldn’t keep up with his speed.","After entering the poisonous mist, Li Moying felt a tingling sensation coming from his limbs, and the profound energy in his body was also rapidly dissipating.","Even though he had already made preparations before he came in, and used a technique similar to Huang Yueli’s to seal off his five senses, his body’s ability to respond was still rapidly declining.","This surprised him very much.","If even he couldn’t bear the erosion of the poisonous mist, then Huang Yueli and the people who chased her would have no choice but to be teleported out.","But, just in case, that black robed man was fully prepared...","Li Moying walked a few steps in the poisonous mist, but found no clues at all, but his body was about to fail.","There was a whirlwind.","Beside him, there were also a large number of cultivators gathered. These people all had expressions of surprise on their faces, and some even couldn’t help cheering.","“Great! We’ve entered the next round!”","“I’m really lucky! Just one step away, I’m about to be eliminated!”","“Hahaha, it’s all right now, at least I’m in the top 1,000. If I return to my faction, I will definitely become a key training target!”","Hearing these voices, Li Moying’s expression suddenly changed.","He never expected that before he found Little Li’er, the number of contestants on Paradise Island had dropped to a thousand.","The game was automatically over!","“Young Master, there are so many cultivators who have qualified for the clan this time! It’s all up to you to protect us...”","Many members of the Cloudy Qilin Clan rushed towards him."]},{"number":4145,"title":"Chapter 4145 Little Li’er Is Missing (1)","paragraphs":["4145 Little Li’er Is Missing (1)","Li Moying was so anxious that he had no time to pay attention to them.","Although he had already had the worst premonition just now, there was still a glimmer of hope in his heart after all.","Maybe he really thought too much.","Maybe what Li Tianyi and the others said was correct. Although Huang Yueli entered the poisonous mist during the process of being hunted down, she still activated the signal in time and was sent out.","Thinking of this, he dodged and quickly walked through the crowd.","Although the square was crowded with people, it was very crowded, but it didn’t hinder him much.","Soon, he scanned all the people in the square.","No!","No!","Still not there!","His Little Li’er just disappeared out of thin air, and was not teleported out because of the end of the elimination round!","Li Moying’s face was extremely gloomy. At this moment, he really wished to slaughter all the cultivators of the Sacred Phoenix Clan!","His speed was too fast, it took Li Tianyi and others a lot of effort to keep up.","Seeing Li Moying’s expression, they all looked at each other in dismay. The clothes behind their backs were completely soaked in cold sweat.","Just now they swore in front of Li Moying that there would be no problem with Huang Yueli, and was 99% certain that she had been sent out directly.","But now, the facts were not like this at all!","They wouldn’t be foolish enough to guess that Huang Yueli left on her own after being eliminated.","After all, how could the Young Madame not know that the Young Master would worry about her? Even if there is a big thing to leave, people will definitely leave a message and tell the Young Master as soon as possible.","Everyone understands the truth, but the guards still can’t figure it out.","Could it be that the Sacred Phoenix Clan really has such courage? How dare you do it on Paradise Island!","Li Moying’s cold eyes swept over Li Tianyi.","Li Moying shouted coldly: “Stop!”","The square, which was originally full of excitement, became completely silent in an instant.","Everyone looked in Li Moying’s direction, and when they recognized who he was, they were even more horrified.","Li Tianyi and the others stood close, and they immediately saw the person whom Li Moying stopped.","The first genius of the Sacred Phoenix Clan, Huang Beicheng!","At this time, Huang Beicheng’s face was a little pale.","Just now when he saw Li Moying looking for someone, he quickly guessed that he was looking for Huang Yueli.","Although Huang Beicheng doesn’t know who the mysterious black robed man is, this matter has nothing to do with him.","Therefore, his first reaction was to take several steps back, trying to hide in the crowd.","However, how could he have imagined that Li Moying saw him at a glance, and stopped him the moment he dodged.","Sensing Li Moying’s gaze, all the cultivators onlookers looked suddenly enlightened.","The people around Huang Beicheng consciously moved a few steps to the side to distance themselves from him.","The Young Master of the Cloudy Qilin Clan has his eye on the number one genius of the Sacred Phoenix Clan. This is definitely not a good thing. If they don’t avoid it, they wouldn’t even know how they died later!","Li Moying looked at Huang Beicheng expressionlessly, and said coldly, “Where is my wife?”"]},{"number":4146,"title":"Chapter 4146 Where Is My Wife? (2)","paragraphs":["4146 Where Is My Wife? (2)","Huang Beicheng was swept over by his cold gaze, although he tried his best to maintain his composure, he still felt his legs go weak for a while.","He was really terrified!","There are countless rumours about Li Moying, but this is the first time he has met this legendary god-level genius in person.","In the past, he thought highly of himself and always felt that he was already the most powerful existence among heavenly geniuses. Even if a god-level genius was born, how could he be stronger than him?","But when he saw Li Moying today, he realised how terrifying a real god-level genius is!","He took a deep breath and forced himself to calm down.","“Young Master Li, what do you mean? How would I know where your wife is? Could it be that your wife has taken a fancy to me and decided to dump you? Hahahaha!”","In order to show that the Sacred Phoenix Clan was not afraid of the god-level geniuses of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, Huang Beicheng suppressed the panic in his heart and laughed exaggeratedly.","He fully expected that the people around him would laugh with him and mock Li Moying.","However, he laughed for a long time, but found that there was no sound around him, and no one responded to him.","All the cultivators of the Sacred Phoenix Clan were shocked by the anger emanating from Li Moying.","Huang Beicheng closed his mouth in embarrassment and looked at Li Moying.","He is extremely talented, and his strength is far beyond that of the people around him. Therefore, under the pressure of Li Moying’s profound strength, he can barely maintain his sanity.","Li Moying frowned slightly, “I’ll ask you one last time, where is my wife? Tell me!”","Following his icy voice, the profound energy in the surrounding world became violent, and there was a faint sound of thunder and lightning blasting, which made people tremble with fear.","Huang Beicheng became more and more anxious, but still bit the bullet and refused to show weakness.","“I’ve already told you that I don’t know! Your wife ran away with someone. What does it matter to our Sacred Phoenix Clan? You should...”","Before he could finish speaking, he suddenly felt a powerful force approaching, his breathing was stagnant, his chest was in severe pain, and he couldn’t even speak.","Almost at the same moment, he found himself in the air, being strangled by someone’s neck, and lifted into the air.","“Do you think I’m a fool? The tragic scene of burning fire in the forest is clearly left by fire attribute cultivators fighting! You tell me that it has nothing to do with the Sacred Phoenix Clan?”","Huang Beicheng’s neck was almost broken, his hands were desperately trying to separate Li Moying’s hand, but he couldn’t shake him at all.","He soon felt that he couldn’t breathe, the air in his chest was getting less and less, his eyes were going black, and he was about to faint.","At this moment, Li Moying suddenly threw him to the ground.","There was a “bang”.","Huang Beicheng’s body fell heavily on the ground.","Originally, he was seriously injured after a series of battles with Huang Yueli and Li Tian, and now he was taught a lesson by Li Moying, his internal organs were almost shattered, his whole body was limp on the ground, and he couldn’t even get up.","Seeing Li Moying approaching slowly, Huang Beicheng was terrified to the extreme.","At this moment, he could no longer keep his composure, and yelled in fear, “You...don’t come here! Come here! I...I really don’t know about that Lady Li, I really don’t know! That black robed man suddenly rushed out to assassinate her, it has nothing to do with me, it has nothing to do with the Sacred Phoenix Clan!”","“Alright, let me change my question then.” Li Moying snorted coldly, then asked, “Then... where is Huang Sanbai?”","“Elder Sanbai?!”"]},{"number":4147,"title":"Chapter 4147 Where Is My Wife? (3)","paragraphs":["4147 Where Is My Wife? (3)","Huang Beicheng was stunned for a moment, apparently he did not expect that Li Moying would ask about Huang Sanbai.","Li Moying glanced at him coldly, “Don’t make me ask a third time!”","Huang Beicheng was frightened by him a long time ago. Although he was confused, he didn’t dare to hide it.","He shivered secretly, and quickly replied: “I... I really don’t know! Before we entered Paradise Island, Elder Sanbai followed the Patriarch and the others to send us here, but we stayed on the island for seven days. Where the hell am I... how do I know?”","“Besides, you... have you made a mistake? Although our Sacred Phoenix Clan and Cloudy Qilin Clan are rivals, it is impossible for us to do such indecent things! Elder Sanbai is a highly respected Elder in our clan. How is it possible...”","Before he finished speaking, Li Moying flicked his robe sleeves, and a wave of profound energy rushed straight to his chest.","Huang Beicheng’s breathing was stagnant, and he quickly put on a defensive posture.","However, Li Moying’s strength is too strong, it is not something he can bear in his current state of serious injury.","His body rose into the air again, and he was about to fall to the ground again.","Just then, there was a burst of stern reprimands from the end of the square.","“Li Moying! What do you want to do to the geniuses of our Sacred Phoenix Clan!”","Following this sound, a burst of extremely fierce fire-attributed energy passed over everyone’s heads, stopped behind Huang Beicheng, and just supported his body that was flying upside down, slowing down his falling speed.","With the help of this force, Huang Beicheng managed to balance his body and landed safely.","Before he could stand still, he couldn’t wait to turn his head back, and exclaimed in great surprise: “Patriarch!”","At the entrance of the square, Huang Tianhao, the Patriarch of the Sacred Phoenix Clan, stood impressively.","He was full of anger, staring at Li Moying’s eyes, he was about to burst into flames!","Because the elimination round has ended, all the major forces rushed to the square of the Gravity Island to welcome the talented cultivators who successfully advanced to the semi-finals.","The residence of the Sacred Phoenix Clan is the closest to the square, and they came the earliest.","However, Huang Tianhao never expected that when he arrived, he witnessed Li Moying threatening the genius of his family, and even made a move so fiercely that he wanted to put Huang Beicheng to death!","He hurriedly shot and saved the person, but the anger in his heart burst out suddenly.","“Li Moying, you’re deceiving people too much! Under the watchful eyes of everyone, you dare to openly kill people in Floating Sea! Do you think that our Sacred Phoenix Clan are all dead people? Are you treating Floating Sea’s rules as air?”","As Huang Tianhao said, he had uncontrollably released his profound strength.","He was worthy of being a well-known fire attribute powerhouse for a long time. He can sit on the position of Patriarch, and his strength was still higher than that of Huang Sanbai!","As he released his profound strength, a faint red halo appeared outside his body. The cultivators standing beside him all felt a burst of scorching heat, as if their bodies were about to burn, and hurriedly retreated to the side.","Naturally, these young cultivators in the square couldn’t bear such coercion.","The ones who were a little weaker, already pale, covered their chests, and kept retreating.","However, Li Moying’s complexion did not change at all.","His eyes moved away from Huang Beicheng and landed on Huang Tianhao, the coldness in his eyes became more and more obvious.","“I’ll ask again, where is Huang Sanbai? Let him get out!”","Huang Tianhao sneered and said, “Do you think that an Elder of the Ancient God Clan would be any person you can call so casually?”"]},{"number":4148,"title":"Chapter 4148 Where Is My Wife? (4)","paragraphs":["4148 Where Is My Wife? (4)","Although Huang Tianhao hasn’t figured it out yet, why Li Moying wanted to find Huang Sanbai.","But his first reaction was to sternly reject Li Moying.","This is related to the dignity and prestige of the clan. No matter what it is for, it is impossible for him to obey the orders of the Cloudy Qilin Clan.","Li Moying didn’t bother, the expression on his face was still cold, his thin lips lifted, “Since this old man Huang Sanbai is going to be a coward, hiding himself and not daring to see people, then I have no choice but to force him out.”","As he said that, Li Moying’s eyes flashed, and his right hand had already drawn out the long sword at his waist.","This sword was carefully refined for him by Huang Yueli who personally went to the warehouse of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, selecting the best quality materials.","Although it doesn’t look special on the outside, its attack power is twice as powerful as a Spirit Armament of the same level!","The moment he flipped his wrist, the thunder-attribute energy in the air quickly gathered towards the blade, and the long sword was engulfed, turning into a bolt of lightning.","Li Moying drew his sword and directly stabbed at Huang Beicheng.","Huang Tianhao didn’t react at first, but when he saw his intention, he couldn’t help but change his face, and shouted loudly: “Stop, stop!”","He also didn’t care about putting on airs of the Patriarch, and immediately flew over, blocking Huang Beicheng directly behind him.","The profound strength of Huang Tianhao and Li Moying collided in the air.","Li Moying’s body swayed, but her expression did not change at all. Holding the long sword in her hand, she even took another step forward!","Huang Tianhao was shocked to the extreme when he saw the handsome face of the young man in front of him!","He knew that the god-level geniuses of the Cloudy Qilin Clan were very powerful, and he also knew that cultivators of his generation could not be Li Moying’s opponents. Even Huang Beicheng, it was impossible to get the slightest benefit from Li Moying’s hands.","However, he never thought that Li Moying would be so strong!","He was actually able to receive the attack of a strong man in the Dao Profound Realm head-on!","Moreover, there was no sign of injury at all.","Just when Huang Tianhao was in a daze, a cold light flashed in Li Moying’s hand, he shifted his target, and stabbed at another target with his long sword.","“Arghhhh...!”","There was a scream, and a genius of the Sacred Phoenix Clan beside Huang Beicheng fell to the ground on the spot, blood kept coming out of his mouth, his eyes turned white, and he didn’t know whether he was alive or dead.","Huang Tianhao just saved Huang Beicheng, and before he could take a breath, something happened on the other side.","However, before he recovered from the shock, Li Moying raised his sword and attacked the third target.","“Save...”","This person fell to the ground before he could finish a single word.","It was only then that Huang Tianhao realised that Li Moying had already torn off all face, completely trampled on the default rules among the ancient gods, and unexpectedly, in the square of Floating Sea, under the gaze of so many cultivators, set to exterminate all the cultivators of the Sacred Phoenix Clan!","Even standing here as the Patriarch doesn’t seem to have any influence on him!","Seeing that Li Moying was about to attack again, Huang Tianhao finally came back to his senses, his expression turning extremely ferocious.","“Damn brat, are you going to openly provoke the entire Sacred Phoenix Clan? Do you really think that you are a god-level genius and invincible? You are just a yellow-haired brat! I will teach you how to behave today!”","As soon as he finished speaking, he waved his palm and attacked Li Moying!","Following his attack, a mirage of a sea of flames appeared behind him, sweeping across the sky and covering the sky.","All the young cultivators present screamed in horror."]},{"number":4149,"title":"Chapter 4149 Each Has One’s Own Opinion (1)","paragraphs":["4149 Each Has One’s Own Opinion (1)","A powerhouse at the peak of the Dao Profound Realm was already considered one of the top powerhouses in the God Realm, and his strength is truly extraordinary.","Even Li Moying felt the tremendous pressure, and the expression on his face became serious.","However, he didn’t have the slightest intention of retreating. He raised the long sword upwards, and the electric light on the sword became brighter, as if it was going to blind someone’s eyes.","Immediately, with a flick of his wrist, he directly met Huang Tianhao’s attack.","Li Moying was not a reckless person. Although he thinks himself extremely talented, he will never force himself to take action for the sake of face when his strength is not enough.","However, today was different.","Huang Yueli actually disappeared on Paradise Island!","Moreover, there were various indications that the one who attacked her was Huang Sanbai, the Elder of the Sacred Phoenix Clan!","Anything about Huang Yueli is enough to drive him crazy, but now, his beloved woman’s life or death is unknown, it’s like a sharp knife piercing his chest, making him bleed, and at the same time making him lose his mind.","Now, the only thought in his mind is to find Huang Sanbai, kill him and avenge Huang Yueli!","In order to achieve this goal, he will not hesitate to attack any obstacles that stand in his way!","“Young Master!!!”","Li Tianyi and the others exclaimed, wanting to rush forward to stop them.","However, the battles of Dao Profound Realm powerhouses wasn’t something they could intervene in. The profound power escaping from the battle area alone was enough to make them vomit blood.","They could only watch helplessly as Li Moying and Huang Tianhao fought in mid-air.","The two strands of profound energy shot straight into the sky in an instant, and the crackling sound was deafening and lasted for a long time.","All the cultivators present, who were slightly inferior in cultivation, had already vomited blood and were sent flying out.","The remaining ones who could barely stand still were all shocked and frightened.","“Oh my god, Li Moying is crazy! He actually dared to challenge the Patriarch of the Phoenix clan! That’s a powerhouse at the peak of the Dao Profound Realm!”","“I really can’t see that he... actually did it for a woman?”","“Could it be that a god-level genius who has only been born in the God Realm for tens of thousands of years is about to perish here before he has time to mature?”","Two figures in the centre appeared in front of everyone.","Everyone raised their heads and looked over. Immediately afterwards, their eyes widened, and they all showed expressions of astonishment.","They all thought that Li Moying was going to die this time, but who knew, he was still standing in the air.","Although his face was pale and there was a trace of blood at the corner of his mouth, he was obviously injured, but the injury was obviously not fatal!","“This...how is this possible?”","“Let’s go, what kind of strength is Young Master Li? He can even survive under the hands of Patriarch Huang?!”","Everyone could hardly believe their eyes!","You must know that the person standing opposite Li Moying was not some cultivator who has just entered the Dao Profound Realm with unstable foundation, but the Patriarch of the Sacred Phoenix Clan who can be ranked in the top 20 among the powerful in the entire God Realm!"]},{"number":4150,"title":"Chapter 4150 Each Has One’s Own Opinion (2)","paragraphs":["4150 Each Has One’s Own Opinion (2)","Huang Tianhao’s expression sank and turned ugly!","Because this was after all in the Floating Sea and the Island Master was much stronger than him, hence he actually didn’t dare to kill him on the spot.","He just wanted to take advantage of this opportunity to seriously injure Li Moying, and it would be best if he could stay in bed for a few months.","On the one hand, to give this god-level genius an unforgettable lesson. On the other hand, if Li Moying was seriously injured at this juncture, he will definitely not be able to participate in the next round of competition.","Originally, the position of champion of the Cloudy Qilin Clan was definitely settled, but now it can be vacated.","Moreover, since it was Li Moying who injured Huang Beicheng, the genius of the Sacred Phoenix Clan, under the watchful eyes of everyone, and provoked him first, it is reasonable for him as the Patriarch to bully the small, and he will not be accused by too many people.","His wishful thinking was well planned, but he never expected that Li Moying could actually block his move!","Even if he only used 30% to 40% of his power, it was still a blow from someone at the top of the Dao Profound Realm!","Comparing Li Moying at the late stage of the Heart Profound Realm and him who was at the peak of the Dao Profound Realm, his cultivation has spanned an entire realm!","Logically speaking, one finger could crush Li Moying to death.","But now, Li Moying just vomited blood?!","What kind of perverted talent was this to achieve such strength?","Huang Tianhao looked at Li Moying in shock, and after he realised it, a cold murderous aura suddenly flashed in his eyes!","Since Li Moying is so strong, how could he let him continue to live, otherwise, when he grows up, who else can suppress him? He’s afraid his strength will soon catch up to those hidden old monsters of the Life Profound Realm!","At that time, what will happen to the Sacred Phoenix Clan? Was there any need to talk about it?","Therefore, Li Moying must die!","Moreover, today was the best opportunity. He has enough reasons to make a move, and there were no other experts present to stop him...","Huang Tianhao’s mind moved extremely fast, and he made up his mind even faster. He stretched out his hand and pointed at the sky and another barrage of flames fell from the sky and condensed on him.","Li Moying was swept by his cold eyes, and soon understood his thoughts, and was about to dodge.","At this moment, a loud shout suddenly came from not far away.","“Huang Tianhao! Stop it!”","Huang Tianhao didn’t expect someone to stop him, he was still a master with the same level of cultivation as him, so he couldn’t help being surprised.","However, Li Moying kept staring at him. Seeing that Huang Tianhao was about to retreat, he immediately took advantage of the vacancy and made a sudden attack with all his strength!","Huang Tianhao was still aggressive just now, and wanted to kill Li Moying on the spot, but in a few breaths, the situation was reversed, and he was flanked by both front and back.","His expression suddenly changed, and he tried his best to dodge.","The cultivators attacking him from behind were obviously stronger, so he had to give priority to it.","This way, all the weaknesses were exposed in front of Li Moying.","A loud “Boom” reverberated.","Huang Tianhao’s body was sent flying, and he fell to the ground unsteadily.","Although he stabilised his body while falling in the air, his feet landed firmly.","However, the cultivators present still showed expressions of shock!","Because, Li Moying actually injured Huang Tianhao!"]},{"number":4151,"title":"Chapter 4151 Each Has One’s Own Opinion (3)","paragraphs":["4151 Each Has One’s Own Opinion (3)","There was a big gap between the two of them, it was very, very difficult for Li Moying to injure Huang Tianhao.","To put it simply, the attack power of ordinary cultivators at the late stage of the Heart Profound Realm cannot destroy Huang Tianhao’s defense, so no matter how they fight, the cultivators at the Dao Profound Realm were sure to win.","Now, just by looking at the movement of Huang Tianhao covering his chest, one can know how fierce and unstoppable Li Moying’s attack was just now!","Those cultivators who had fought against Li Moying on Paradise Island all subconsciously shuddered and suddenly realized how lucky they were.","If such an attack had fallen on them, they would have been a cold corpse by now.","Being able to live until now was definitely the result of Li Moying’s mercy.","Huang Tianhao fell to the ground, his face flushed red all of a sudden!","To him, the injury was still an insignificant matter. After all, it was not a serious injury. However, as the Patriarch of the Sacred Phoenix Clan and a powerhouse at the peak of the Dao Profound Realm, he was injured by a junior. This was a big embarrassment!","He took a deep breath, turned his head, and looked at Li Shihong who was standing not far away.","“Li Shihong! You actually sneaked an attack on me? As the Patriarch of an Ancient God Clan, you can be considered a respectable figure. How could you do such a despicable thing?”","Li Shihong’s complexion was even uglier than his!","As soon as he arrived on the island just now, he saw the scene of Li Moying being attacked by Huang Tianhao, and he almost died of fright!","Fortunately, Li Moying’s strength was good, he blocked Huang Tianhao’s first attack, and he made a timely move to save Li Moying without any injuries.","However, now Huang Tianhao was the injured one, this itself was a surprise.","He glanced at Huang Tianhao, and said in a cold voice: “Huang Tianhao, you are really a thief shouting thief! You Sacred Phoenix Clan are really brazen villains! As a majestic Patriarch, you actually attacked our clan’s juniors! I never knew that you were still so shameless? Besides, this is on Paradise Island! Did you think that you are the owner of the island?”","Naturally, Huang Tianhao couldn’t admit his mistake, so he immediately refuted loudly.","“Li Shihong, make it clear that it was Li Moying who made the first move! If he hadn’t taken the opportunity to beat up our clansmen, why would I not be able to resist? If he dares to provoke our Sacred Phoenix Clan first, he must be prepared to be taught a lesson!”","Hearing this, Li Shihong glanced at Huang Beicheng, who was sitting not far away from his wounds, with a look of sarcasm in his eyes.","“Oh? The clansman you are talking about is Huang Beicheng, right? I heard that Huang Beicheng is the number one genius of your generation of the Sacred Phoenix Clan! Coincidentally, Moying is also the number one genius of our clan. The number one genius against the first genius, this is called a fair duel, the trash skills in your clan are not as good as others, you deserve to be beaten and killed! And as a Dao Profound Realm powerhouse, how can you attack a junior?”","Li Shihong spoke so convincingly that Huang Tianhao vomited.","Huang Tianhao sneered and said: “Alright, alright, I have learned a lot today! You Cloudy Qilin Clan are really eloquent, and you can turn the truth around if you provoke first! Do you want to formally start a war with the Sacred Phoenix Clan? Huh!”","After the Patriarch of the Sacred Phoenix Clan said such words, the smell of gunpowder in the air became more intense.","Everyone looked nervously at Huang Tianhao and Li Shihong, who were on the verge of sword fighting, with their hearts in their throats.","They won’t really want to start a war on Paradise Island, will they?","“Two Patriarchs, don’t be impulsive!”"]},{"number":4152,"title":"Chapter 4152 Each Has One’s Own Opinion (4)","paragraphs":["4152 Each Has One’s Own Opinion (4)","Not only the two Patriarchs, but behind them, the cultivators of the two great Ancient God Clans have already clenched their Spirit Armaments, ready to strike at any time.","Seeing that a big battle was about to break out, at this moment, a powerful profound force suddenly shrouded Paradise Island.","Immediately afterwards, a teleportation halo appeared in midair, and there were two middle-aged cultivators standing inside.","It was the Left and Right Protectors who were in charge of managing the Floating Sea for the Island Master.","The Island Master seldom shows up. To ordinary cultivators, the two of them were the actual power holders of Floating Sea.","Even Li Shihong and Huang Tianhao had to give face when they saw them.","The expressions of both of them changed slightly, and they turned around to salute each other.","“Your Excellencies, I’m sorry!”","“Hey, Patriarch Li, Patriarch Huang, let me tell you what to do with you? This is a God Realm’s Grand Meet! How can you formally declare war here?”","“That’s right, the conflict between the two of you can’t be dealt with after the Grand Meet is over?”","Li Shihong and Huang Tianhao declared war on each other. Originally, they were impulsive. Now that the Left and Right Protectors have appeared, they still want to be peacemakers. After thinking about it, they both decided to give in.","Anyway, the enmity between the two families has not lasted for a day or two. You can settle accounts at any time, and there is no need to start a war in the Floating Sea. Offending a peerless powerhouse like the Island Master for no reason will be of no benefit to the two families.","“Hmph! You are lucky. If the two of you hadn’t agreed to make peace, I would bath your Cloudy Qilin Clan in blood today! Let’s go!”","Huang Tianhao left some harsh words, waved his hand behind him, and signalled the clansmen to leave with him.","However, he had just taken a step when suddenly, a figure rushed out from the slanting spine, blocking his way.","“Patriarch Huang, where do you want to go?”","Huang Tianhao paused for a moment, then froze for a moment.","When he saw the figure in front of him clearly, his face suddenly became ugly, “You brat, what else do you want? You are lucky today, and that old thief Li Shihong just arrived, otherwise...you won’t be able to be so lucky next time! Why don’t you get out soon?”","However, Li Moying did not move at all, showing no intention of retreating at all.","“Patriarch Huang, I won’t let you leave unless you tell me exactly where Huang Sanbai is!”","Huang Tianhao never expected that Li Moying would dare to stop him. The anger in his heart was finally suppressed, and now it surged up again.","“Brat, are you courting death?! I’ve already said that Elder Sanbai is not on Paradise Island!”","“No, he must have come to Paradise Island, let him get out! The Sacred Phoenix Clan must give me an explanation for today’s incident!” Li Moying’s expression was gloomy, his eyes were already covered with bloodshot eyes, and his usual days were long gone. The demeanor of the personable noble Young Master was no longer there, he looked more like a devil from hell instead.","Li Shihong was shocked when he saw him like this.","“Moying, you... what’s wrong with you? Did something happen on Paradise Island? What’s going on?”","When he came here just now, he only saw Huang Tianhao attacking Li Moying. He thought it was an all-time quarrel between the two clans, so he didn’t think deeply about it.","Now that he saw Li Moying being so abnormal, he realised that something was wrong.","Li Moying is usually the most calm and stable, almost never when he is so out of order, even if he loses control of his emotions occasionally, Young Miss Li will be responsible for comforting him.","Wait, where is Young Miss Li?"]},{"number":4153,"title":"Chapter 4153 Young Miss Li Is Still Alive! (1)","paragraphs":["4153 Young Miss Li Is Still Alive! (1)","Only then did Li Shihong realise that a person who should have appeared here seems to have disappeared!","He suddenly had a bad feeling, and quickly turned his head to look around, trying to find her.","However, before he could see clearly, Li Moying’s cold voice sounded from beside him.","“Patriarch, there’s no need to search any further. Little Li’er was ambushed by Huang Sanbai on Paradise Island, and she hasn’t come out until now. I’m afraid something untoward has happened!”","“What?! What did you say?!”","Li Shihong’s expression suddenly changed!","He never thought that he would hear such news!","“How is it possible? People from the Sacred Phoenix Clan are so desperate?!”","Even though he is the Patriarch of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, he can be said to be one of the people who hate the Sacred Phoenix Clan the most in the entire God Realm, but for a moment he couldn’t believe it was true!","Doing this kind of thing is no longer a word that can be described as bold and reckless!","By doing this, the Sacred Phoenix Clan is already blatantly trampling on the covenant between the major God Clans, and they will definitely be criticised by thousands of people.","It was absolutely impossible for a person with a clear mind to do such a stupid trick.","Could it be that the fact that the Cloudy Qilin Clan has two god-level geniuses has already driven the entire Sacred Phoenix Clan crazy?","Huang Tianhao immediately yelled: “Brat, what are you talking nonsense about? How can you utter such blatant words?! It’s obviously you, who secretly assassinated a god-level genius of our Sacred Phoenix Clan a few months ago, but you bullied us instead! There’s no evidence, we have been refusing to admit it, and now we are still being accused and treated as a target? Elder Sanbai has always acted prudently, tell me, will he kill your wife?”","“Do you think that people from our Sacred Phoenix Clan are really fools? Will you believe your nonsense? What kind of god-level talented human woman, whoever believes is stupid! Will we still kill her?”","From the beginning to the end, Huang Tianhao did not believe that Huang Sanbai would go after Huang Yueli.","It’s just that he just wanted to take this opportunity to kill Li Moying, so he didn’t explain it at all.","Now, the two sides stop fighting. Seeing that he can’t kill Li Moying this time, and the Left and Right Protectors of Floating Sea are also here, Huang Tianhao doesn’t dare to talk nonsense, and hastened to explain for his clansmen.","After hearing Huang Tianhao’s words, the members of the Sacred Phoenix Clan all burst into laughter.","“That’s right! Do you really think that any lie can fool us?”","“What is the second god-level genius, you can lie to ghosts!”","“If you want me to tell you, it must be the bastards of the Cloudy Qilin Clan who made up a nonsense story about a god-level genius. Now that the rematch is approaching, the lie can’t be concealed, so they planned this out, saying that the god-level genius is dead! ”","“It’s fine if you love acting so much, but you still have to pour dirty water on the heads of our Sacred Phoenix Clan! It’s just too shameless!”","Amidst the discussions, no one noticed that the face of Huang Beicheng, who had fallen to the ground, was pale.","Among the cultivators present, only he and his few cronies know the true strength of Li Moying’s wife!","However, of course he won’t be so stupid as to jump out at this time.","A bit of anger grew on Li Moying’s face, and he snorted coldly, “Shut up!”","As he opened his mouth, an oppressive force swept towards the Sacred Phoenix Clan. Those young clansmen who were chattering immediately felt that their chests were suffocated, and they couldn’t say a word.","They were so shocked that they didn’t dare to speak.","Even if that human girl’s talent was fake, but Li Moying’s talent was real!"]},{"number":4154,"title":"Chapter 4154 Young Miss Li Is Still Alive! (2)","paragraphs":["4154 Young Miss Li Is Still Alive! (2)","Li Moying turned to Huang Tianhao again, his expression sank as his cold gaze lingered on him.","“Huang Tianhao, do you think you know Huang Sanbai very well? You can’t imagine why he killed someone!”","Huang Tianhao was disapproving, and said with a sneer, “I don’t know Elder Sanbai, do you know? What a joke! Then tell me, why did he kill your fiancée?”","Li Moying sneered, and had made up her mind to thoroughly expose the truth behind the scenes.","Now that Little Li’er was dead, there was no point in keeping a secret.","On the contrary, he really wanted to see, if Huang Tianhao knew that what Huang Sanbai killed was a god-level genius of their Sacred Phoenix Clan, and the purpose was to snatch the Sky Phoenix Ring and take the position of Patriarch, what would happen to him?","Li Moying stared at Huang Tianhao, and said word by word: “He actually killed...”","“Two Patriarchs, please stop! Young Miss Li should not be dead yet!”","Just as he was about to tell the truth, the Right Protector suddenly spoke out eagerly, interrupting their conversation.","“I just ordered someone to count the cultivators who passed the elimination round, and found that there are only 999 people on the list! That is to say, the last batch of cultivators who were sent out just now are only 999 people! This missing person, It should be Young Miss Li!”","Hearing this, all the cultivators present were shocked.","No one thought that after the results of the competition came out, all cultivators thought that those who hadn’t appeared must be dead.","Unexpectedly, the Right Protector suddenly said such words!","Only 999 people were sent out, which means that there is still one person in the array on Paradise Island, and it must be a living person!","Otherwise, the number of people who passed the elimination round would be wrong.","This kind of array that has been passed down from ancient times is extremely precise. It has been in operation for hundreds of thousands of years without making any mistakes. It is impossible for something to go wrong at this juncture.","So...that Young Miss Li was still alive?","Li Moying also came to his senses very quickly, and quickly turned to the Right Protector, and asked incredulously, “Your Excellency, the Right Protector, are you...are you sure?”","the Right Protector nodded, “I’ve read the list myself, and there’s no mistake! Young Miss Li should still be in it.”","Li Moying frowned, “But, why didn’t she come out? The big array should be filled with poisonous mist now, and she must be very dangerous inside. Is there any way you can open the big array and let her come out?”","Hearing this, the Right Protector showed a somewhat troubled look on his face.","“This... well, this is actually the most difficult thing to do! I have ordered someone to search for Young Miss Li’s location, but I didn’t get any clear results. I speculate that Young Miss Li’s teleportation token should have been lost or it was damaged, so the location cannot be determined. Under such circumstances, it is too difficult to find her!”","Li Moying had relaxed and heaved a sigh of relief at first, but when he heard the following words, he felt his chest tightened and almost spat out a mouthful of blood.","Li Shihong was also in a hurry, and asked: “Your Excellency, can’t you think of a way? We all know how powerful this poisonous mist is, and Young Miss Li has been in the poisonous mist for a long time. Even if she is extremely talented, she can’t bear such a poison! We must rescue her quickly, otherwise, even if she is not dead now, after a few hours, I’m afraid...”"]},{"number":4155,"title":"Chapter 4155 Young Miss Li Is Still Alive! (3)","paragraphs":["4155 Young Miss Li Is Still Alive! (3)","Li Shihong didn’t say the whole thing, but everyone could understand what he meant.","Her current situation can be described as narrowly escaping death.","If they wanted to save her, the only thing that could be done was to seize every second and take rescue actions as soon as possible.","As long as they were a little late, it was very likely that they would find Huang Yueli’s cold body instead!","The Right Protector showed a serious expression on his face, “Patriarch Li, of course I understand what you mean, but this matter is really difficult to handle! Paradise Island is so big, even if I mobilise all the stewards to find someone together, it will take quite a bit of effort. It may even take a few days. Moreover, the poisonous mist is in the big array now, even if you take the antidote and enter it, one’s body will be damaged to a certain extent. I can’t let the stewards of Floating Sea take such a risk for a human woman!”","The Right Protector’s words were reasonable, but they were completely unacceptable to the ears of Cloudy Qilin Clan cultivators!","Even the only right minister who had the possibility to save the person showed his attitude and did not intend to do his best to save the person, so... are they allowed to stay here and watch Huang Yueli die in the big array, but helpless?","A cold glint flashed by Li Moying’s eyes as he strode out, stood opposite of the Right Protector and stretched out his hand.","“Your Excellency, I heard people say that you Floating Sea has a kind of elixir that can allow cultivators to move freely in the poisonous mist. Since you don’t plan to save people, can you give me a bottle of elixir? I’ll find her myself in the big array, and there’s no need to bother anyone else!”","The Right Protector was stunned for a moment, and then said: “I have the antidote for poisonous mist here. However, this antidote itself has a certain degree of toxicity, and each person can only take three pills. If there are more than three pills, I’m afraid you don’t need it. If you enter the poisonous mist, you will be poisoned to death by the toxicity of the antidote itself! And this antidote, one can only guarantee that the poison will not invade for an hour.”","“In other words, you only have three hours to find people. And Paradise Island is so big, finding her by yourself is no different than finding a needle in a haystack!”","The Right Protector was kind and tried to dissuade him.","However, these words could not stop Li Moying’s determination. He said expressionlessly: “Your Excellency, I will remember your advice. Now, can you give me the elixir?”","Seeing the right person’s persuasion was ineffective, he sighed and took out a small porcelain bottle from his sleeve.","“There are about 20 pills in this bottle, you can use them, sigh!”","He let out a long sigh, apparently thinking that it was impossible for Li Moying to find Huang Yueli. Even if he entered the array again, he would just do his best. In fact, the result was already preordained.","Li Moying took the pill, poured out three pills under everyone’s gaze, and swallowed them with her head raised.","Then he turned around and walked towards a teleportation array behind Paradise Island.","Through that array, they can be teleported back to the inside of the large array they left just now.","Only then did Li Shihong come to his senses, and hurriedly chased after him, trying to stop him, “Moying, Moying, you...don’t be so impulsive! Young Miss Li is missing, I know you are worried, but...you can’t put yourself at risk! With the elixir, I can send someone to help you find her, there’s no need for you to go in person.”"]},{"number":4156,"title":"Chapter 4156 Young Miss Li Is Still Alive! (4)","paragraphs":["4156 Young Miss Li Is Still Alive! (4)","“Come back quickly!”","Li Moying’s figure disappeared into the teleportation array in an instant.","This time, even the Right Protector changed his face.","He gave Li Moying so many elixirs just now, thinking that he would give some of the elixirs to his clansmen and let them help him find someone together!","Although they still couldn’t find the same thing, the Right Protector felt that this could at least appease Li Moying.","But who knew, Li Moying swallowed three pills without even thinking about it, and didn’t pass the medicine bottle to anyone else, just kept it and entered the teleportation array directly.","He... What exactly does he want?","...","At the same time.","In the big array of Paradise Island, the poisonous mist has spread to every corner of the array.","The gathering and dissipating of this poisonous mist had always been regular.","Every thirty years, the poisonous mist will disappear for about seven days, and then slowly condense again.","And this short clear time was the time for the preliminary competition of each God Realm’s Grand Meet.","Huang Yueli’s petite body was completely submerged in the poisonous mist.","She lay quietly on the ground, motionless. If anyone passed by, that person would definitely think that what they saw was just a corpse that hadn’t decomposed yet.","But in fact, Huang Yueli did not die.","Although she couldn’t move her body, she still had consciousness in her mind.","Not only that, she also felt a strange numbness in her body, which gradually turned into a painful and itchy feeling, like countless thin needles piercing her meridians repeatedly, feeling extremely uncomfortable.","If she could move, she would have rolled on the ground to relieve the itching.","However, now she can’t even move a finger, and can only endure such pain in silence.","Huang Yueli knew very well that once the poisonous mist entered her dantian through the meridians, and entered her brain, she would die completely.","For her now, waiting for death was the only way out.","The poisonous mist gradually seeped into her dantian...","The pain in her body became more and more intense...","At this moment, she suddenly felt a strange force rising from her dantian!","That was the evil qi that she absorbed into her body in Saint Iniquitous Shadow’s secret realm the last time.","For her at that time, these evil qi were too strong, so she couldn’t fully absorb them and could only store them in a certain position in her dantian. She was waiting for her strength to improve in the future before she could slowly refine them.","But now, the poisonous mist had actually triggered this evil qi and there was actually a strong resonance between the two!","With each portion of poisonous mist engaged, a part of the evil qi will be released, and this part of the evil qi, fused with the poisonous mist, had actually achieved the effect of fighting poison with poison.","The energy formed by the fusion of poisonous and evil qi circulated through Huang Yueli’s meridians, and was gradually absorbed by her, becoming a part of her profound energy!","Huang Yueli was overjoyed!","Judging from this trend, not only will these poisonous mist not kill her, but it will actually accelerate her strength improvement!"]},{"number":4157,"title":"Chapter 4157 A Blessing In Disguise? (1)","paragraphs":["4157 A Blessing In Disguise? (1)","After Huang Yueli realised this, she relaxed her heart and no longer resisted the invasion of the poisonous mist. Instead, she completely let go of her defences, allowing the poisonous mist to spread freely in her meridians.","As time went by, more and more poisonous mist entered her body, and the fusion with the evil qi became smoother and smoother.","The transformed profound energy circulated repeatedly in her meridians, and every time it circulated, it became more pure.","Huang Yueli’s consciousness became more and more clear, and she could even clearly feel that strength was returning to her body bit by bit.","At the same time, she also began to understand a little bit.","The poisonous mist here seems to be inextricably linked to the evil qi in the Saint Iniquitous Shadow’s secret realm. The two were very similar, and it can even be said that they were the same thing.","It’s just that these poisonous mist were very rough and had too much impact on the human lungs and meridians, making it even more difficult to absorb.","But the evil qi in the Saint Iniquitous Shadow’s secret realm was different.","Not only is it much more pure, but it is also very pure without so many impurities, so it will have better effects when used for cultivation.","Huang Yueli speculated that the so-called evil qi might have the same source as the green poisonous mist.","It’s just that evil qi is purified poisonous mist.","She just doesn’t know whether the poisonous mist in some places has been purified naturally, or it was the result of artificial purification.","Just as Huang Yueli was thinking, the strength in her body had recovered by about thirty to forty percent.","If she were to fight with others now, relying on this strength, the decline in strength was definitely more than one level.","However, if she just wanted to stand up and walk around, there was no basic problem, she could move freely.","However, Huang Yueli had no intention of getting up, she was still lying on the ground, quietly absorbing the poisonous mist around her.","She even started to practice the “Iniquitous Shadow Secret Manual” and started refining.","Although the current environment was a bit difficult, it was a very rare opportunity to have such a strong evil qi for her to practice!","Usually, it was difficult to find such a place!","After she chose to take the initiative to refine, her cultivation speed has indeed increased, and more and more profound energy has been transformed!","Huang Yueli was secretly happy when she suddenly felt something was wrong.","She listened carefully, and felt that she seemed to have heard a very soft voice coming from around her.","Although it was very soft, it seemed to come from very, very far away.","However, she was secretly surprised.","Because, she has been in the poisonous mist for so long, and the surroundings were peaceful, without even a little movement, as if everything had fallen into dead silence.","Although this dead silence makes people panic, it also represents safety.","But now, she suddenly heard the noise again, which meant that the environment she thought was very safe was actually not so safe. The poisonous mist in front of her was so thick that even she could hardly perceive things in the distance, and could not see what happened in the poisonous mist?","Huang Yueli gradually withdrew from her state of cultivation and got up from the ground.","“No, I have to go and see what’s going on. If it’s not safe here, I’d better leave as soon as possible. If I want to come back to practice, there should be a chance in the future.”","After making up her mind, she turned around and walked slowly towards the direction of the sound.","...","At this moment, Li Moying has also entered the poisonous mist.","Moreover, he has been walking through the poisonous mist for nearly six hours."]},{"number":4158,"title":"Chapter 4158 A Blessing In Disguise? (2)","paragraphs":["4158 A Blessing In Disguise? (2)","From the moment he entered the array, he released all his spiritual consciousness to search for Huang Yueli’s whereabouts.","Paradise Island could accommodate hundreds of thousands of cultivators to conduct trials at the same time, covering an extremely large area.","Moreover, the poisonous mist will paralyse people’s nerves, affect people’s judgement, and greatly reduce the coverage of spiritual consciousness.","It took Li Moying a lot of effort to complete the exploration of the eastern area of Paradise Island. This was thanks to him being a hundred times stronger than ordinary cultivators. Otherwise, it would have taken a hundred times more time to complete it.","“This leaves 70% to 80% of the range to search...Damn it! This island is really too big! It will take at least two days to search the entire area and I don’t know how long Little Li’er can last! I hope my luck is good and I will be able to get close to the area where Little Li’er has been active.”","Li Moying was extremely anxious. Although his mental and physical strength were completely exhausted, he didn’t even take out a single moment to sit down and rest as he continued to head towards the southern area of the island.","He must seize every moment of his time and find Huang Yueli as soon as possible!","Just as he was stepping forward, Li Moying’s body suddenly shook, his legs went limp and he almost fell to his knees.","He reacted extremely quickly. He pulled out the long sword at his waist and inserted it into the ground. Only then did he support himself without falling over.","“Tsk! The action time of this elixir is really too short! You have to take it every hour...”","He cursed and at the same time took out the medicine bottle given to him by the Right Protector from his sleeve, poured out a pill from it, stuffed it into his mouth without hesitation and swallowed it with his head raised.","This was already the sixth pill he has taken!","If Li Shihong and the others were here, they would definitely be distressed and would try their best to stop him from taking the medicine.","Because the Right Protector had clearly warned him sternly that this medicine must not be taken in excess, and a cultivator could only take at most three pills!","Otherwise, there will definitely be serious consequences, which will cause irreversible damage to the body.","Li Moying naturally heard these words, but from the very beginning, he had no intention of obeying the Right Protector’s orders.","Now that his Little Li’er whose life and death was hanging by a thread, why would he pay heed about the side effects of the pill?","Unless he would fall to the ground immediately after taking it and would not be able to wake up again, otherwise, he wouldn’t take a few less pills because of some side effects and delay his efforts to find his beloved.","Li Moying swallowed the elixir, and felt that the powerlessness in her body was slightly relieved, and he was finally able to stand firmly on the ground again.","Only then did he take a step, and continued to walk towards the direction he had decided earlier on.","Relying on his amazing willpower, he continued to move forward.","His only goal is to find Huang Yueli and rescue her!","However, one hour passed, two hours passed, three hours...","In the blink of an eye, another five hours passed.","Li Moying has almost searched the southern area, but he still hasn’t sensed Huang Yueli.","He frowned, planning to head over to the western region.","At this moment, Li Moying suddenly spat out a mouthful of blood!"]},{"number":4159,"title":"Chapter 4159 A Blessing In Disguise? (3)","paragraphs":["4159 A Blessing In Disguise? (3)","“Cough cough, cough, cough!”","He felt an excruciating pain in his chest.","This pain came too suddenly and too violently. Even with his willpower, he couldn’t suppress it. He could not help but fall to the ground and curled up in pain.","And at that moment, the medicine bottle in his hand fell to the ground and the pills rolled out of the bottle.","Li Moying’s eyes turned black for a while, but he still relied on his amazing willpower to forcefully support the ground and prop up his upper body. At the same time, he reached out to touch the pill on the ground, intending to continue to swallow the twelfth pill!","However, his hands were shaking too much, and he fumbled around several times, but he couldn’t pick any pill up.","“Damn it! This poisonous mist is too powerful! And this medicine, the side effects occur so quickly! What should I do now?!”","Li Moying was very anxious, but in his heart, his body was not important, what was important was that he couldn’t continue looking for Little Li’er now!","Could it be that the two of them can only die here together?","However, this was also good...","Although very unwilling, at least they died in the same array...","Li Moying finally lost control of his body and fell to the ground. At the same time, his consciousness was a little blurred.","When he was unconscious, he seemed to hear a familiar voice not far away.","“Hmm... The sound I heard just now should have come from nearby, right? What happened here? It’s strange...”","“The poisonous mist here is so thick! I can’t see anything clearly... How annoying!”","“Ah! There seems to be a living person!”","Huang Yueli looked around along the way, and walked towards this side.","Because of the thick fog, she couldn’t see the surrounding situation, so she could only use her spiritual sense to investigate.","Just near the place where Li Moying fell to the ground, she finally noticed that something was wrong nearby. The fluctuation of profound strength was so obvious, it was obvious that there were living cultivators nearby!","“Besides, why is this aura a bit like... Moying?!”","The moment this thought crossed her mind, Huang Yueli’s feelings had gone awry.","When the distance between the two was less than a hundred metres, Huang Yueli finally saw the person lying on the ground, and immediately screamed in horror.","“What’s wrong with you?! Why are you in the poisonous mist and didn’t go out? You...you... wake up... wake up!”","Huang Yueli squatted down, and saw that the corners of his mouth were covered with blood, she panicked immediately, and didn’t dare to push him casually, so she could only raise her hand to feel his breath in front of his nose.","Fortunately, he was still breathing!","Huang Yueli felt a little relieved, and started calling in his ear again.","“Moying? Moying? What’s wrong with you? Can you wake up?!”","In fact, Li Moying had already heard her voice at this time, but his body was extremely heavy, and he couldn’t move no matter what, so he couldn’t respond to her.","Moreover, Li Moying was still a little confused, not knowing how Huang Yueli escaped.","Shouldn’t she have been corroded by the poisonous mist long ago and fell to the ground, unable to move at all?","Is this lively little fox really his wife?","Could it be just his hallucination?"]},{"number":4160,"title":"Chapter 4160 A Blessing In Disguise? (4)","paragraphs":["4160 A Blessing In Disguise? (4)","Seeing Li Moying not moving at all, Huang Yueli also understood that he was poisoned by the poisonous mist.","However, she frowned, full of puzzlement.","Because, Li Moying was also a cultivator who has studied the “Iniquitous Shadow Secret Manual”! Even the evil qi he absorbed into his body was a little bit more than hers, and his own cultivation base was slightly higher than Huang Yueli’s, so the effect of his cultivation in the poisonous mist should be better than hers!","Even if the poisonous mist invaded his body and made him unable to move at first, he should be able to move freely within a few hours.","As for vomiting blood, it’s even less likely to happen!","What’s wrong with this?","Thinking of this, Huang Yueli began to worry again.","She squeezed Li Moying’s wrist, checked the condition of his meridians, and found that not only was he not absorbing the evil qi in the poisonous mist, but even his own profound strength seemed to be suppressed, and even started to bite back.","“What’s going on?”","Huang Yueli frowned and thought for a while, but couldn’t figure it out.","At this moment, out of the corner of her eye, she caught sight of a few small pills on the ground, and with a heart move, she reached out to pick them up.","She brought it to her mouth and licked it lightly.","Immediately after, Huang Yueli’s expression changed.","“I see, it turned out to be these pills! These pills have the effect of suppressing the spread of evil qi, but the side effect is that they will erode the cultivator’s own profound strength. It seems that this pill should be used to dissolve the effect of this poisonous mist , I guess Huang Sanbai ate the same thing.”","Huang Yueli was also a Spirit Medicine Master. Although her medical skills are not as good as Liu Buyan’s, she has learned a lot from her Senior Brother recently.","She quickly judged that this elixir itself was very toxic, and the main principle was to fight poison with poison.","Therefore, ordinary people must not eat too much, otherwise, not only will they not be able to cure the poison in the poisonous mist, but the poison of the elixir alone can poison people to death!","And Li Moying has such a bottle in her hand...","“Damn it, is Moying desperate? How many pills did he eat to become what he is now?”","Huang Yueli was angry and anxious, and at the same time, an indescribable sourness welled up in her heart, which made her almost cry on the spot!","Li Moying took so many antidotes and kept acting in the poisonous mist for what reason, she couldn’t be so stupid that she couldn’t figure it out!","The news of her disappearance must have reached this man’s ears. He took such a risk in order to save her.","“Idiot, idiot, big idiot! If I hadn’t studied the “Iniquitous Shadow Secret Manual”, I would be dead by now! So what if you found me? Are you happy to find a dead body? It’s better to live outside by yourself!”","“You are the young master of the Cloudy Qilin Clan. If you want status and strength, you can find a second wife even if you die...”","Huang Yueli bit her lip, she really wanted to punch this man, but she couldn’t bear it.","She re-examined the situation in Li Moying’s meridians.","Normally speaking, these poisonous mists weren’t harmful to Li Moying, but the bad thing now was that the antidote he took has suppressed the evil qi in his own dantian, preventing the two parts of evil qi from merging on their own , causing Li Moying to be no different from an ordinary person, being brought down by the poisonous mist.","Therefore, in order for Li Moying to wake up, all he needs to do is to make the evil qi in his body work again."]},{"number":4161,"title":"Chapter 4161 A Blessing In Disguise? (5)","paragraphs":["4161 A Blessing In Disguise? (5)","This was easy to say, but not easy to do.","The detoxification pill that Li Moying ate was extremely effective. Without the prescription, it was impossible to make a corresponding antidote.","Moreover, Li Moying ate too much, more than three times the fatal dose!","To be honest, to be able to live till now, it was all credit to him being a god-level genius. His body had been tempered through ten catastrophes, and he was a hundred times stronger than ordinary cultivators.","Huang Yueli only hesitated for a moment before making up her mind.","“It seems... There is no other way. Fortunately, this is the wilderness, and no one else is...”","She reached out to her chest, unbuttoned it, took off her coat, and threw it aside.","Then, without the slightest hesitation, she continued to undress.","Not long after, she took off her own clothes and started to take off Li Moying’s clothes.","When both of them were naked, she lowered her head and kissed Li Moying’s lips.","At this point, the only thing that can make Li Moying’s situation better was double cultivation!","The Saint Iniquitous Shadow’s Double Cultivation Secret Code was originally created for cultivators to refine evil qi, and it was most suitable for dissolving the poisonous energy in Li Moying’s body.","Moreover, through the pulling and entanglement of the evil qi in Huang Yueli’s body, there was a great possibility to activate the evil qi sealed in Li Moying’s dantian. The two would help each other, and the toxicity build up caused by the pills he had ingested was not worth mentioning. He himself gradually absorbed and dissolved it.","When Huang Yueli took off her clothes, the only thought in her mind was to save people, so she acted decisively.","However, now that the two of them were intimately pressed together, she could feel the scorching heat on the man’s body, as well as the smooth muscles on Li Moying’s body under the palm of her hand...","A pure masculine aura emanated from the body below her, making Huang Yueli’s legs go limp for a while.","The image of her and her husband entangled in double cultivation involuntarily emerged in her mind.","Huang Yueli’s cheeks became hot all of a sudden, and she felt a little embarrassed.","However, thinking of Li Moying’s current physical condition, she suppressed her shyness and moved closer.","There has always been a very good fit between the two.","Although Li Moying’s body was weak at this time, his consciousness has not completely disappeared, and he can still feel the girl touching him back and forth.","A tingling feeling rushed straight to his forehead.","Li Moying couldn’t help snorting. At that moment, he clearly felt that the evil qi in his dantian suddenly gushed out and merged with the evil qi that Huang Yueli imbued into his meridians.","At the same time, he discovered that he could actually move!","The power that was gradually eroded in the poisonous mist gradually returned to his body.","He moved his body, and Huang Yueli felt it immediately, and immediately revealed a look of surprise.","“Moying, you... you’re awake!! Great, how do you feel now? Is there any other discomfort?”","Huang Yueli also woke up from the entanglement, and propped up her body with her arms, trying to get off him.","However, as soon as she moved, her wrist was firmly grasped by a powerful palm.","Immediately afterwards, she felt dizzy.","Li Moying turned over and pressed her to the ground.","“Mo... Moying?!” Huang Yueli immediately felt the danger.","Li Moying leaned close to her ear, and said with a low laugh, “I’m uncomfortable in one place, very uncomfortable!”"]},{"number":4162,"title":"Chapter 4162 A Blessing In Disguise? (6)","paragraphs":["4162 A Blessing In Disguise? (6)","“Little Li’er, I know you care about me the most, and you will definitely help me heal, right?”","Huang Yueli’s palm-sized face flushed instantly, “Yes...to you big-headed bastard... boo hoo hoo!!”","Before she could finish speaking, her lips were tightly blocked, and she couldn’t make a sound.","Only intermittent gasps leaked from her lips...","...","She did not know how long it had been.","Huang Yueli couldn’t help but push away the man who had been pressing on her and refused to let go no matter what.","“Alright, you...that’s enough!” Her voice was a little hoarse.","Li Moying buried his head in her neck and muttered, “Not enough, of course not enough! It’s been several months...”","They were first attacked by Huang Sanbai in the Saint Iniquitous Shadow’s Secret Realm, and later Li Moying was rescued back to the Cloudy Qilin Clan. The two separated, and after they met again, Liu Buyan was in the way.","Little Li’er believed his nonsense and resolutely refused to let him touch her!","Until now, he has not been able to enjoy his husband privileges!","This made him reluctant to let go of his mouth no matter what, he had to eat until he was full to be satisfied.","However, Huang Yueli was so tired that she could barely open her eyelids. Moreover, she was still thinking about the situation outside, so she finally couldn’t bear it anymore, and slapped the man away.","“That’s enough, I’m warning you, Li Moying! Didn’t you say that you will listen to me for all the big and small things at home? Do you want to renegade? Get up quickly, the two of us have been missing for so long, and we don’t know what’s going on outside!”","Li Moying was thrown to the ground by his own wife and he simply lay lazily on the ground without getting up.","“What are you in a hurry for? Chaos is chaos. What does it have to do with us? Besides, how chaotic can it be?”","What Li Moying didn’t say was that the biggest mess was caused by him in the teleportation array before he came in!","No matter how chaotic the outside is now, it’s impossible to be more chaotic than before.","After all, without him...","...","After Li Moying entered the array, the Cloudy Qilin Clan and the Sacred Phoenix Clan did confront each other outside for a long time.","This is because the Left and Right Protectors were watching from the sidelines. They represent the authority of the Island Master. Even as the Patriarchs of the two esteemed Ancient God Clans, they dare not make mistakes easily.","On the other hand, when Li Moying entered the array, the cultivators of the Cloudy Qilin Clan were all concerned about his safety, and they had no intention of settling accounts with the Sacred Phoenix Clan.","However, as time passed, the atmosphere between the two races became more and more tense.","Because... Li Moying never came out!","The right minister said that a person can take up to three pills, which means that a person can stay in the poisonous mist for up to three hours.","But when three hours came, Li Moying did not appear.","Li Shihong’s complexion suddenly changed, “Damn it, Moying won’t rely on his outstanding talent to just... take pills indiscriminately, right?”","Not only did he think so, but the elders of the Cloudy Qilin Clan all thought of the same point, and all of them began to look ugly.","They have all seen with their own eyes how Li Moying usually protects Huang Yueli.","It can be seen that the Young Master of their family has a deep affection for this fiancée. He even said a few days ago that if the clan couldn’t tolerate Huang Yueli, he would leave with her."]},{"number":4163,"title":"Chapter 4163 Island Master’s Decision (1)","paragraphs":["4163 Island Master’s Decision (1)","If he didn’t find Young Miss Li within three hours, then with his usual manner of doing things, he might really continue to take the fourth pill!","An hour passed quickly.","The fourth hour also passed, and Li Moying still did not appear.","The faces of Li Shihong and others became even more ugly, and an ominous premonition arose in their hearts at the same time.","If Li Moying was still inside, then he must have taken the fifth pill by now!","How can this work?","Even if he was a god-level genius and his physical fitness was much stronger than others, but it must be the limit to be able to eat one more. If he eats the fifth... he might really die!","Li Shihong became anxious as he walked up to the Right Protector, cupped his hands and said, “Your Excellency, what should we do now? Moying has obviously been trapped in the big array, and if he doesn’t come out again, his life may be in danger! Your Excellency, please find a way to rescue him!”","The Right Protector’s expression also turned sombre. He never expected that Li Moying’s determination to save people was so strong!","After he took the bottle of detoxification pills, he really couldn’t come out of the big array, and he had lasted been gone for more than four hours!","If he had known that this would happen, he would never have given the pills to Li Moying!","But now, it was too late to say these things.","The Right Protector frowned and shook his head, “Patriarch Li, I understand your mood very well, but I can’t save Young Master Li! To be precise, he probably doesn’t need me to save him either. He has a big array on him. For those who use the teleportation token, as long as the token is crushed, it will be sent out naturally. Even if you encounter danger in the poisonous mist, you can still use that token to contact the outside world, so that we can accurately find his location.”","“Now, there’s no sound inside. The only explanation is that he doesn’t want to come out!”","How could Li Shihong not know this? But it was related to the only god-level genius of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, he couldn’t be as calm as the Right Protector, and was resigned to fate.","“Your Excellency, is there no way to force Moying out?”","The Right Protector shook his head, “If there was such a method, I would have used it just now. It wouldn’t be just right to rescue Young Miss Li directly. How could there be any need for Young Master Li to risk searching himself?”","“But...but...”","Li Shihong was extremely anxious and couldn’t accept such a result!","For the Cloudy Qilin Clan, this was like a bolt from the blue.","First, Young Miss Li was chased and killed by the elders of the Sacred Phoenix Clan, and fell into the poisonous mist. Now, they didn’t know whether she was alive or dead. What’s worse, Li Moying had actually entered the poisonous mist in order to find her. After such a long time, none of them appeared!","If something happened to the two of them, the Cloudy Qilin Clan would lose two god-level geniuses at the same time!","This was a devastating blow!","The cultivators of the Cloudy Qilin Clan looked ugly, but the cultivators of the Sacred Phoenix Clan were all happy.","“Hahahaha, this really makes me laugh to death, you Cloudy Qilin Clan actually have today!”","“Weren’t you still very arrogant a few days ago? You also said that you not only have Li Moying, but also that Young Miss Li is a god-level genius? Now? Why don’t you brag?”","“So, even if you are lucky enough to get something that shouldn’t belong to you, you will lose it sooner or later!”","“If you want me to say, this is retribution at all! Li Moying killed our god-level genius, and now he is dead himself. He deserves it at all. God has eyes!”"]},{"number":4164,"title":"Chapter 4164 Island Master’s Decision (2)","paragraphs":["4164 Island Master’s Decision (2)","The cultivators of the Cloudy Qilin Clan were already depressed and uncomfortable enough.","Hearing these words, everyone was furious.","At the same time, they also recalled that today’s situation was all caused by the Sacred Phoenix Clan, and they couldn’t quell their anger.","“You despicable villains don’t dare to face our Young Master and Young Madame face to face in the God Realm’s Grand Meet, so you resorted to such indecent tricks!”","“It’s simply too shameful for the elders of the clan to assassinate our genius! Your Sacred Phoenix Clan has no lower limit at all, it’s a shame to all our Ancient God Clans!”","“Damn Sacred Phoenix Clan, I want you to pay for the Young Master and Young Madame’s life!”","Many cultivators of the Cloudy Qilin Clan pulled out the Spirit Armaments from their waists on the spot, and attacked towards the Sacred Phoenix Clan.","Naturally, the cultivators of the Sacred Phoenix Clan were not to be outdone, and a fight started immediately.","The left side looked at the right side, and hurriedly wanted to stop it.","“Two patriarchs, what are you doing? How can you fight each other in Floating Sea! What happened to Li Shaozhu and Miss Li, there is no conclusion yet! Besides, even if something happens, the Island Master will help you Make a decision. Tell your people to stop!”","However, Li Shihong was extremely sad and indignant at this time, so he didn’t have the heart to listen to the words of the two peacemakers.","His eyes were red, as if he was about to bleed, he glared at Huang Tianhao viciously, and said through gritted teeth: “Hand over Huang Sanbai to me! Otherwise, our Cloudy Qilin Clan will definitely use all their strength to wash away the blood!” Sacred Phoenix Clan, exterminate your clan!”","“Clan extermination?! Hahahahaha!” Hearing this, Huang Tianhao seemed to have heard some funny joke, and immediately laughed uproariously, “You are too funny! You still think you really have two god-level geniuses? Li Moying is dead, and with the rest of your clan, you can still find a few geniuses, none of them can compare to Huang Beicheng! You still want to bloodbath our Sacred Phoenix Clan? I think... The unlucky ones will be you Cloudy Qilin Clan!”","“Huang Tianhao! Do you really think that our Cloudy Qilin Clan only has this bit of power? In our clan, some are Supreme Elders of the Fate Profound Realm. Once they are dispatched, they will definitely kill your Sacred Phoenix Clan from top to bottom! You Hurry up and hand over Huang Sanbai, I can kill a few less and leave a few drops of blood for your Sacred Phoenix Clan.”","“Hehe, Li Shihong, do you really think I’m a fool? You Cloudy Qilin Clan has a grand elder, but our Sacred Phoenix Clan doesn’t? Elder Sanbai killed him? Just relying on Li Moying’s one-sided words? In my opinion, it’s just that the Cloudy Qilin Clan is shameless and wants to find an excuse to start a war with us!”","Huang Tianhao was not to be outdone at all, and made up his mind to protect Huang Sanbai to the end.","Well, one has to say that Huang Sanbai’s performance to the world was so good!","Huang Tianhao didn’t know Huang Yueli’s real identity at all, let alone Huang Sanbai’s real purpose.","In the eyes of the cultivators of the Sacred Phoenix Clan, Huang Sanbai is now the hero of the entire clan.","This was really a marvellous move!","Not only did she get rid of a suspected god-level Young Miss Li, but she also killed Li Moying, who was a sure-fire god-level.","It was simply killing two birds with one stone!","It’s amazing, it’s really amazing!","“Everyone go to me, kill those bastard sons of the Cloudy Qilin Clan!”","“Trash from the Sacred Phoenix Clan, wait for your death!”","The two sides refused to give in to each other and fought.","For a moment, countless flashes of lightning and flames burst out in the air, and the sound of explosions continued to resound."]},{"number":4165,"title":"Chapter 4165 Island Master’s Decision (3)","paragraphs":["4165 Island Master’s Decision (3)","A big battle was about to break out!","“Two Patriarchs, you... well, how could you be so impulsive! Calm down, please calm down!”","“Yeah, you each have your own opinions now, and we can’t make a judgement, but you should trust the Island Master! There is no Island Master who doesn’t know what happened in the Floating Sea, and he will definitely Do justice to the two of you!”","“Please follow us to meet the Island Master first, and then make a decision!”","The two persuaded them earnestly. However, the Cloudy Qilin Clan and the Sacred Phoenix Clan had a long-standing grievance and there all that was missing was a fuse to start a fight.","Now that Li Moying and Huang Yueli were missing, this was sufficient to start a war.","Especially the cultivators of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, all of their eyes were red, no matter what the Left and Right Protectors said, they still wouldn’t budge an inch.","Even Li Shihong ignored their advice.","The two were extremely helpless and were discussing in low voices how to control the situation and tell the Island Master about this matter.","At this moment, there was a loud noise like rolling spring thunder in the sky.","Suddenly, all the cultivators present felt their bodies sore and limp. The profound energy in their bodies seemed to be sealed by a strange force, and they couldn’t exert it at all.","Without profound strength, a fight would turn into a hand-to-hand fight, basically harmless.","There was a hint of surprise in the eyes of the Left and Right Protectors. They knew that this was the Island Master’s secret move. They didn’t know what mechanism on the island was activated to control the situation.","They hurriedly directed their stewards to pull the two clans apart.","At the same time, stand up and continue to persuade Li Shihong and Huang Tianhao.","“Don’t worry, the two Patriarchs, your clansmen will be fine. It’s just that their profound strength is temporarily blocked. When the stewards send them back to the station and rest for a while, they will recover tomorrow.”","“Two Patriarchs, we just received a voice transmission from the Island Master, let us take the two to the Island Master’s mansion to meet, please come with us? The Island Master will not ignore something that happened in Floating Sea.”","Both Li Shihong and Huang Tianhao were full of reluctance. In their view, the best way to deal with each other was to kill them all. They didn’t feel relieved at all about distinguishing right from wrong and upholding justice!","However, the Island Master’s strength was as high as the sky, and this was his territory. The two Patriarchs can’t compete with him at all.","Li Shihong took several deep breaths before he managed to suppress the resentment in his heart, gritted his teeth and said, “Alright, I’ll go with you! I want to hear what the Island Master has to say! As the majestic master of Floating Sea, if he can’t deal with things fairly, our Cloudy Qilin Clan and the Floating Sea will be at odds in the future!”","With that said, he strode towards the Island Master’s mansion.","The difference from Li Shihong’s magnanimity was that...he actually has a guilty conscience!","Although he refused to admit it, it was just to have a good reason to start a war with the Cloudy Qilin Clan. In fact, he still understood it quite well in his heart.","How could it be possible for others to kill the Young Madame of the Cloudy Qilin Clan without incident? This can only be done by Huang Sanbai!"]},{"number":4166,"title":"Chapter 4166 Island Master’s Decision (4)","paragraphs":["4166 Island Master’s Decision (4)","Of course, there was no definite evidence for such a thing.","No one can guarantee that what they said was true.","Even if everyone in the God Realm can think that Young Miss Li was killed by the Sacred Phoenix Clan, as long as they don’t admit it, no one can say anything.","But now, they were going to the Island Master’s Mansion!","When he was in front of the Island Master, Huang Tianhao was really not sure that things would go smoothly.","Hundreds of years ago, there were rumours in the God Realm that the Island Master knew everything that happened in every inch of the Floating Sea.","Then...if Huang Sanbai murdered someone, can he hide it from his eyes?","Besides, it’s the time of the God Realm’s Grand Meet. Huang Sanbai entered Paradise Island to kill people. This is a provocation to the authority of the Island Master. How could the Island Master stand by their side and appease them?","Once they go to see the Island Master, they will definitely not be able to hide what they did. Not only will the world know about it, but also God knows what the Island Master will do with them?","Thinking of this, Huang Tianhao’s face suddenly changed, “No, I won’t go! The Patriarch of my majestic Sacred Phoenix Clan is no worse than the Island Master in terms of status, so why should I go to visit him like a subordinate?”","When the Left Protector heard his words, his face showed displeasure.","“Patriarch Huang, what do you mean by this? Floating Sea was originally the Island Master’s place, and you guys fought in Floating Sea, don’t you need to explain to the Island Master? If you want to put on the airs of an Ancient God Clan’s Patriarch, you can bring your clan to leave the Floating Sea together, then it has nothing to do with us!”","“You...!”","Huang Tianhao froze for a moment, unable to answer.","If they left like this, they would be considered as withdrawing from the God Realm’s Grand Meet, and it would also mean officially declaring war on Floating Sea.","Floating Sea was originally supposed to be neutral. If he didn’t accept the mediation, it would be very unfavorable for the Sacred Phoenix Clan if the other party fell to the side of the Cloudy Qilin Clan.","Once a war starts, it is really not worthwhile to have an extra enemy for no reason.","Huang Tianhao suppressed his anger. At this moment, he finally calmed down a bit.","By the way, this is still in the process of fighting in the God Realm. Even the Island Master can’t stop the competition directly to deal with the cultivators of the Sacred Phoenix Clan.","Besides, the Island Master has always been too lazy to care about these messy things among the major god races, and generally takes a neutral attitude.","Floating Sea would not be hostile to the Sacred Phoenix Clan because of the death of two irrelevant people from the Cloudy Qilin Clan.","The Left Protector and the Right Protector walked in front and brought the two Patriarchs to the Island Master’s Mansion.","Feeling that the mansion was filled with the profound power of the Fate Profound Realm powerhouse, even the two Patriarchs were secretly shocked.","Huang Tianhao, who was still arrogant just now, had to bow his head at this moment, feeling a little more anxious.","The Island Master has been hidden from the world for many years and has not appeared in front of others, but his strength was stronger than when he appeared last time!","Huang Sanbai’s attack in Floating Sea was really a little thoughtless.","However, everything has been done, and it is too late to regret it now.","The Right Protector went in to report, and came out not long after, signalling the two Patriarchs to follow.","Huang Tianhao could only bite the bullet and walked over together."]},{"number":4167,"title":"Chapter 4167 Island Master’s Decision (5)","paragraphs":["4167 Island Master’s Decision (5)","In the luxurious mansion, the Island Master sat on a high seat in the middle, looking down at the two of them.","The Island Master nodded, and his cold voice reverberated solemnly.","“The Island Master already knows what happened on Paradise Island.”","Hearing this, Li Shihong immediately became excited, “My Lord, you really know everything! These bastards of the Sacred Phoenix Clan killed two god-level geniuses in our clan. They not only refused to admit it, but even threw dirty water on us, they are shameless beyond compare! Please, Island Master, you must uphold justice for us! Those two are the most outstanding geniuses in the God Realm, they can’t just die such a grievous death!”","“Li Shihong, you better wash your mouth clean! How can you slander us like that! Why do you say that they were killed by our Sacred Phoenix Clan? Did you see it with your own eyes? Besides, your Cloudy Qilin Clan also killed the god-level genius of our Sacred Phoenix Clan. Why didn’t you mention it? Huh! Even if we fight back, it is reasonable and no one can stop it!”","Seeing that the two of them had quarrelled again in front of the Island Master, the Right Protector showed an anxious expression. He was afraid that they would anger the Island Master, but he couldn’t speak out to persuade him.","The Island Master snorted coldly.","With this soft sound, a powerful and unparalleled profound force was released, instantly filling the entire hall.","Both Li Shihong and Huang Tianhao’s breathing was stagnant, their chests were churning with blood and they had to shut their mouths.","Seeing that they were silent, the Island Master said unhurriedly, “You don’t have to argue. I called you here because I want to tell you two things.”","Li Shihong and Huang Tianhao quickly looked up at him.","The Island Master said: “First thing, the god-level genius that Patriarch Li just said... is not dead!”","Li Shihong was already extremely desperate. Hearing this, his heart jumped suddenly, as if he came to life instantly.","The whole person was so excited that he almost jumped up.","He widened his eyes in disbelief, shook his head and asked, “What? My Lord? Is what you said true? Li Moying, he...he didn’t die? Then...where’s Young Miss Li?”","The Island Master said slowly: “I don’t know the names of these two, but if the two you mentioned are god-level geniuses, then they are indeed still alive, and...”","Having said that, he paused, as if he didn’t know what to say.","Immediately he coughed twice, “Ahem, anyway, they are doing well now, Patriarch Li doesn’t have to worry too much. You just have to wait patiently for a while, and they will show up. However, I can’t guarantee that they will not miss the God Realm’s Grand Meet, and the next match’s time will not be changed.”","When Li Shihong heard that Li Moying and Huang Yueli were still alive, he was overjoyed.","At this time, how could he care about the little things such as the God Realm’s Grand Meet?","As long as they were alive, this was the best outcome. Nothing else mattered. The rank of God Realm’s Grand Meet was nothing more than a title, so what influence could it have? What was important was that they have two more god-level geniuses!","Only after a moment did he remember that he was in front of the Island Master, and quickly thanked him: “My Lord, thank you so much, if you don’t tell me the news, I don’t know what would I do! Now it’s over, With your words, I feel relieved...”"]},{"number":4168,"title":"Chapter 4168 Island Master’s Decision (6)","paragraphs":["4168 Island Master’s Decision (6)","“My Lord, thank you for sharing the news on their wellbeing. I would like to enquire, how did Young Miss Li fall into the poisonous mist?”","Li Shihong put away his smile, and his face gradually became serious.","Knowing that the two geniuses were not in danger of their lives, after he calmed down, he thought of more critical issues.","“You also know that Young Miss Li is a god-level talent and her strength is quite outstanding. How could she have fallen into the poisonous mist by herself? She even almost died! Someone must have tried to assassinate her and dealt a dark hand! Besides, I don’t believe that Moying would slander others.”","“My Lord, please shed some light. Is the person who attacked Young Miss Li a member of the Sacred Phoenix Clan?”","Li Shihong’s voice became more and more sombre. He glared at Huang Tianhao, wishing he could rush over and tear him in half!","And Huang Tianhao’s face at this time was even more ugly.","He has been peeking at the Island Master’s face, feeling extremely nervous!","The news that the Island Master just said was already a fatal blow to him and the entire Sacred Phoenix Clan!","Li Moying was not dead! That Young Miss Li was not dead either!","If this was the case, it means that Huang Sanbai risked his life to do such a big thing, but it didn’t succeed!","If it was possible to kill two god-level geniuses, it will be worth whatever price the Sacred Phoenix Clan pays.","But now, the two of them are still alive...","Then if the conspiracy was revealed, wouldn’t the Sacred Phoenix Clan not get any benefits, and become street rats that everyone shouts and beats?","Huang Tianhao was extremely anxious and wanted to prevent the Island Master from telling the truth.","However, how could an expert at the Life Profound Realm like the Island Master listen to him?","Huang Tianhao’s complexion was pale, almost waiting to die.","It was at this moment that the Island Master spoke slowly, “This matter... Please don’t pursue this matter, Patriarch Li.”","“What?!”","“What?!”","Li Shihong and Huang Tianhao exclaimed at the same time.","Li Shihong was so angry that his face was flushed, and he didn’t even care that he was facing the Island Master, so he yelled indignantly, “Island Master, you are... You are clearly protecting the bastards of the Sacred Phoenix Clan! What do they have to do with Floating Sea? Island Master, you have always been known for being fair, but this time you are so biased!”","Huang Tianhao was actually a hundred times more surprised than him!","Because, Huang Tianhao himself didn’t know that there was any special friendship between the Sacred Phoenix Clan and Floating Sea.","After such a thing happened, the Island Master didn’t blame them at all, and asked Li Shihong forget it?","Could it be... the perpetrator wasn’t Huang Sanbai?","Thinking of this, Huang Tianhao laughed, “Patriarch Li, what else do you have to say? The Island Master is always fair, but he still doesn’t understand what he means? It’s really not Huang Sanbai who attacked your girl Li!”","“Impossible!” Li Shihong couldn’t believe it.","Seeing that the two were about to quarrel again, the Island Master coughed heavily in time.","“Enough, Patriarch Huang, your Sacred Phoenix Clan is not innocent in this matter, I advise you to shake hands and make peace, for the benefit of both clans. Maybe you don’t understand what I mean now, but in a few years, you will definitely thank me.”","“Huh, what do you mean?”","The two Patriarchs were at a loss.","The Island Master did not explain, but said indifferently: “This Island Master is getting old, seeing the talents of the gods withering, it is rare to have two god-level geniuses appear. I am one who appreciates talents.”"]},{"number":4169,"title":"Chapter 4169 You Are A Beast! (1)","paragraphs":["4169 You Are A Beast! (1)","“I didn’t want to take care of the affairs of your two clans, but I really don’t want to see the two god-level geniuses being left in a dilemma because of the behaviour of your two clans at this time. That’s why I came out to be a peacemaker.”","“Anyway, the two god-level geniuses are unscathed. Let’s just expose what happened today.”","The Island Master looked at the two Patriarchs, and expressed his opinion lightly.","The two Patriarchs were puzzled at first, but when they heard him finally say to let them expose it, they immediately became excited.","“Island Master, you...you are clearly protecting the Sacred Phoenix Clan! Let it be revealed! Even if Moying and the others are fine, can it be that Huang Sanbai’s assassination of Young Miss Li has never happened? Island Master, He entered Paradise Island formation privately, which is provoking your authority! Are you going to ignore it?!”","Li Shihong couldn’t believe his ears!","Not only was he dissatisfied, but Huang Tianhao was also very unwilling, “Island Master, you say that, it seems that our Sacred Phoenix Clan is afraid of those bastards! If you have the ability to slander the elders of our clan, you have to bear the consequences. Since they are looking for trouble, can’t we, the Sacred Phoenix Clan, be able to shrink our heads?”","“Alright, then don’t hide if you have the ability, today’s matter...”","“Enough!”","Seeing that the two Patriarchs couldn’t help but draw their knives at each other in front of him regardless of the occasion, the Island Master’s expression became more and more ugly and he could no longer bear it.","“This Island Master wanted to help you resolve this enmity, but since you are not convinced, then I can’t control too much. How about this, you give this Island Master some face, before the end of the God Realm’s Grand Meet, you can’t attack each other’s clansmen and keep everything as it is.”","“When the God Realm’s Grand Meet is over and you leave Floating Sea, what happens will have nothing to do with me.”","“This...”","The two Patriarchs were still very dissatisfied.","However, the Island Master had already talked about this point, and his words were reasonable.","Moreover, the strength of the Island Master was also a deterrent. It was unreasonable for them to start a war on other people’s territory...","In desperation, the two Patriarchs could only agree.","“Alright, I believe in the promise of the two Patriarchs. Go back first, three days later, the next match will begin. Please prepare well for the cultivators of the two clans.”","Li Shihong and Huang Tianhao turned around and went out. Along the way, they still glared at each other, as if they could fight at any time.","The guards of the Island Master’s Mansion were all on high alert.","Fortunately, the two Patriarchs still had integrity. Remembering their promise to the Island Master, they snubbed each other all the way to the gate of the Island Master’s mansion.","After they left, the Island Master waved to the Right Protector.","“Go and bring me the steward who dared to play tricks under the eyes of the Island Master. According to the rules of Floating Sea, no one has dared to make such a mistake for many years. It must not be tolerated!”","“Yes, My Lord! This subordinate obeys!”","The Right Protector bowed to answer, but a hesitant expression appeared on his face. He deliberated for a moment and did not leave immediately.","The Island Master looked at him, “What is it? What else do you have to say? Do you want to plead for that person?”","The Right Protector hurriedly said: “No no, this subordinate knows the rules. This person committed such a big mistake and deserved to die. How could he intercede for this kind of person? But, this subordinate doesn’t understand. Island Master, you all know that someone took Huang Sanbai into the big array, why do you want to let the Sacred Phoenix Clan go?”"]},{"number":4170,"title":"Chapter 4170 You Are A Beast! (2)","paragraphs":["4170 You Are A Beast! (2)","The Island Master glanced at him, but didn’t say anything else to clarify.","The Right Protector looked bewildered but he could only retreat.","...","At this time, near the teleportation array, the clansmen of the two clans were still gathered, glaring at each other with hatred.","However, even though they all had their weapons in their hands, after all, they refrained from doing anything because the Patriarch was still in the Island Master’s mansion.","Li Shihong and Huang Tianhao took two different paths, but the time to return to the teleportation array was about the same.","Seeing the appearance of the two Patriarchs, the clansmen immediately became excited.","“The Patriarch is back!”","“That’s great! Patriarch, please give the order quickly to slay these bastards!”","“Hey, I think you will be the ones who die, just wait!”","Listening to the yelling of the clansmen, the faces of the two Patriarchs were ashen.","“Alright, everyone will go back with me. Today... let’s let the Cloudy Qilin Clan go.” Huang Tianhao waved his hand, motioning the clan to leave with him.","“What? Patriarch, why should we be afraid of them?” The clansmen were puzzled.","However, Huang Tianhao’s attitude was extremely firm, “The Island Master has spoken out, we have to give him some face, let’s forget about it today.”","On the other side, Li Shihong also said the same thing.","However, the cultivators of the Cloudy Qilin Clan were still relentless, and they all clamoured to avenge the Young Master and Young Madame!","Li Shihong could only explain: “The Island Master has assured me that Moying and Young Miss Li are fine, and there is absolutely no danger to their lives. They are just trapped and will appear on their own in a matter of time. Since the Young Master is still alive, we are magnanimous and won’t bother with them for the time being, and wait until the God Realm’s Grand Meet is over.”","The clansmen were pleasantly surprised when they heard his words!","Just now they thought that Li Moying and Huang Yueli had been killed by the Sacred Phoenix Clan, so they insisted on finding them desperately.","Now that they think about it, their two god-level geniuses were still alive, there will be opportunities to deal with the members of the Sacred Phoenix Clan in the future.","Li Shihong said again: “According to the Island Master, he doesn’t know when they would teleport back. Starting from now, we will send people to wait by the teleportation array in turns every day. Once you see the Young Master and the others, report back immediately!”","This quarrel that almost turned into a large-scale battle had eventually subsided.","The situation at that time quickly spread to every corner of Floating Sea, and the major forces in the God Realm soon learned of the news.","For a while, everyone was discussing and talking about everything.","Most people think that the Sacred Phoenix Clan must have done something behind the scenes, but why the Island Master didn’t pursue this matter was beyond everyone’s understanding.","“However, even if the Island Master doesn’t pursue it, the Sacred Phoenix Clan won’t be able to please them this time! After all, Li Moying and the others are not dead!”","“Isn’t it? Now, the Sacred Phoenix Clan and the Cloudy Qilin Clan are tearing their faces apart. In the past, everyone looked at it for the sake of the God Realm’s Grand Meet, at least it was decent. In this way, it will be hard to say in the future...”","“The Sacred Phoenix Clan has even done such a thing, yet they still haven’t killed Li Moying! Are god-level geniuses really that powerful? I’m at the Dao Profound Realm, and I can’t last a quarter of an hour in the poisonous mist. Can he really stay there for so long?”"]},{"number":4171,"title":"Chapter 4171 You Are A Beast! (3)","paragraphs":["4171 You Are A Beast! (3)","Amidst the speculation and discussions of the major forces, three days passed quickly, and the next match of the God Realm’s Grand Meet began.","It seems that the number of people was not small, but the number of people who signed up for the preliminary competition has reached hundreds of thousands, so every cultivator who can advance to this round can be regarded as one in a hundred.","As for the match, the thousand people were divided into eight groups. In each group, the number of cultivators of various cultivation levels were kept as consistent as possible. At the same time, the cultivators of the major forces were scattered as much as possible. The top four from each group will advance to the finals.","Since the number of contestants in a group has reached 125, it would be too time-consuming to conduct a round robin competition.","Therefore, the match adopts the competition system of the group arena.","At the beginning of the match, everyone will be ranked according to their own cultivation, performance in the preliminary round, and previous records.","Everyone can challenge a cultivator whose ranking is higher than their own. If the challenge is successful, they can replace the challenged cultivator’s ranking, and the rankings of other cultivators will continue in sequence.","Each contestant can only challenge the same cultivator once.","The time for this round was also seven days. After the seven days are over, the top four in each group will enter the final.","And the final was an even more cruel knockout match.","The match has started, but Li Moying and Huang Yueli haven’t come back yet.","Li Shihong’s complexion was getting uglier day by day, and his mouth was bubbling with anxiety.","What is happening? The Island Master clearly said that the two of them are fine! Could it be that he deliberately lied to him to appease him?","Li Shihong almost rushed to the Island Master’s mansion to question the Island Master.","However, when they were divided into groups for the match, they did not exclude Li Moying and the others. They were still divided into two different groups.","The Sacred Phoenix Clan was not convinced, and even protested to the Right Protector, saying that since they could not participate in the competition, why were they still occupying two spots? The 1001 and 1002 substitutes should be brought in.","The Right Protector said disapprovingly: “This is Island Master’s intention. Besides, the match will last for seven days. How do you know that Young Master Li and the others will not be able to come back in time? What if they come back? Of course, what if they can’t come back within seven days, they will also lose the qualifications to enter the finals.”","The Right Protector’s statement gave Li Shihong confidence again, and he continued to send people to wait near the teleportation array.","The battle in the match was very fierce. Every cultivator tried his best to challenge the cultivators who ranked higher than themselves.","Although only the top four of each group can enter the finals, everyone still wants to get a better ranking as much as possible.","The top heaven-level geniuses in the group with Li Moying were extremely depressed at first."]},{"number":4172,"title":"Chapter 4172 You Are A Beast! (4)","paragraphs":["4172 You Are A Beast! (4)","However, as time passed and Li Moying never showed up, they were all happy again.","The cultivators of the Sacred Phoenix Clan were even more joyous.","Neither Li Moying nor his fabled wife appeared, and Jun Sihan didn’t take part in the competition. The strength of Huang Beicheng was definitely one of the top few, and the possibility of winning the championship was infinitely increasing.","In contrast, the cultivators of the Cloudy Qilin Clan were all frowning.","“Hey, what’s going on with the Young Master? Why hasn’t he come out of the big array yet?”","“Oh, the Young Master and the Young Madame are not here. The strongest in our clan is Young Miss Zijun. It is almost impossible for her to win the first place in the God Realm’s Grand Meet!”","“Let’s not talk about the finals. Three of the top four in our group are members of the Sacred Phoenix Clan. They even came to our residence to mock us that day. It made me so mad. Aren’t they just bullying us since our Young Master and Young Madame aren’t here?”","“Isn’t it? When the Young Master’s here, who dares to fart? Sigh! Young Master, show up quickly!”","I don’t know if their thoughts were too strong and moved the heavens.","While these cultivators were discussing, there was a sudden violent fluctuation of energy in the middle of the teleportation array.","The ground trembled continuously, and some of the green poisonous mist in the array also dispersed.","The cultivators panicked, fearing they would be poisoned, so they ran away quickly.","The poisonous mist dissipated, and a tall figure appeared in the centre of the teleportation array. It was Li Moying who had disappeared for ten days!","After staying in the poisonous mist in Paradise Island for so long, his icy handsome face still showed no change. He was not as haggard as everyone imagined. On the contrary, he exuded a strong profound force all over his body. The coercion, the eyes seem to be colder and deeper than before, and the strength seems to have improved again!","However, the clothes on his body were very messy, most of the buttons of his coat were missing, and his belt was tied loosely.","Moreover, there is still a large ball of cloth in his arms...","Oh, no, it’s not the just cloth, it’s...","“Young Madame?!”","“Young young young...Young Master, you are finally out!! We have been waiting for you for almost ten days!”","“Young Master, how are you? Also, what’s wrong with Young Madame? Did you get poisoned or injured?”","“Quick, quick, go and report to the Patriarch, the Young Master and Young Madame have appeared! The Young Madame’s seriously injured!”","Huang Yueli had been burying her face in Li Moying’s arms, but when she heard this, she became anxious and turned her head to stop him.","“Hey, wait, I’m not injured, so don’t go back and talk nonsense...”","However, that young cultivator ran so fast that he disappeared without a trace. I don’t know if he heard what she said.","Huang Yueli’s outstretched hand stayed in mid-air, and the expression on her face froze instantly.","Turning her head, she couldn’t help twisting Li Moying’s waist heavily, “Ah, it’s all your fault! You beast!!!”","The two of them ‘cultivated’ together in the big array, and the poisonous mist that filled the surroundings gradually transformed into the profound power in their bodies, which greatly improved their cultivation bases.","However, the purity of these poisonous mist is not high after all, so, soon, the profound power absorbed reached the upper limit.","Huang Yueli came out in a hurry, trying to push Li Moying away several times.","However, Li Moying hasn’t eaten meat for several months. This time, his little fox took the initiative to seduce him. How could he just eat a few bites?"]},{"number":4173,"title":"Chapter 4173 You Are A Beast! (5)","paragraphs":["4173 You Are A Beast! (5)","So, he ate mouthful after mouthful, mouthful after mouthful...","The little fox was so angry that she almost exploded on the spot, and sent him flying with a slap!","After experiencing his wife’s violence, Young Master Li didn’t show any signs of anger, and soon ran back in a hurry, circling around Huang Yueli.","Huang Yueli firmly stated that she must go out.","In desperation, Li Moying reluctantly agreed.","However, when the two of them got dressed and were about to be sent, Huang Yueli realized that her legs were actually very weak and she almost couldn’t stand up.","This discovery made the little fox, who had finally calmed down, run away on the spot, and almost beat up her husband again.","Fortunately, Li Moying reacted quickly.","As soon as he saw Huang Yueli’s face puff up, he expected that she was about to lose her temper, so he quickly hugged her up, and then activated the teleportation array without hesitation.","A feeling of dizziness came, the ground began to shake, and the surrounding light kept changing.","Huang Yueli knew that they were about to teleport out, so she could only hold back her breath forcefully, and obediently hid in her husband’s arms pretending to be a little white rabbit.","But they just saw the sunshine outside, they met such a guy, they thought she was seriously injured!","He hurried back to the camp to report to Li Shihong!","She was rendered speechless.","And she was so ashamed, all thanks to this unrestrained man beside her!","The more Huang Yueli thought about it, the angrier she became, and she couldn’t help pinching him again.","Li Moying twisted his face in pain in exaggeration.","Immediately, it caused another round of panic and tension among the cultivators around.","“Isn’t it? Is the Young Master also injured?”","“Young Master, how are you doing? Come on, sit down!”","“Yes, someone has already reported to the Patriarch. I believe he will come to pick you up in person soon!”","Li Moying looked at the increasingly angry face of his little fox, and knew that if he didn’t comfort his wife, he would have a miserable life in the near future.","As he spoke, he held down Huang Yueli, who was constantly struggling to jump out of his arms, and hugged her to perform profound movements.","After a while, the two returned to the camp.","Li Shihong had just received the news that he was taking a few people with him, preparing to go to the teleportation array to pick them up.","As a result, just as soon as she went out, she suddenly saw Li Moying rushing in with Huang Yueli in her arms.","When Li Shihong saw the two of them, his face was full of surprise, and he almost couldn’t even speak.","After staring at Li Moying for a long time, he choked out a sentence: “Alright, alright! That’s great! You’re finally back, so I’m relieved!”","His eyes fell on Huang Yueli, and he asked eagerly: “By the way, what’s wrong with Young Miss Li? Hurry up and find Divine Doctor Liu to take a look?”","Li Moying felt that her daughter-in-law’s little hand was already on his waist, and she was ready to pinch him at any time if there was any disagreement.","He shook his head and said, “No, really, there’s nothing wrong with Little Li’er, but she’s too tired these days and needs to rest. I’ll take her back to the room first. If there’s anything else, we can talk about it tomorrow.”","With that said, he turned around and left.","Li Shihong suddenly thought of something, and hurriedly said: “Wait, Moying!”"]},{"number":4174,"title":"Chapter 4174 You Are A Beast! (6)","paragraphs":["4174 You Are A Beast! (6)","However, Li Moying’s footsteps were fast, and he left his sight in a few dodges.","Li Shihong couldn’t stop him even if he wanted to, so he could only sigh secretly.","Li Yuntao, who was beside him, came over and asked, “Patriarch, what should we do now? Today is the last day of the match of the God Realm’s Grand Meet. If the Young Master and Young Miss Li don’t participate in the competition, I’m afraid they will be eliminated! That’s such a pity!”","Li Shihong shook his head and said: “Forget it, the God Realm’s Grand Meet is just a competition, it’s nothing important, as long as Moying and the others come back. I’m just worried about Young Miss Li’s situation. Are you seriously injured?”","He paused, and said again: “Go and invite Divine Doctor Liu to take a look.”","...","Li Moying hugged Huang Yueli and returned to the room.","Immediately, he carefully put her on the bed.","“Little Li’er, I’ll get you a glass of water, are you hungry? I’ll send someone to get you something to eat...”","Before he could finish speaking, he suddenly felt a powerful energy rush towards his chest.","Li Moying was taken aback, his first reaction was to block her.","However, fortunately, he came back to his senses quickly, until it was his wife who was venting, and quickly withdrew his profound strength.","He didn’t even dare to defend himself, so he took the move directly.","Huang Yueli’s attack wasn’t too heavy, but when Li Moying caught it head-on, he was still sent flying on the spot, and flew out directly from the door. He finally managed to find her balance in mid-air, and managed to land firmly on the ground.","Before he could say anything, he heard a “bang” not far away.","Huang Yueli slammed the door firmly.","“You can find another place to live! We’ll live separately!”","Hearing this, Li Moying’s complexion changed suddenly, and he became nervous immediately. He went to the door and begged his wife for mercy, “Ahem, Little Li’er, don’t do this, let me in! I can guarantee that I won’t be unruly to you in the near future. I’ll be good! Really!”","From the door, came Huang Yueli’s sneer: “Hmph, how long is this ‘near future’? What’s your definition?”","“This...” Li Moying hesitated, “At least tonight...”","“Alright, you can get out!!”","Smoke almost rose from her head!","What nonsense! Tonight, this could also be called the near future! Not sincere at all!","Li Moying hurriedly said: “Then tomorrow night... no, no, no, it’s been a good week, alright, Little Li’er, don’t lose your temper, let me go in, I’m worried that you won’t feel well ...”","“As long as you’re not by my side, I’m fine! You go, I’m going to rest!”","Huang Yueli ruthlessly wanted to drive her husband away.","When Liu Buyan arrived, what he saw was the dignified Young Master Li leaning on the bedroom door pitifully, begging his wife for forgiveness.","Seeing this scene, he couldn’t help laughing out loud, and almost fell down on the ground and beat the ground.","“Hahahahaha, it’s so funny, I really want to die of laughter! Li Moying, you...you have today!”","Li Moying’s face was livid, she turned her head and glanced at Liu Buyan, and said angrily, “What are you doing here? You are not welcome here, you can get out!”","The coldness emanating from his body could almost give people frostbite.","However, Liu Buyan was not intimidated by him at all. He went straight to the door of the bedroom and called out, “Junior Sister, how are you doing?”"]},{"number":4175,"title":"Chapter 4175 Arrived In Time (1)","paragraphs":["4175 Arrived In Time (1)","“When the two of you went missing, you almost scared me to death! Can I come in to check how you are doing?”","Li Moying sneered from the side, “Hmph! My wife doesn’t even pay attention to me, she will let you in?”","However, as soon as he finished speaking, the bedroom door opened.","Huang Yueli stretched out her hand and dragged Liu Buyan in. Immediately after, the door was slammed shut again.","Li Moying never expected that Huang Yueli would actually open the door for Liu Buyan, and his complexion turned extremely ugly.","What made him even more depressed was that just as he was about to take the opportunity to sneak into the room, Huang Yueli slammed the door shut.","And it was so timely that it almost broke the hand he just stretched out.","“Damn Liu Buyan, get out! Little Li’er, let me in quickly, I made a mistake, and I will never dare again...”","Li Moying knocked on the door outside, and the corner of Huang Yueli’s mouth twitched, trying to let herself ignore the noise he made outside.","Liu Buyan walked towards her and said, “Junior Sister, how are you? Just now, Patriarch Li specially sent someone to my place, asking me to come over and treat you, saying that you were seriously injured? But, I think you look good. Hmm, it seems that your cultivation base has improved a lot, and it is really hard to see where you’re injured.”","Huang Yueli nodded, “I’m really not injured, this is all a misunderstanding, misunderstanding! Sorry for troubling my Senior Brother to make a trip for nothing.”","Liu Buyan raised his eyebrows, “However, since you weren’t injured, why did you let my cheap Sworn Brother carry you back? Are you guys... just flaunting your affection once you leave a dangerous situation? Or what is it? Let me take a look again, is there really nothing wrong with the poisonous mist?”","As he spoke, he reached out to give Huang Yueli a pulse.","Huang Yueli coughed hard twice, “Ahem, this really wasn’t intentional, it’s just...a little accident happened.”","Looking at Huang Yueli’s slightly flushed face, Liu Buyan suddenly understood.","“It seems that you two are...damn, I really shouldn’t ask this kind of question!”","Just now seeing Li Moying being locked out by his Junior Sister, he was happy for a while, thinking that he finally didn’t have to be smothered by their affection and he could still see Li Moying’s struggle.","In the end, before he was happy for a long time, he was stuffed with their display of affection again.","Looking at Huang Yueli’s reaction, and the fact that the two of them had greatly improved their cultivation bases, as a doctor, he quickly judged that this was the result of their dual cultivation.","After working on it for a long time, just outside the array, everyone was worried to death for the two of them. Even the two Ancient God Clans almost broke out in a big battle because of them.","And in the end...","The two of them actually were busy in dual cultivation in the big array?!","And his Junior Sister was still so weak that she had to be carried out by Li Moying!","Liu Buyan’s expression changed several times, and his inner feelings were indescribable.","Huang Yueli also felt a little embarrassed, coughed a few times quickly, and changed the subject: “By the way, Senior Brother, when Moying and I were in the array, what happened outside? Were Patriarch Li and the others in a hurry?”","Liu Buyan glanced at her, and couldn’t help snorting, “Hmph! You still know that everyone was frantic outside! I’m fine, I know you two evildoers are very capable, it’s impossible for you two to die so casually. However, Patriarch Li is different, he regards you two as the treasures of the clan. With both treasures missing, he’s been very anxious.”"]},{"number":4176,"title":"Chapter 4176 Arrived In Time (2)","paragraphs":["4176 Arrived In Time (2)","“Senior Brother, you’re exaggerating...” Huang Yueli sweated.","Liu Buyan took a deep breath and described in detail what happened near the teleportation array.","At that time, Liu Buyan was actually among the crowd, and he was one of the thousand people who passed the match.","Of course, with Liu Buyan’s strength, it was actually quite difficult to stand out among so many Ancient God Clan geniuses.","However, he is now considered a guest of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, and the members of the Cloudy Qilin Clan take good care of him. He was lucky enough to pass the trial alongside the young cultivators.","When the two clans were about to fight, he wanted to stand up and try to persuade him, but it was a pity that at that time, only Dao Profound Realm masters like Li Shihong made the shots, so he didn’t dare to get close at all.","After hearing what he said, Huang Yueli couldn’t help frowning.","“I didn’t expect so many things to happen when we were not here! Fortunately, the Island Master intervened, otherwise, if there is another blood feud between the two clans this time, after I return to the Sacred Phoenix Clan, it’ll be hard for Moying and I to be together...”","Having said that, she paused for a moment, feeling a little puzzled.","“I don’t know why the Island Master stood up to prevent the two clans from fighting? Was it just to maintain the tranquility of the Floating Sea, or...know something?”","Huang Yueli thought about it secretly for a while, but couldn’t figure it out, so she could only let go of this question first.","“By the way, Senior Brother, how is Huang Sanbai doing now? Have you found him?”","Liu Buyan shook his head, “No, after you disappeared, Patriarch Li tried many ways to capture Huang Sanbai, but he couldn’t find anyone. The Island Master does not allow us to fight in the Floating Sea, and he is unwilling to help us look for anyone, so...”","Hearing this, Huang Yueli couldn’t help but frown, “This is going to be troublesome, I can’t find him for so long, most likely he is hiding in the Sacred Phoenix Clan’s residence. He has always been glib and eloquent, and I don’t know how to explain what happened that day to Huang Tianhao and the others. Besides, they should have already figured out a way to guard against me.”","When she was hunted down by Huang Sanbai that day, she still thought that once she escaped danger, she would go to the Sacred Phoenix Clan to expose Huang Sanbai’s identity.","Who knew that this time they were actually trapped in the array for such a long time.","With this little time, it was enough for Huang Sanbai to cover up the bad things he did. If she ran to the Sacred Phoenix Clan impulsively, it would become a self-inflicted trap instead.","“It seems that I can only follow the original plan and wait until the finals to reveal my identity...”","Liu Buyan frowned, and said, “If you want to act according to the original plan, at least you have to enter the finals first, right? Why did it take so long to come out? I thought you had already given up on God Realm’s Grand Meet! ”","Huang Yueli was stunned for a moment, “Ah? What do you mean? Isn’t the next round going to start soon?”","Liu Buyan’s eyes widened, “I’ll be damned, Junior Sister, are you confused by the poisonous mist? What hasn’t started yet? Today is already the last day!”","“How is it impossible? It has been ten days since you disappeared! You don’t feel anything at all, do you?” Liu Buyan was also speechless."]},{"number":4177,"title":"Chapter 4177 Arrived In Time (3)","paragraphs":["4177 Arrived In Time (3)","Huang Yueli had a confused expression on her face.","It never occurred to her that ten days had passed!","Didn’t Liu Buyan deliberately make this up to scare her?","Liu Buyan saw her doubts, and said helplessly: “You think I’m so bored that I’ll lie to you with such a thing? I still thought that you and Li Moying are so relaxed that you can still flirt here. And there I was still thinking that you two are no longer interested in participating in the next round anymore. After everything, it turned out that you two didn’t know anything?”","“I really didn’t know!” Huang Yueli was extremely embarrassed.","Liu Buyan looked at the pale complexion on her little face, and clicked his tongue: “I think you are too foolish! Thinking that no one can see you in the big array, so you don’t have any scruples, and you can double cultivate as much as you want. Your Senior Brother here, as a doctor, would like to advise you, although you have good physical strength when you are young, you should not be too indulgent, otherwise, you will know when you are old...”","“Ahem, cough, Senior Brother, you know too much!!” Huang Yueli coughed repeatedly, interrupting his lecture.","She looked up at the sky, and the sun was already westward.","Obviously, if the delay continues, it will be dark.","Huang Yueli hurriedly opened the door, wanting to go out to find Li Moying.","Unexpectedly, as soon as the door opened, Li Moying, who had been sticking to the door, got in through the gap immediately.","As soon as he entered the door, he grabbed Huang Yueli’s hand and said nervously: “Little Li’er, you are finally willing to let me in! Let me tell you, Liu Buyan has no good intentions, he definitely came here on purpose. Don’t listen to anyone who speaks ill of me!”","As he spoke, he turned to Liu Buyan. His voice, which was as warm as a spring breeze just now, suddenly became colder than winter.","“What are you still doing here? Didn’t you see that our husband and wife are going to talk? Are you still planning to eavesdrop here?”","Liu Buyan looked at him confidently, “Eavesdropping? I listened openly! But you, lying on the door just now, were you eavesdropping, right?”","“A man is locked in the room with my wife. What’s wrong if I listen? If you have no ghosts in your heart, you will be afraid of me listening?” Li Moying’s eyes turned cold, and he released his profound strength, “You still not leaving? Do you have to Let me throw you out myself?”","Seeing that the two men were quarrelling as usual when they met, Huang Yueli quickly stopped them.","“I say, you two, that’s enough! No one is allowed to speak! Especially Moying!” She put on a serious face.","“Little Li’er...”","Li Moying had an unbelievable expression on his face, as if he couldn’t accept that he was scolded by his wife!","Huang Yueli turned her head away, refusing to look at that handsome face that made her heart soften, “Alright, stop rambling, where is the venue for the match? Senior Brother, hurry up and take us there! If any later, it’s really too late!”","Li Moying, who was still competing with Liu Buyan for her wife’s attention, finally noticed this key word.","“Alright, let’s rush there first, and I’ll tell you on the way!”","...","The news of Li Moying and Huang Yueli’s reappearance soon spread to the Sacred Phoenix Clan.","Although the Island Master said in advance that they were still alive, which was expected, it was still an extremely heavy blow to the members of the Sacred Phoenix Clan."]},{"number":4178,"title":"Chapter 4178 I’ve Had It! I’ve Been An Elder For Long Enough!(1)","paragraphs":["4178 I’ve Had It! I’ve Been An Elder For Long Enough!(1)","When Huang Tianhao heard the news, he immediately found Huang Sanbai.","Huang Sanbai had already hid in the Sacred Phoenix Clan’s residence, and did not dare to go out for ten days and ten nights, for fear that he would be besieged by Cloudy Qilin Clan cultivators as soon as he went out.","Over the past few days, he had been so anxious that he couldn’t even sleep, and a lot of hair started falling out.","The face that was already quite old now looks more like it has aged several decades, like a mortal who was dying.","Hearing the news brought by Huang Tianhao, he was shocked.","Even after hearing the Island Master’s prophecy, he still had a fluke mentality, hoping that Huang Yueli and Li Moying would be trapped in the array forever and could not get out.","As time passed day by day, Huang Yueli and Li Moying disappeared for ten days, and a glimmer of hope rose in his heart.","But now, what Huang Tianhao said completely shattered his last illusion.","Huang Yueli and her Cloudy Qilin Clan’s husband came out of the array!","Even if it’s the kind of poison that makes people unconscious in an instant, it still can’t kill that damn girl!","Huang Sanbai suddenly felt hopeless and powerless.","He had heard a long time ago that the so-called god-level geniuses were all born by being favoured by the heavens. Each of them was blessed with great luck, and no matter what dangers they encountered, they could turn dangers into blessings.","Originally, he didn’t believe in such nonsense. He felt that anyone’s fate was in his own hands. As long as he had a deep enough scheming and a clever enough technique, he would definitely be able to get what he wanted.","But now...","He saw that Huang Yueli was able to escape smoothly in almost desperate situations time and time again.","Not only did she not fall halfway, but her strength became stronger and stronger, and she grew up rapidly.","Huang Sanbai couldn’t help being a little shaken.","If he was given another chance, he knew that he would definitely not make the same choice again, and would never go after Sky Phoenix Ring’s idea. With a little bit of luck in mind, he sneaked up on Huang Yueli in the Soul Connection Ocean.","But, it’s too late to regret anything now.","There was no medicine for regret in the world.","He made a wrong first step, and then he could only continue to make mistakes step by step, sinking deeper and deeper, and there was no chance of turning back.","Now he has only one way to go – that was to delve deeper into the dark, he was desperate to seize the last chance!","Yes, he still has a chance!","Huang Sanbai suddenly thought of something, his eyes lit up.","He suddenly raised his head and looked at Huang Tianhao, “Then... Patriarch, how do you plan to deal with this matter?”","Huang Tianhao didn’t notice Huang Sanbai’s strange expression at all, and thought that his face was gloomy, but just like himself, he was worried about the future of the clan.","He sighed deeply, “Oh, this matter... this matter is indeed very difficult. Elder Sanbai, you took such a big risk and made such a feat for the future of the clan, but...they turned out to be alright! It can only be said that our luck is bad. Could it be that the heavens are going to kill my Sacred Phoenix Clan?”","Huang Sanbai shook his head and lowered his voice, “Patriarch, you don’t have to worry too much, I just thought of another way, this time, I will definitely let those two god-level geniuses jump into the trap on their own and it will spell their end!”","Huang Tianhao had already given up hope, but when he heard this, he immediately became excited, and asked: “Elder Sanbai, what can you do? You are really the number one strategist of our clan, other than you, I don’t know who to trust!”","Huang Sanbai chuckled and waved at him."]},{"number":4179,"title":"Chapter 4179 I’ve Had It! I’ve Been An Elder For Long Enough!(2)","paragraphs":["4179 I’ve Had It! I’ve Been An Elder For Long Enough!(2)","“Patriarch, this old man will show you something.” Huang Sanbai lowered his voice and said mysteriously.","Huang Tianhao didn’t doubt anything and followed Huang Sanbai to the corner of his room.","Huang Sanbai took out a jade pendant-shaped Spirit Armament from the cabinet in the corner, and handed it to Huang Tianhao.","“Patriarch, please take a look at this.”","Huang Tianhao took the jade pendant and asked suspiciously: “What is this?”","Huang Sanbai didn’t answer.","Huang Tianhao felt a little strange, so he simply held the jade pendant closer and looked at it carefully.","However, at this moment, he suddenly felt that the smell emanating from the jade pendant was a bit weird, like the stench floating on a rotting corpse.","Before he had time to speak, he suddenly felt dizzy in his head and his eyes darkened.","Huang Tianhao suddenly felt something was wrong.","After all, he was a strong man at the peak of the Dao Profound Realm, so he reacted extremely quickly. He subconsciously threw the jade pendant out, and at the same time circulated the profound energy in his body, trying to suppress this dizzy feeling.","However, no matter how fast he reacted, it would not be as fast as Huang Sanbai, who was already prepared and waiting for him to fall into his trap!","A bit of confusion appeared in Huang Tianhao’s eyes, and Huang Sanbai made a decisive move, using all the profound energy in his body, and slashed at the back of Huang Tianhao’s neck.","Huang Tianhao didn’t expect to be attacked by Huang Sanbai at all. Even if there was something wrong with the jade pendant just now, his first reaction was not to doubt Huang Sanbai.","This gave Huang Sanbai a perfect opportunity to deal a sneak attack.","Huang Tianhao’s body fell towards the ground, Huang Sanbai immediately sealed his veins, preventing him from using the profound energy in his body, at the same time, took out a special rope-like Spirit Armament, and tied him tightly .","Then, he dragged him to a corner.","Huang Tianhao, as a Dao Profound Realm expert, was actually very strong physically. Although he was accidentally hit just now and fell into a coma, he woke up not long after.","When he found out that he was actually sealed by someone, and was tightly bound and thrown on the ground, his eyes flared wide open in shock!","“What’s going on? What’s going on?! Elder Sanbai, you... what are you going to do?!”","Seeing Huang Sanbai standing in front of him, looking down at him from above, Huang Tianhao suddenly had an ominous premonition in his heart.","“Elder... Elder Sanbai?”","Huang Sanbai looked at him, and said with a nonchalant smile: “Don’t call me an elder, I’ve had it! I’ve long been sick of being just an Elder! I’ve never understood why you, Huang Tianhao, can be the Patriarch? Just because you are the son of the previous Patriarch, and your cultivation talent is higher than mine? But, what contribution have you made to the Sacred Phoenix Clan, a piece of mud that can’t stand up against the wall?”","“Over the years, it is clear that I am the one who has paid the most for the Sacred Phoenix Clan. It is clear that my grandson sacrificed for the family. It is clear that all important decisions are made by me. However, I can only be an elder. Subservient to you, the Patriarch!”","“I’ve had enough!”","Huang Tianhao’s eyes widened, his face was full of shock, and he stared fixedly at Huang Sanbai’s old face.","He couldn’t believe what he heard just now, he thought he was dreaming!","“No...no...how come? Elder Sanbai, you are...this must be some kind of misunderstanding? Let me go, let’s talk slowly...”","Huang Sanbai couldn’t help laughing, “Patriarch, you are so naive! How about this, let me tell you a secret...”"]},{"number":4180,"title":"Chapter 4180 I’ve Had It! I’ve Been An Elder For Long Enough!(3)","paragraphs":["4180 I’ve Had It! I’ve Been An Elder For Long Enough!(3)","“What... what secret?”","Seeing the strange smile on Huang Sanbai’s old face, Huang Tianhao felt uneasy.","He had a feeling that the news he hears next will be particularly shocking and overturn all his cognitions!","Huang Sanbai stared at his frightened expression for a while, seeming to enjoy it very much.","After a while, he said slowly, “I’m afraid you don’t know, right? The god-level genius of our Sacred Phoenix Clan... was actually not killed by Li Moying at all, she is still alive!”","Huang Tianhao never dreamed that Huang Sanbai’s first words would be such shocking news.","He trembled all over, and his eyes widened, “You...what are you talking about? Huang Yueli is not dead yet? How is it possible? This is impossible! If she is still alive, why did we send so many people from the clan to search for her and we haven’t found her for so long? As long as she has a breath of life left, she should return to the Sacred Phoenix Clan immediately, right?”","Huang Sanbai shook his head, and looked at Huang Tianhao with a half-smile.","“Patriarch, you are so naive! Huang Yueli can’t show up, so there is a reason for that, she doesn’t dare show up!”","“Doesn’t dare to show up? What do you mean?” Huang Tianhao was still full of doubts.","Huang Sanbai said slowly: “Because the person who sneaked up on her and wanted to kill her was not the Young Master of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, but me!”","“You...you...” Huang Tianhao stared at him, shaking his head vehemently, “Elder Sanbai, what are you talking about? How is this possible? I must be dreaming, yes, I am dreaming...”","“Patriarch, I’ve reached this point, yet you still think it’s a dream?” Huang Sanbai snorted coldly.","“In that case, I’ll shed some light and tell you the truth.”","“At that time, you sent me to Soul Connection Ocean to fetch Huang Yueli back to the clan. I did receive her, but she was unconscious in the void at the time. When I rescued her, I found that there was something from our Sacred Phoenix Clan on her body. The long-lost ancient artifact – the Sky Phoenix Ring!”","“What? Sky Phoenix Ring? Isn’t that the clan’s artifact? However, the Sky Phoenix Ring has been missing for hundreds of thousands of years. Moreover, it is said that the Sky Phoenix Ring couldn’t bear the war between our clan and Cloudy Qilin Clan. The huge impact shattered into several pieces, even if it could be found, it’s just fragments!” Huang Tianhao shook his head repeatedly.","Huang Sanbai sneered and said, “Do you think I’m a fool? Of course I know this history, but the Sky Phoenix Ring on Huang Yueli’s body is intact. It was a complete Sky Phoenix Ring!”","“Complete... a complete Sky Phoenix Ring?! How is it possible?”","“Nothing is impossible, this is the fact. Moreover, she managed to make the Sky Phoenix Ring recognize her as the master and integrate it into the primordial spirit.”","Huang Sanbai paused, his face became even more gloomy, and his voice was terribly weird.","“So, I became greedy at that time, and secretly attacked Huang Yueli, wanting to get the Sky Phoenix Ring from her! But who knew, she was so lucky. There were at least two big gaps in cultivation between us at that time yet she could still escape from my hands!”","“In order to find her, I blocked dozens of surrounding towns and checked all the Ascendants from the lower realms, but I couldn’t find her.”","After hearing this, Huang Tianhao finally understood, “You...So, Huang Yueli didn’t dare to show up because you were obstructing it!”"]},{"number":4181,"title":"Chapter 4181 I’ve Had It! I’ve Been An Elder For Long Enough!(4)","paragraphs":["4181 I’ve Had It! I’ve Been An Elder For Long Enough!(4)","Huang Tianhao fixedly stared at Huang Sanbai, trembling with anger, the veins on his forehead popped out.","If possible, he really wanted to rush up and tear Huang Sanbai into pieces immediately.","However, now he has fallen into Huang Sanbai’s trap and was attacked by him. Not only was he seriously injured, but his pulse was also sealed, and his whole body was tied up in a ball.","In this state, no matter how powerful he was, he can’t show it at all. He can only use resentful eyes to try to convey the hatred in his heart.","“Huang, San, Bai! You wolf-hearted thing! How dare you do such a thing! For so many years, as the elder of the Sacred Phoenix Clan, how much cultivation resources the Clan has provided you, and how much effort the Clan has given you. From the top to the bottom of the Clan, who doesn’t respect you very much, you...not only are not only ungrateful at all, but also murdered a god-level genius! You are simply...unworthy of being a human being!”","Huang Sanbai didn’t panic at all when he heard his hoarse and angry reprimand, but just smiled coldly.","“Huang Tianhao, don’t speak so grandly. It’s true that I have obtained a lot of resources from the Clan, but I got them in exchange for the merits of myself and the members of my clan! I deserve it all!”","“On the contrary, you, although occupying the position of the Patriarch of the Clan, what have you done for the Clan? If you were not timid, weak and incompetent, why has the Clan withered talent for hundreds of years, and there has been no outstanding genius born?”","“Not to mention, in the past, our Sacred Phoenix Clan clearly occupied many high positions in the Allied Armies Headquarters, with outstanding military exploits and great reputation! But how have these years been? Our Clan’s power is getting weaker and weaker, while the strength of the Cloudy Qilin Clan is getting stronger and stronger. Now they have firmly stepped on our Sacred Phoenix Clan! This is all caused by your Patriarch’s incompetence!”","The more Huang Sanbai spoke, the more excited he became, pointing at Huang Tianhao’s nose and cursing him.","Huang Tianhao’s face turned blue and white.","He was extremely depressed and angry, but for a while, he didn’t know how to refute Huang Sanbai.","Because most of what Huang Sanbai said was true.","The once glorious Sacred Phoenix Clan began to decline day by day after it was handed over to him.","He also thought of many ways to revitalise the Sacred Phoenix Clan, but due to his own limited ability, he failed in the end.","In the past few hundred years, thanks to Huang Sanbai’s assistance, he has saved the Clan from embarrassment several times.","It is also because of this that Huang Sanbai enjoys a transcendent status in the Sacred Phoenix Clan, second only to the Patriarch in the eyes of the group, and is highly respected. No one will suspect him of betraying the Clan!","If Huang Sanbai hadn’t confessed his crime with his own mouth, knocked him to the ground and tied him up, Huang Tianhao wouldn’t have believed that Elder Sanbai would have committed the crime of murdering a god-level genius!","Huang Sanbai smiled coldly, “Since you are so incompetent, why didn’t you give up the position of Patriarch earlier, and why did you still hold on to it? Do you know that the clan has long been dissatisfied with you, thinking that you are shameless? The position of Patriarch should be filled by me, Huang Sanbai!”","“Bah! Stop talking nonsense here. Even if I am incompetent, I will at least act according to my conscience. You are a despicable villain, and you are not worthy of being the Patriarch!”","Huang Tianhao’s face turned ashen."]},{"number":4182,"title":"Chapter 4182 I’ve Had It! I’ve Been An Elder For Long Enough!(5)","paragraphs":["4182 I’ve Had It! I’ve Been An Elder For Long Enough!(5)","He glared at Huang Sanbai viciously, his eyes seemed to burst into flames.","If eyes could kill, Huang Sanbai would have died countless times by now!","Huang Sanbai didn’t back down at all because of this, ever since he jumped the wall in a hurry and decided to attack Huang Tianhao, he had prepared for the worst.","As the saying goes, if you don’t do it, you will never stop. Now that you have done it, he will not have any scruples, and he must achieve his goal!","Moreover, there was no room for him to repent now.","Huang Sanbai knelt down and sneered coldly: “It doesn’t matter whether I am worthy or not. The important thing is that I will definitely become the next Patriarch!”","Huang Tianhao saw the killing intent in his eyes, and immediately became horrified, and the clothes behind him were instantly soaked in cold sweat.","“You... what do you want to do?! Huang Sanbai, let me tell you, even if you kill me, you will not be able to become the new Patriarch! You are already so old, even if the clansmen want to elect a new Patriarch, it is impossible for you to become the new Patriarch! They will choose Huang Beicheng, not you! These years, he has already been recognized as the Young Master of the Sacred Phoenix Clan.”","“Hehe, what’s the matter?” Huang Sanbai sneered.","Huang Tianhao looked at him in horror, “Could it be that you...you still want to lay a bad hand on Beicheng? You personally watched Beicheng grow up. When he was young, you taught him how to practice. You... ...How can you do such a thing, you are simply inhuman!”","Huang Sanbai glanced at him coldly, “Huang Tianhao, don’t worry about other people, I naturally won’t treat Beicheng like this. After all, there are not many heavenly geniuses in the Clan. There are even fewer talents, if he is killed, there will not even be a genius in the clan that can be cultivated in the future, which is embarrassing...but I am the future Patriarch!”","“You...”","Hearing that Huang Sanbai had already begun to call himself the future Patriarch, Huang Tianhao was furious, and finally couldn’t help it, and spat out a mouthful of blood.","His eyes darkened, and he almost fainted on the spot.","Huang Sanbai stood up straight again, condescendingly looking down at Huang Tianhao who was in a panic on the ground.","“Since you’re going to die, I’ll let you be a fool! In fact, not only is Huang Yueli still alive, but you’ve also seen her before, and even... ordered me to kill her!”","“What... what? What did you say?! I’ve seen her before? How is it possible? If I had seen her, I would have brought her back to the Sacred Phoenix Clan long ago!”","“Hehe, there are only two god-level geniuses in the world. You’ve seen them before, so what’s so strange?”","“God-level genius... two...”","The bewildered Huang Tianhao opened his mouth blankly, and suddenly a flash of inspiration flashed across his face, and his face suddenly changed.","“You... You said that Young Miss Li of the Cloudy Qilin Clan!!! Could it be that she is Huang Yueli?! Yes, the bastards of the Cloudy Qilin Clan have been saying that their Young Master’s fiancée is also a god-level genius, and I have been wondering , Why are there so many god-level geniuses now! It turns out...the truth is like this!”","At this moment after knowing the truth, in retrospect, every time Huang Sanbai makes a move, he targets the so-called Young Miss Li.","Although the excuse he made at the time was that Li Moying was a god-level genius who was more difficult to deal with, but his wife was not as strong as him, so it was easier to deal with, which sounded reasonable.","But thinking about it now, Huang Tianhao felt that he was a complete fool!"]},{"number":4183,"title":"Chapter 4183 I’ve Had It! I’ve Been An Elder For Long Enough!(6)","paragraphs":["4183 I’ve Had It! I’ve Been An Elder For Long Enough!(6)","Being played around by Huang Sanbai!","Huang Sanbai chuckled, “Then I’m afraid you’re really going to die. Because, I’m planning to find another chance to kill her now! And, this time, she definitely won’t be able to escape.”","“You... what do you want to do?! A god-level genius is the hope of the entire Clan. If you kill her, you will become the eternal sinner of the entire Clan! Even if you can become the Patriarch, you will definitely not end well!”","Huang Tianhao’s eyes widened, his heart was filled with panic and annoyance.","He really hated himself for not knowing people clearly, and being deceived by Huang Sanbai for so long!","If he had known the truth earlier, he would have found Huang Yueli back long ago, and he would not have fallen into the desperate situation he is now!","Huang Sanbai smiled and said: “Look at what you said, what kind of talk is this? How could the sinner of the ages be me? Even if you want to say the sinner, it must be her, Huang Yueli! She flirts with that lad from the Cloudy Qilin Clan and even married him. Our Sacred Phoenix Clan and Cloudy Qilin Clan have not intermarried for hundreds of thousands of years, and she is violating the Clan rules by doing so!”","When Huang Tianhao heard this, he felt as if a thunderbolt struck his forehead, making him dizzy for a while.","Just now, he was only attracted by the news that Huang Yueli was still alive, and he didn’t think deeply about what Huang San said.","Looking back now, Huang Yueli is Young Miss Li, Li Moying’s so-called fiancée!","Doesn’t that prove that she has betrayed the Clan and become a member of the Cloudy Qilin Clan?","“Why... how could such a thing happen? This is definitely a shameless guy like you who made it up to lie to me. I don’t even believe a single word you said now! Huang Yueli is the god level of our Sacred Phoenix Clan Genius, how could you fall in love with the cultivators of the Cloudy Qilin Clan?”","“Even if she was really confused by the appearance of that brat from the Cloudy Qilin Clan, and Li Shihong from the Cloudy Qilin Clan is not an idiot, how could she still agree with Li Moying to be with a woman from the Sacred Phoenix Clan? Even if Huang Yueli is a god-level Genius, impossible!”","Huang Sanbai nodded leisurely, “You’re right, but I really didn’t lie to you this time, and there’s no need to lie to you. The people of the Cloudy Qilin Clan don’t seem to know Huang Yueli’s identity until now I guess, this may be the effect of Sky Phoenix Ring in her primordial spirit, which allows her to easily hide her cultivation and race.”","“I once tried to send someone to Li Shihong to expose her identity, but even so, she came around later, and has always been loved by the entire Cloudy Qilin Clan.”","Huang Tianhao opened his mouth wide in disbelief, “This... this... is unbelievable...”","“This girl is indeed quite capable and lucky.” Huang Sanbai smiled coldly, the curvature of the corner of his mouth looked extremely creepy.","“However, no matter how capable she is, she can’t cover up the fact that she betrayed her Clan and embraced the man of the Cloudy Qilin Clan! Don’t worry, I will never let such a Clan traitor live in this world, and I will definitely do my best , kill her, so as to maintain the dignity of our entire Clan!”","Huang Sanbai’s righteous and awe-inspiring look seemed to be really thinking about the Sacred Phoenix Clan."]},{"number":4184,"title":"Chapter 4184 I’ve Had It! I’ve Been An Elder For Long Enough!(7)","paragraphs":["4184 I’ve Had It! I’ve Been An Elder For Long Enough!(7)","Huang Tianhao was too angry to speak.","At the same time, he also felt an indescribable despair in his heart.","The only reason why Huang Sanbai would speak so clearly and tell what he did behind his back was that he really didn’t want to let himself live anymore!","Otherwise, with Huang Sanbai’s treacherous and cunning degree, it is absolutely impossible for him to say these words out of his mouth.","Sure enough, after Huang Sanbai finished speaking, his eyes glowered ferociously, and he walked towards him step by step.","Huang Tianhao gritted his teeth and looked at him. At the same time, he tried his best to execute various exercises, trying to break away the restriction Huang Sanbai left in his body!","However, no matter how hard he tried, he still couldn’t break through the restriction in such a short time.","Just then, there was a knock on the door.","“Bang bang bang!”","“Elder Sanbai, are you in there? I heard that the Patriarch has come to you. I wonder if he is still there?”","The voice of Huang Beicheng came from outside the door.","Huang Sanbai froze all of a sudden!","He never expected that Huang Beicheng would appear at this time!","To deal with Huang Tianhao, he naturally arranged a lot of arrays around the room to prevent other people from approaching, and also to prevent the movement in the room from spreading.","However, he forgot that Huangbeicheng grew up with him, and was trained by him, and taught most of his unique skills.","In his haste, the array he arranged couldn’t be too complicated or advanced, so Huang Beicheng easily passed through the array and walked in.","Moreover, Huang Beicheng didn’t suspect at all that Huang Sanbai was doing such a horrendous thing in the room, and thought he was talking about something confidential with Huang Tianhao, so he was so cautious.","Therefore, after Huang Beicheng knocked on the door, he consciously stepped back a few steps, for fear that he heard something that he shouldn’t have heard.","Huang Tianhao was also taken aback for a moment, but he immediately came to his senses, realising that this was his only chance to escape, so he opened his mouth and was about to yell.","It’s a pity that Huang Sanbai’s reaction was faster than his. Seeing him open his mouth, he immediately used all his profound strength to smash towards Huang Tianhao.","Huang Tianhao’s eyes went dark, and he fell to the ground on the spot, unconscious.","Huang Sanbai didn’t have time to deal with Huang Tianhao’s affairs, so he could only hastily kick him, kicking the deeply unconscious Huang Tianhao under the bed.","Then, he strode to the door and opened the door.","The expression on Huang Beicheng’s face was a little flustered, but when he saw Huang Sanbai, he managed to suppress his irritability and saluted him respectfully.","“Elder Sanbai, you... did you know the news from Paradise Island just now? Li Moying and his fiancée actually came out of the array! They really came out alive! What should we do now? Today is the last day of the semi-finals, and the final is coming soon!”","“I originally thought that even if Li Moying and the others survived, they would definitely miss the match and be eliminated, but they came back in time! With them here, how could I get the first place? Let alone the first place , if you are unlucky, you may be defeated by them in the first round of the finals!”","Huang Sanbai glanced at him lightly, and coughed, “Beicheng, you are so old, but you are still so impatient, you can’t hold your breath at all. Tell me, how can you become the Patriarch?”"]},{"number":4185,"title":"Chapter 4185 ve Had It! I’ve Been An Elder For Long Enough!(8)","paragraphs":["4185 ve Had It! I’ve Been An Elder For Long Enough!(8)","Huang Beicheng has always had the most respect for Huang Sanbai, upon hearing what he said, he immediately lowered his head.","With other heaven-level geniuses, I’m afraid I still don’t know how terrifying the so-called god-level genius is.","However, Huang Beicheng is different.","Ten days ago, he was first defeated by Huang Yueli on Paradise Island, and later in front of the teleportation array, he was almost killed by Li Moying on the spot!","Although at this moment, the injuries on his body have healed so much that they basically don’t affect the battle.","However, as long as he recalled the scene at that time, it still made him break out in cold sweat, and at the same time, he was full of doubts about his own strength.","Being defeated one after another by those two god-level geniuses made him completely doubt his life and seriously destroyed his self-confidence.","This is actually very fatal to a cultivator.","Because practicing martial arts is against the sky, if the martial artist does not have enough self-confidence to overcome all obstacles, then the cultivation base is likely to stagnate and no further progress can be made.","Even in actual combat, you will be timid because of this.","Fortunately, Li Moying and Huang Yueli disappeared soon, and it was even rumored that they had died in the poisonous mist.","After Huangbeicheng heard the news, his self-confidence recovered a bit.","As a result, within a few days, the two of them actually reappeared!","The timidity and humiliation at that time immediately returned to Huang Beicheng’s heart again, making him panic in an instant.","He also knew that his state was very wrong and would definitely affect his performance in the finals, so he came to Huang Tianhao to discuss it immediately.","When Huang Sanbai saw Huang Beicheng’s appearance, he understood a little bit.","However, he has no intention to deal with this kind of problem now. For him, the most important thing is to kill Huang Tianhao, then kill Huang Yueli, and get Sky Phoenix Ring. This is the top priority!","Huang Sanbai waved his hand, “Oh, in your state, it’s useless for others to say anything. The most important thing is to rely on yourself...”","He was about to send Huang Beicheng away, when suddenly, as if thinking of something, he changed the topic.","“However, time is running out now, and I’m afraid it’s too late on your own. The old man can help you. However, this method is somewhat risky. It depends on whether you dare to try it!”","Huang Sanbai chuckled, “What are you talking about repaying and not repaying? I watched you grow up, so I naturally hope that you will get better and better. Alright, come with me!”","As Huang Sanbai said, he turned around and left the door. At the same time, he carefully activated the defensive array near the room.","...","The Floating Sea, the island in the Gravity Island.","It’s getting late, the sun is getting westward, and it’s almost time for dinner.","However, the central square was still crowded with cultivators, and no one was willing to leave.","Because, this is already the last hour of the God Realm’s Grand Meet match.","Although there was not much time left, the number of challenges that took place in the square was much higher than in the previous few days."]},{"number":4186,"title":"Chapter 4186 End Of This Round (1)","paragraphs":["4186 End Of This Round (1)","All cultivators seized this last chance and launched a final assault on the highest ranking they could challenge.","Except for the cultivators fighting in the arena, any other cultivators, regardless of whether they are qualified for the match, can watch the battle from the sidelines, as long as they don’t come close to the circled competition venue.","This is also a method used by Floating Sea to maintain the fairness of the game.","At this moment, the competition area of the first group seemed much deserted compared to other groups.","Out of the ten arenas, four were actually empty, which was completely incomparable to the fact that the arenas of other groups were all full of people.","Moreover, those who stood in the arena to compete were all cultivators with poor cultivation and strength.","The top four of the first group were all standing on the edge of the competition field, chatting with each other in a friendly manner.","“We are really lucky this time! Originally, seeing that we have Young Master Li of the Cloudy Qilin Clan and fellow comrades in our group, I thought the competition in our group would be fierce. There are at least five people They are all absolutely qualified to enter the finals, the four of us are similar in strength, and we don’t know who will be eliminated. It really scared me to death! In the end, Young Master Li disappeared!”","“Hehe, that’s true. I was just like you at the time. I was very worried that I wouldn’t qualify. In the end, we hit the big luck instead!”","“Well, speaking of it, this Young Master Li is really a love saint, he can’t think about it so much, because a woman, she took the initiative to return to the Paradise Island array, not only did she not care about participating in any competitions, she even lost her life !”","“Isn’t it? The poisonous mist is so powerful. It is said that as long as it touches a little, it will collapse to the ground, and it will kill people after an hour! He has been in it for so long, he must not survive!”","“It’s a pity, what a pity! A dignified god-level genius has fallen like this. It really is a womanizer who hurts people!”","Several heavenly geniuses were discussing with each other, shaking their heads again and again, their expressions full of regret.","However, if you look carefully, there is a glint of gloating in the eyes of two people.","Li Moying’s disappearance is actually not a bad thing for young geniuses in the God Realm.","After all, with him on top of his head, no matter how outstandingly anyone performs, they will be covered by Li Moying’s light and will not be able to show their abilities.","Only when Li Moying disappears, the others will have their day.","Let’s just say now, if Li Moying is still there, there will inevitably be a fierce fight between them, and one of them will always be eliminated.","How could it be possible to chat easily and enjoy the envious and reverent eyes of the cultivators around you like now?","Just as everyone was discussing, suddenly, there was a commotion outside the central square.","There were bursts of exclamations from the crowd, and there were even various pushing situations.","It’s a pity that there are too many people in the central square!","“All right, all right, don’t look, there’s nothing to see.”","“It’s already about this time. There is still half an hour before the match is over. We should count the list of the finalists. I guess the steward of Hanging Island is here.”"]},{"number":4187,"title":"Chapter 4187 End Of This Round (2)","paragraphs":["4187 End Of This Round (2)","A few people were talking, and the crowd outside the competition venue suddenly surged like a tide.","The crowd spontaneously squeezed towards the two sides, giving way to the middle road.","At the same time, all kinds of exclamations kept coming.","“Young Master Li! It turns out that this is the only god-level genius in the legendary God Realm, Li Moying, the Young Master of the Cloudy Qilin Clan! It really is a well-deserved reputation!”","“And you know that your reputation is well-deserved without seeing someone make a move?”","“Hey, see what you said! Young Master Li is famous not only for his talent and strength, but also for his unparalleled handsome appearance! Even if I haven’t seen him make a move, I know that he is really handsome! It’s a pity that he already has a fiancée, and he still loves his fiancée so much.”","“So, the one next to him is his fiancée, Young Miss Li, right? She really is a beauty in the world! I heard that she is also a god-level genius!”","“God-level, what god-level! You can believe this! Young Miss Li is beautiful enough, but she is a human clan, how can she have a god-level talent? I don’t believe this kind of nonsense!”","When these discussions came, the four god-level geniuses were startled. They glanced at each other, and they all saw the color of astonishment in each other’s eyes.","“What’s going on? Did Li Moying leave the array?!”","“How is this possible? The poisonous mist is so powerful, how could he stay alive for ten days? It’s impossible! Unless, he didn’t go in at all!”","“But I saw him enter the teleportation array with my own eyes!”","“I saw it with my own eyes. Besides, if he wasn’t trapped on Paradise Island, why didn’t he show up a few days ago? With his strength, there’s no need to use these tricks to confuse the enemy, right?”","The four of them were discussing with each other, and a trace of panic rose in their hearts.","Especially the one who ranked fourth was extremely nervous.","If Li Moying suddenly appeared, his place in the final would be lost immediately. With this little time left, it might not be enough for him to challenge the first three!","The situation of the other three people is a little better, but not much better.","Their strength is actually not much higher than the fourth place. If they are challenged by the opponent, it is really hard to say who will win.","The four of them were praying in their hearts, hoping that the onlookers were wrong and that Li Moying did not show up at all.","However, such a beautiful fantasy is obviously impossible to realize.","Not long after, two figures appeared at the end of the crowd, and walked slowly along the path that the crowd made way for them.","Soon, the two approached, and their faces became clearly visible.","It was Li Moying and Huang Yueli! !","“It’s over, it’s over, he actually came!”","All four of them had expressions of despair.","The worst has happened!","Li Moying held Huang Yueli’s hand, and the two wandered along the way.","Although there was only one hour left, because Huang Yueli’s body hadn’t recovered much, her legs were still weak when walking, so no matter how fast she walked, she couldn’t get up.","Li Moying offered to hug her, but she almost slapped her away!","In desperation, the two of them could only walk over slowly. It seemed like they were taking a walk along the way, and it took half an hour to arrive.","This time, there is less than half an hour left before the end of the match.","Fortunately, the two looked at the grouping situation outside the arena, and found that the two of them were actually in the same group."]},{"number":4188,"title":"Chapter 4188 End Of This Round (3)","paragraphs":["4188 End Of This Round (3)","This point surprised both of them.","However, after thinking about it carefully, I can understand it.","The basis for grouping God Realm’s Grand Meet is the most important thing is race and power, followed by cultivation, and finally age.","Huang Yueli is now a human being, moreover, she still has no influence. In this regard, there is a huge difference between Li Moying, the Young Master of the Cloudy Qilin Clan.","Moreover, she is now at the middle stage of the Mind Profound Realm, and Li Moying, who is at the late stage of the Mind Profound Realm, is also a small realm behind in terms of cultivation.","Therefore, the two of them do not meet the conditions for being split into different groups at all, so it is not surprising that they will meet.","In this way, it saves a lot of trouble.","At least, Li Moying didn’t have to send Huang Yue away from her group competition, and then came back to participate in her own group competition.","Although my wife is super powerful, no one can pose any threat to her, but if she can’t stop his wife and slave, Young Master Li, just don’t worry!","The two came to the competition venue and stopped.","Li Moying courteously led his wife to a cool shade, let her sit on a big rock, then touched her face, and said: “I’ll deal with those guys now, You are not feeling well, just rest here and don’t run around, you know?”","Huang Yueli rolled her eyes, “Understood, you are the most considerate, alright!”","What’s the use of being considerate now? Why don’t you know how to be considerate when you are doing double cultivation?","Man, your name is Hypocrisy!","Li Moying gave thousands of instructions before turning around and walking to the nearest unmanned group arena to Huang Yueli.","In that instant, he changed from the gentle and kind man just now to a ruthless and powerful cultivator.","He coldly swept across the audience, and asked in a deep voice, “Who is number one in this group? Stand up, and I will challenge you!”","Ever since Li Moying and Huang Yueli appeared, everyone in the central square has surrounded the competition area, and the surrounding crowds have already been packed to the brim.","Hearing Li Moying’s words, everyone was looking around, looking for the number one in the group.","The number one genius’s complexion instantly became very ugly.","From the moment Li Moying appeared, he was already mentally prepared, knowing that if Li Moying wanted to challenge, he would definitely pick him.","It is true that even if he was defeated by Li Moying, his ranking would only slip to second place, and he would not be eliminated immediately.","However, facing the challenge of such a strong man, who can say that he is not nervous or afraid?","In the past few days, he has performed well in the match, and he has already boasted about his performance to many people. If he is defeated by Li Moying with a few tricks today, he will be ashamed to go back!","However, no matter how unwilling he was, it was useless.","Li Moying repeated again: “Who is the number one in the group? Don’t waste time, stand up quickly!”","The number one in the group could only bite the bullet and walk slowly onto the ring under the watchful eyes of everyone.","He raised his hands and cupped his fists to salute, “Young Master Li, it’s a pleasure to meet you. I am a cultivator from the Fanyu Clan. My name is...”","Li Moying waved his hand, “Don’t be so wordy, you are defeated anyway, I’m not interested in what your name is. You just go ahead!”","There was an extremely embarrassing expression on this person’s face.","He is also a well-known genius cultivator in the God Realm. Usually, when encountering this kind of battle, the opponent doesn’t need him to introduce himself to recognize who he is!"]},{"number":4189,"title":"Chapter 4189 End Of This Round (4)","paragraphs":["4189 End Of This Round (4)","But when he was in front of Li Moying, didn’t he even have the qualifications to let Li Moying take a look?","But the other party was Li Moying, even if he was angry, he couldn’t vent it.","He could only forcefully suppress his dissatisfaction, cupped his hands at Li Moying and said, “Then...Young Master Li, I will strike first.”","Li Moying didn’t have any expression on her face, she just waited quietly.","His attitude made the Fanyu cultivators feel even more uneasy.","However, under the current situation, it is impossible for him not to make a move, and it is even more impossible for him to back down.","Even if you know it will be embarrassing, you can only do it!","The Fanyu cultivators took a deep breath, still gaining momentum, the condensed profound energy on their bodies became stronger and stronger.","The surrounding cultivators felt the profound energy fluctuations around him, and all exclaimed.","This person’s name is Pei Yifei, and he is also one of the first-class young geniuses in the God Realm. His strength is not far from that of Jing Shaoyuan and the others.","Usually, when he fights against ordinary cultivators, he seldom uses his full strength. Even if he fights against a genius of the same level as Jing Shaoyuan, the opponent will not be able to give him a chance to gather momentum. Get a head start.","Only in front of Li Moying can he be so cautious, and he has so much time to slowly gather momentum.","This is actually a very foul behavior, but who made him face the legendary god-level genius?","Not only him, but even the onlookers and the referees didn’t feel that there was anything wrong with doing so.","After all, it was Li Moying who asked him to make the first move!","Li Moying naturally did not interrupt him, but a hint of impatience flashed in his eyes.","He also wanted to hurry up and finish this meaningless match, and go back to coax his wife as soon as possible. How could he have so much time to play with them?","Finally, the time for the Fanyu cultivators to accumulate power is limited. Before Li Moying lost his patience, he had already reached the limit of the energy he could gather, and shot at Li Moying with all his strength!","The main attribute of the Fanyu clan is space.","As soon as he made a move, the surrounding space became distorted, and with a flash, he flashed behind Li Moying from the other side of the ring!","cultivators with space attributes have a fighting style that is hard to guard against. They can easily tear apart space and create teleportation. If they are not careful, they will be defeated in an instant.","“Wow! This is too sudden!”","“Young Master Li is still motionless, didn’t he react? This time he won’t really be tricked, right?”","The cultivators in the audience were all amazed, their hearts were in their throats.","Only Huang Yueli, who was sitting under the big tree, raised her eyes casually and glanced at the man on the ring.","There was still a bored expression on his face.","A hint of excitement flashed in the eyes of the Fanyu cultivators.","It seems that Li Moying has never been in contact with cultivators of the space department before, so he doesn’t know how elusive they are!","This is his chance!","If he can take advantage of this opportunity and defeat a god-level genius once, even if he just took advantage of a surprise, that would be a remarkable achievement!","If you take it out, you can brag about it for several years!"]},{"number":4190,"title":"Chapter 4190 End Of This Round (5)","paragraphs":["4190 End Of This Round (5)","However, it turned out that he was definitely just thinking too much.","The moment he was about to touch Li Moying’s back, Li Moying’s figure suddenly flickered and disappeared from his eyes.","The faces of the Fanyu cultivators changed abruptly, and their hearts were terrified to the extreme!","Because, Li Moying’s teleportation movement method obviously also uses the energy of the space system, but whether it is the speed at which the afterimage disappears or the proficiency of the movement method, it is even better than him!","Isn’t Li Moying a cultivator with thunder attribute? Why can he even master the profound skills of the space system!","It was already too late for him to close the move, and the whole person was already terrified and desperate to the extreme!","Now, he doesn’t even know where Li Moying is.","Moreover, he has already released all the energy he has accumulated. If Li Moying gets behind him and gives him a fatal blow, he can be killed immediately!","In fact, his guess was not wrong. At this moment, Li Moying was standing behind him.","It’s just that Li Moying’s speed is really too fast.","At this critical moment, even most of the cultivators in the audience didn’t react. Occasionally, there were a few cultivators with high eyesight who could see the subtle changes, and they couldn’t help covering their mouths in horror. , no sound is produced.","Li Moying glanced at the Fanyu cultivator, raised his leg, and kicked his ass.","In this kick, he actually didn’t use any profound strength, not even 10% of his physical strength, it could only be regarded as a leg swing at best.","However, the position he stood in was too tricky, and when the Fanyu cultivators made moves, their entire body was already tilted.","So, after being kicked by him, the Fanyu cultivators immediately rushed forward and flew out of the ring.","With a “bang”, the person fell face down and fell to the ground.","The onlookers around the arena, many of whom hadn’t realized what happened until now, were suddenly silent.","They all know that Li Moying is very strong, and they also know that it is absolutely impossible for this cultivator of the Fanyu clan to defeat Li Moying.","However, no one expected that Li Moying would win so easily!","You must know that before the Fanyu clan cultivators made a move, they had accumulated momentum and raised their own strength to the limit before making a move with all their strength.","On the other hand, Li Moying seemed to be taking a walk on the ring. First, he watched the opponent with a cold eye while he was fully prepared. When the opponent made a move, he leisurely walked around to the back and casually raised his legs.","The speed and strength of that kick are unrecognizable, and there is no technical content at all.","But it was just such a kick that directly kicked a top-notch genius off the ring!","At this time, the cultivators of the Fanyu clan had already got up from the ground, and hid behind the crowd with their faces flushed.","In fact, if Li Moying kicked like that, he would be considered a shitty fall, but it’s not even a flesh injury, at most a scratch.","As for the benefits, he has changed from the first place in the match group to the second place in the group, and there is no danger of being eliminated. The one who should cry is actually the fourth place in the original group!","Having said that, the trauma he suffered this time is very, very serious.","After all, Li Moying was much younger than him, but when he hit him, it was so easy...","Such an astonishing gap made him doubt his life. The self-confidence he had built up over the past thirty years was almost destroyed today."]},{"number":4191,"title":"Chapter 4191 End Of This Round (6)","paragraphs":["4191 End Of This Round (6)","Li Moying stood on the ring, looking around, her thin lips slightly parted.","Hearing his question, the stunned referee suddenly woke up, and hurriedly responded: “That’s right, Young Master Li, you are now the number one in this group, and you can successfully qualify for the match.”","Li Moying nodded, and said again: “Is there anyone who wants to challenge me? If you want to come, you can come on stage now.”","His voice was not very thoughtful, and his tone was very calm, without any obvious emotion.","However, upon hearing his words, the fellow cultivators present couldn’t help shivering, and they didn’t even dare to chat, for fear that Li Moying would think that they were challenging him and would drag them onto the stage.","Just kidding, it’s not like they took the wrong medicine. How could they not figure out how to challenge such a perverted genius?","Li Moying and them are obviously not on the same level. Who likes to go up to seek abuse?","That is to say, just now, the cultivators of the Fanyu Clan were too unlucky to take the first place. That’s why they had the bad luck of eight lifetimes and bit the bullet to play.","If possible, he doesn’t want to lose this person!","Li Moying waited for a while, and glanced at the hourglass used for timekeeping not far away.","In less than a quarter of an hour, the match will be over.","He turned around resolutely and walked off the ring.","Everyone let out a long breath when they saw this scene.","Although, everyone knew very well that if they didn’t want to challenge Li Moying, it was impossible for him to catch them on the ring and beat them up.","However, seeing his tall and straight figure standing there gave one a sense of aloofness. He was under heavy psychological pressure and felt very nervous.","After Li Moying stepped down, she walked straight towards Huang Yueli.","Huang Yueli also patted her buttocks and stood up, nodded to him, “Are you finished? There is still some time, it’s my turn!”","As she spoke, she wanted to walk towards the ring.","Unexpectedly, as soon as she took a step, she felt her waist tighten.","Immediately afterwards, with a light step, she was hugged horizontally!","“No, you can’t go, aren’t you tired? Wouldn’t it be easier for me to carry you up?” Li Moying’s face was expressionless, and he had the image of a dignified nobleman, but the words he said were so shameless that Huang Yue Li can’t wait to slap him away!","Li Moying dodged and quickly ran to the ring before letting her down.","Still coaxing her, “Alright, alright, Little Li’er, don’t be angry. Am I going to let you down now?”","The surrounding cultivators looked at the two of them dumbfounded the whole time.","Although I have seen the love of this young couple before, seeing them again now still makes people vomit blood secretly.","Especially when I saw Li Moying swaying freely in the ring just now, defeating his opponent with just raising his hand, and now looking at him clinging to his fiancée like a little wolf dog...","The contrast is too great.","It’s completely unacceptable!","I always feel that I saw a fake Li Moying just now!"]},{"number":4192,"title":"Chapter 4192 End Of This Round (7)","paragraphs":["4192 End Of This Round (7)","Huang Yueli finally calmed down a bit as she landed on both feet.","She told herself repeatedly in her heart, calm down, must be calm.","Now she’s outside, not at their house. Even if she wants to beat her husband, she can’t do it in front of outsiders. After all, Li Moying is the Young Master of the clan, so she has to save him some face...","However, she finally managed to control her temper, only to find that although Li Moying put her down, he still put his hands on her waist to support her, as if he was afraid that she would fall.","Huang Yueli’s eyebrows twitched, and she turned her head to stare at Li Moying.","“Hurry up and let go of your hands, I still have business to do! Didn’t you see that it’s already this time? Time is running out!”","Li Moying is not the only one who wants to qualify through the match, she also needs to find someone to beat her up, alright?","This is the last time. Li Moying let her go now, so she can challenge for the second place in the group and get a spot.","Uh, no, isn’t the second in the group now the first in the group just now?","She was kicked by Li Moying just now, and she probably hurt her heart. She should stop adding fuel to the flames and play third in the group!","Huang Yueli made some calculations in her heart and chose her opponent. However, Li Moying remained motionless, showing no sign of letting go.","Huang Yueli immediately made an effort.","“Li Moying, are you going to let go? If you don’t let go, I’ll hit someone!”","As she spoke, she stretched out her small fist and hit Li Moying’s chest all at once.","Li Moying was hit by her, and immediately let out an exaggerated scream, her body flew upside down and landed under the ring.","However, he didn’t fall down. After balancing in mid-air, he stood firmly.","Huang Yueli didn’t react for a while, she stared at Li Moying for a long time, and even raised her fist to look at it.","Although she used some strength just now, her husband is not an ordinary person. This punch is not so much domestic violence as flirting. Li Moying probably didn’t feel it...","But, today, he was just blown away by himself?","In the audience, Li Moying walked towards the stunned referee, “Is that alright? My little Lier beat me, so she is now the first in the group and can qualify. Hurry up and change the final ranking.” .”","“Ah? What... what?” The referee was still unable to recover.","Li Moying frowned, “What’s wrong? You can’t even judge the winning or losing of a game, how can you be a referee?”","When the referee heard this, he almost spat out a mouthful of old blood!","Of course he will judge the winning or losing of the game.","But, was that a game just now?","Obviously he was the one who hugged his fiancée, went to the ring to show off his affection, and then was beaten by his fiancée!","Hey, no, how could he, a majestic god-level genius, be blown away with one punch by such a weak human girl?","The key is that the fist was swung without even a little fluctuation of profound strength? Any martial artist can’t be weak like this, right?","It took him a long time to realize that this was a play deliberately put on by Li Moying in order to let his fiancée appear.","Moreover, the acting is so exaggerated, so carefree!","The referee immediately burst into tears.","“Alright, alright, I’ll change it, I’ll change it...”","For a long time, they did come to the ring to show their affection, and the way of showing their affection was so fresh and refined, out of the ordinary."]},{"number":4193,"title":"Chapter 4193 End Of This Round (8)","paragraphs":["4193 End Of This Round (8)","At this moment, all the cultivators watching from the audience also reacted.","For a moment, everyone’s expressions became very exciting, as if they were choking on dog food.","During this period of time, it has been widely rumored in the God Realm that the Young Master of the Cloudy Qilin Clan has a fiancée of a human clan, and he dotes on her very much, almost to the point of spoiling her.","Most cultivators don’t quite believe this kind of words, and think it’s mostly rumors.","However, seeing the two of them show up with their own eyes today, and seeing Li Moying’s performance from beginning to end, people can’t believe it!","Especially those young women who secretly love Li Moying are full of jealousy and hatred towards Huang Yueli.","“How could this be? Young Master Li has such a status, yet he has a fiancée so early!”","“This woman must have seduced Young Master Li by some indecent means. Otherwise, based on her background, how could she be able to sit in the position of the Young Madame of the Cloudy Qilin Clan?”","“That’s right! I also heard that she has been declaring that she is a god-level genius! I saw it today, and I know how this so-called ‘god-level’ came about!”","“Isn’t it? Even the god-level Young Master Li was ‘defeated’ by her, isn’t he a god-level?”","These women sneered and sneered, looking at Huang Yueli, they wanted to quench the poison, wishing they could poison her to death on the spot!","These words attracted some male cultivators to look sideways.","However, after hearing some words at the end, they also aroused their approval.","“That’s right, Young Master Li actually let his fiancée beat him up on his own initiative... This... Can this really count?”","“If the results obtained like this can be counted, then... the original third place is too unfair, isn’t it? Inexplicably, she was squeezed out of the final list by a woman who has no strength and relies on a man to be the top.”","“If it were me, I would be depressed to death by now!”","that’s the truth.","The original third place, I always felt that I occupied such a position, which was already very secure.","Even if Li Moying appeared and challenged the first place, he didn’t feel any sense of crisis.","The most unlucky must be the fourth place, but luckily he is slightly better.","However, before he could finish rejoicing, Li Moying carried Huang Yueli onto the ring and staged such an exaggerated scene.","The third one didn’t react for a while, and only realized after hearing the discussions of the cultivators around him that he was actually out!","He immediately jumped up and rushed to the side of the referee, “Referee, this...is this game unreasonable? Why can she qualify? She didn’t beat her opponent by strength at all! This game can’t be counted, it can’t be counted.” ah!”","However, the referee just smiled wryly, shook his head and said, “Calm down. What evidence do you have to prove that she didn’t defeat her opponent by strength?”","“I want to know! Her opponent is Li Shaozhu! God-level genius! How could she win Li Moying?!” The third place was so anxious that he almost grabbed the referee’s neck and shook it.","The referee still shook his head, “I understand your feelings, but this is just your own speculation. Who dares to say that she will not be able to defeat a god-level genius? This kind of thing needs evidence, and you can’t just speculate. You either Come up with evidence, or, you can only accept this result.”","The referee actually knew very well that Li Moying definitely flopped."]},{"number":4194,"title":"Chapter 4194 End Of This Round (9)","paragraphs":["4194 End Of This Round (9)","However, he must also maintain the basic order of the God Realm’s Grand Meet.","He said it was impossible to accept reports without evidence.","Hearing this, the third person’s face turned red with resignation, but he couldn’t say anything.","After a while, he suddenly remembered something, and said, “By the way, then I... Then I can challenge her, right? She is ranked higher than me now, so I challenge her!”","Although, even if Huang Yueli loses, she will only be squeezed out of the ranking, and the second place will still not affect her place in the final.","However, at least he himself will not be eliminated.","The third person looked at the referee with piercing eyes, but the referee shook his head for the third time, “No way!”","“What?! This doesn’t work? What does Floating Sea mean? Are you deliberately covering up the cultivators of the Cloudy Qilin Clan? Why am I not even qualified to challenge for the first place?” He was so angry that he almost pointed at the referee’s nose and scolded stand up.","“Because the time for the match is over. Now, it’s alright for you to challenge Young Miss Li. As long as she accepts, you can compete. However, even if you win, you won’t be able to qualify.”","“What? What did you say?!”","The third person suddenly turned his head and looked at the hourglass used for timing.","Sure enough, all the sand inside had leaked out, which also meant that the match had officially ended.","He widened his eyes in disbelief, unable to accept such a result, but it was useless.","Huang Yueli glanced at him, seeing the blank and disappointed expression on the third person’s face, she didn’t feel anything special in her heart.","She is not a kind-hearted person, and she will not feel guilty at all for taking other people’s places.","Although her husband’s way of getting her to qualify was a bit too simple and rude, but with her real strength, she should qualify as a matter of course. Although the process was a bit deviated, the result is still the same, isn’t it?","Hearing the referee announce the end of the game, a smile appeared on Li Moying’s cold face.","He walked back to Huang Yueli, “Alright, Little Li’er, let’s go back.”","“En!” Huang Yueli nodded.","Seeing that Li Moying bent over and wanted to hug her again, she quickly stepped back a few steps and stared at her husband threateningly, “I’ve said it a hundred times, let me go! Otherwise, I’ll turn my back on you!”","“Alright, alright, whatever you say is what you say.”","Li Moying looked at her wife’s angry little face, no matter how unwilling she was, she could only compromise.","However, he still stretched out his hand, wrapped Huang Yueli’s little hand tightly in his palm, pulled her, and prepared to leave together.","Just then, a loud cry came.","“Young Master Li, Young Miss Li, please stop!”","Immediately afterwards, the third person appeared in front of the two of them, with an expression of anger still on his face.","He stared at Huang Yueli, and said unceremoniously: “Young Miss Li, don’t you feel that you are too spineless? Don’t you feel blushed to be able to enter the finals only by relying on your fiancé?”","Huang Yueli paused, looked at him, and shook her head calmly, “Of course I don’t think so.”","“you...”","The third place didn’t expect Huang Yueli to be so upright and confident. She didn’t have any pride and integrity that a cultivator should have, so she almost couldn’t bring herself to speak up.","“You... You can be considered a cultivator like this? The Cloudy Qilin Clan is also amazing enough to agree to let a woman like you be engaged to Young Master Li?”"]},{"number":4195,"title":"Chapter 4195 End Of This Round (10)","paragraphs":["4195 End Of This Round (10)","Hearing this, before Huang Yueli could speak out, Li Moying’s face darkened, and she stopped sternly: “You’re looking for death! Who allowed you to talk to my wife like this?”","The third person shivered subconsciously.","However, when he came back to his senses, he still stood in front of the two of them, refusing to back down.","After all, it’s not just about his face, it’s also about the quota for the finals!","In order to be able to make a big splash in the God Realm’s Grand Meet, he has almost been in retreat for the past ten years, and he has never slackened up every day.","His talent is already quite good, and with such hard work, he can stand out in the match!","Entered the final as the third place in the group!","This kind of achievement, even in his family, is considered outstanding, and he will definitely receive key training when he goes back.","However, what he never dreamed of was that within such a short period of half an hour, the situation took a turn for the worse and he was directly out of the game!","The hard work of the past ten years has all assisted Dongliu!","His chest was full of unwilling anger, and he was unwilling to back down even if he was facing a god-level genius that he could never defeat.","“Young Master Li, I’m just talking about the facts! We can understand that you dote on your wife, but you should have a limit in everything! You ignore the rules of the competition and use such means to send her to the finals. You are losing face to the Cloudy Qilin Clan! Please think twice!”","All the cultivators present gasped.","No one expected that the third person would dare to talk to Li Moying like this!","A trace of murderous intent flashed across Li Moying’s eyes, and the profound power fluctuations around him also became violent.","“My woman, of course you can get what you want, who dares to put your beak on it? Besides, who said she is not qualified to enter the finals?”","Li Moying’s character has always been arrogant, not to mention Huang Yueli has such strength, he just doesn’t want his wife to be troubled.","Even if she didn’t, he would still send her to the finals.","His woman is naturally right in whatever she does.","The third place suddenly felt that the temperature around his body had dropped a lot, and there was a burst of coolness behind him.","Li Moying was so angry that he suddenly felt scared.","Li Moying glanced at her, but did not speak, her right hand was already on the hilt of the sword.","Seeing that Li Moying was still silent, she quickly added: “I’m tired, my legs are so sore!”","Hearing this, Li Moying immediately forgot about the person who provoked him, and immediately turned around to hug Huang Yueli.","Huang Yueli took a step back to avoid it, and at the same time, turned to the third place.","“Whether I have strength or not is not for you to judge. If you think we made a foul, you can appeal to the referee.”","“But, the referee said...”","“The referee said that there is no evidence, right? Then you have to follow the rules!”","The third place was still full of unwillingness, “You said you have the strength, do you dare to compete with me in the ring now?”"]},{"number":4196,"title":"Chapter 4196 Last Bout Of Madness (1)","paragraphs":["4196 Last Bout Of Madness (1)","“Competition? Now?” Huang Yueli raised her eyebrows unexpectedly.","The third raised his chin, “That’s right, if you win, I will be convinced and admit that you are better than me, and you deserve your name to qualify for the semi-finals. If you lose...”","“What if I lose? I can’t give you the spot either?” Huang Yueli couldn’t help laughing.","Hearing this, the third person seemed even more depressed, because what Huang Yueli said was right!","He held back for a long time before choking out a sentence: “If you lose, you should admit that you are a fake match! How about it, do you compare?”","Huang Yueli shook her head, and said slowly, “No comparison!”","“You... Are you afraid?”","Huang Yueli glanced at him, “I’m doing this for your own good. Being eliminated is already pitiful enough. If you are still unable to break through because of your damaged self-confidence, then aren’t you too unlucky?”","Most of the young warriors who have been beaten by her will doubt life, which will hinder their future cultivation.","Because she is really too young, and her strength is so strong, her talent is even more exaggerated than Li Moying.","“What do you mean?!” The third was still chasing them relentlessly.","But Huang Yueli had already hooked her husband’s arm, and the two left together.","For a while, all the warriors present were talking about it.","At that moment just now, everyone thought that Huang Yueli should accept the third place challenge and prove her strength.","But who knows, she flatly refused.","“Are you really afraid?”","“You must be scared! If it weren’t for the presence of Young Master Li, why would she have entered the finals?”","“Hehe, she thought everything would be fine if she made it to the finals? Just wait and see, she will definitely be ashamed in the finals!”","...","The night gradually darkened.","The residence of the Holy Phoenix Clan.","Huang Sanbai walked ahead, took Huang Beicheng to the door of another room, opened the door and entered.","“Beicheng, come here, I’ll give you something.”","Huang Sanbai walked to a two-person high cabinet, took out a yellowed classic from inside, and handed it to Huang Beicheng.","Huangbeicheng took it, and flipped through a few pages, his face full of bewilderment, “Elder Sanbai, this...what the hell is this?”","This booklet looks really shabby. The paper is not only yellow, but also tattered. Some places are already brittle, and a piece will fall off in a handful.","Moreover, on the cover, even the name of this classic is not written.","And the real peerless skills in the God Realm are absolutely impossible to be so dilapidated. They must all be written on high-grade sandpaper, and various patterns will be drawn so that they can be preserved for a long time.","Huang Sanbai smiled mysteriously, and said: “This... is actually a book of Demon Clan exercises that I got on the Demon Clan battlefield many years ago!”","“What?! Demon... Demon Clan Cultivation Technique!”","Huang Beicheng shook his hand and dropped the book on the ground.","Huang Sanbai’s words are really scary!","You must know that the God Race, the Human Race and the Demon Race are absolutely incompatible. Things from the Demon Race are taboo on the God Race side!","Not to mention, this is a book about the cultivation methods of the demons.","If this kind of thing is seen by the people of the coalition army, not only will the classics be confiscated on the spot, but all those who have read the exercise will be arrested and severely tortured in the prison of the military headquarters.","That’s why he was so shocked.","Huang Sanbai shook his head, said with a smile: “Look at you, how dare you be so timid at such a young age!”"]},{"number":4197,"title":"Chapter 4197 Last Bout Of Madness (2)","paragraphs":["4197 Last Bout Of Madness (2)","Huang Beicheng’s face turned blue, with a terrified expression.","Even Huang Sanbai’s words failed to appease him in time.","“Elder Sanbai, it’s not a matter of courage, this... this is the practice of the demons! This is forbidden, if people see it, we will all be ruined! You should quickly find a way, Let’s deal with it! If you can’t think of it for a while, then I will find a way.”","Huang Beicheng believed in Huang Sanbai wholeheartedly, and took the initiative to take responsibility.","Huang Sanbai said with a smile: “You really don’t need to be so nervous. Young people are impatient, and they only listen to half of what they say, can’t you listen to me?”","“You... you said.”","“Although this technique was obtained from the Demon Race, after I read it, I feel that its operation method is also applicable to our Protoss, but some places are indeed crooked and unreasonable. I specially made modifications to get rid of all these problematic places, and now, it is very suitable for the cultivation of the Protoss.”","Huang Sanbai talked eloquently.","Huang Beicheng still had a nervous expression on his face, “But...Elder Sanbai, this is still a book of Demon Clan Cultivation Technique!”","Huang Sanbai bent down, picked up the classic book himself, opened the pages, and handed it to Huang Beicheng again.","“After my improvement, if you don’t take the initiative to tell it, who will know that this is a demonic exercise? I guarantee that no one will be able to see it! If you don’t believe me, you can see it for yourself!”","Huang Beicheng hesitated for a moment, but still accepted the exercises.","Seeing this, Huang Sanbai showed a smile on the corner of his mouth, and said: “Thinking about it, you have already seen that the main function of this exercise is to stimulate the potential of the body, so that you can exert your strength beyond your original strength at critical moments. The strength of cultivation!”","“Of course, this kind of exercise is also in the collection of our Sacred Phoenix Clan. However, no matter how good the exercise is, it can only raise you to a small level. This is different. It can inspire you three times in a row. potential! In other words, you are currently at the middle stage of the Mind Profound Realm, if you use this exercise to the extreme, you can reach a combat strength close to the middle stage of the Dao Profound Realm!”","Hearing this, Huang Beicheng couldn’t help but feel a little bit moved even though Huang Beicheng had a psychological barrier to the Demon Clan’s exercises.","The strength of the middle stage of Daoxuan Realm!","I’m afraid even Li Moying himself may not have such strength, right?","If he can really reach this level, he will definitely be able to sweep away all the geniuses in the finals of the God Realm’s Grand Meet!","Maybe, Li Moying can be trampled underfoot, and successfully ascend to the throne of champion.","Huang Sanbai had been observing the expression on his face, and saw that he was a little moved, and felt even more proud, so she immediately opened her mouth to add fuel to the flames.","“Beicheng, you are not fighting on behalf of yourself alone. Standing behind you are all cultivators of the Sacred Phoenix Clan! If you lose to Li Moying, it will not only be a shame for you alone, but also for the entire Sacred Phoenix Clan. The shame of the Phoenix Clan! You have to think about it clearly!”","Huang Beicheng frowned, thought for a while, and then suddenly said, “Elder Sanbai, are you sure that this exercise will not be seen as a Demon Clan exercise by others?”","“Hehe, of course I am convinced. Could it be that I will harm you?” Huang Sanbai smiled very kindly.","Huang Beicheng felt uneasy.","However, he really wanted to win the finals, so he wanted to stand out."]},{"number":4198,"title":"Chapter 4198 Last Bout Of Madness (3)","paragraphs":["4198 Last Bout Of Madness (3)","Moreover, Huang Beicheng never imagined that the respected elders of the clan who watched him grow up would plot against him.","Therefore, in the end he nodded, “Alright, thank you Elder Sanbai, I have accepted this exercise, and I will definitely study it when I go back! Don’t worry, as long as I am here, I will definitely do my best to get rid of the Cloudy Qilin Clan. Win the championship!”","Huang Sanbai twirled his beard and said with a smile: “That’s good, it’s not in vain that I value you so much!”","Seeing Huang Beicheng’s back disappear, he raised the corner of his mouth coldly.","This exercise has indeed been modified by him, and it is already difficult to recognize it as a devil’s exercise.","However, what Huang Sanbai didn’t say just now is that although it can stimulate people’s potential to the limit, this kind of stimulation is at the cost of burning vitality.","The dominance of the Demon Clan’s exercises lies in the fact that it burns life force ten times faster than the normal God Clan’s exercises!","The demons themselves have strong vitality, and their physical strength is far superior to that of humans and gods, so they can barely bear it.","But this burning speed is fatal to the Protoss.","If Huang Beicheng really stimulated his potential three times in a row and reached the middle stage of the Dao Xuan Realm, then he would be able to persist for an hour at most.","In the end, what awaits him is...","“Everything is fate! Beicheng, I am also reluctant to sacrifice a top-level genius like you, but who made Huang Yueli so strong? If you want to blame it, blame your own talent for not being strong enough, otherwise, I don’t have to work so hard!”","Huang Sanbai sighed secretly, then turned and returned to his room.","This time, he re-fortified the surrounding defensive array very carefully, making sure that even Huang Beicheng couldn’t break in, before he came to the bedside.","Drag Huang Tianhao out from under the bed.","At this time, Huang Tianhao was sweating profusely, his face was flushed, and his eyes were covered with dense red bloodshots.","Seeing this, Huang Sanbai couldn’t help but let out a sneer: “It seems that you, the Patriarch, have been trying to find a way to escape! It’s a pity that you can’t undo my unique restraint in a short period of time. You struggled hard, and the final result was that you could only suffer internal injuries. It seems that you are already on the verge of madness.”","Huang Tianhao gritted his teeth and stared at him, but couldn’t make a sound.","He had indeed been working hard to mobilize the profound energy in his body just now, trying to break away from Huang Sanbai’s restriction.","But in the end, just like what Huang Sanbai said, he almost lost his mind!","As one of the top masters in the God Realm, he is well-informed and knows the common God Clan exercises, so it is impossible for him to have such a weird effect.","This kind of restraint method is so evil, but it is very close to the legendary Demon Clan technique.","Could it be...","Huang Sanbai stepped forward and squeezed his shoulder hard.","Huang Tianhao couldn’t help but let out a cry of pain.","He found that he could make a sound, and immediately glared at Huang Sanbai, yelling and cursing, “Huang Sanbai, you villain! Kill me!”","Huang Sanbai smiled coldly, “Huang Tianhao, you are too naive, aren’t you? If I kill you casually, how can I control the Sacred Phoenix Clan? I don’t have the seal of the Patriarch, the key to the treasure house of the Sacred Phoenix Clan , I didn’t get it either. How about this, you hand over these things, and I can let you die quickly!”","“Huang Sanbai, you are dreaming! I would rather die than hand over the Sacred Phoenix Clan to someone like you!”"]},{"number":4199,"title":"Chapter 4199 Last Bout Of Madness (4)","paragraphs":["4199 Last Bout Of Madness (4)","“Tsk, Huang Tianhao, I’m not a kind-hearted person. It’s because we’ve known each other for many years that I talk to you properly. Since you’re so ignorant, you can’t blame me.”","As Huang Sanbai said, a icy chill flashed in his eyes, and he slowly approached him.","Under the dim light, Huang Sanbai’s wrinkled face looked extraordinarily gloomy.","Huang Tianhao broke out in cold sweat behind his back, and said in horror, “You... what do you want to do?”","“Look at how hard your bones are!” Huang Sanbai sneered.","...","Outsiders have no way of knowing what happened in the Sacred Phoenix Clan’s residence.","During the three days after the match ended, the gate of the Sacred Phoenix Clan was closed, and there was no movement inside.","Not even a cultivator from the Sacred Phoenix Clan came out to move around.","Everything was eerily quiet.","Many cultivators have noticed this and discussed it in private.","However, most people guessed that the Sacred Phoenix Clan was afraid of another conflict with the Cloudy Qilin Clan and saw Li Moying returning safely, so they had some scruples and did not dare to go out.","Only Huang Yueli and Li Moying realized that something was quite wrong.","“Even if we leave the array, the people of the Sacred Phoenix Clan can’t just hide in fear, right? With Huang Tianhao’s temper, what he can’t stand the most is when others say that the Sacred Phoenix Clan is afraid of the Cloudy Qilin Clan! At a time like this, he should let the cultivators in the clan come out to do activities.”","Huang Yueli frowned, feeling puzzled.","Liu Buyan, who was sitting by the window, raised his hand and stretched his waist, and said disapprovingly: “What’s so strange about this? They are just scared! Two god-level geniuses! If you and Li Moying grow up , enough to scare them to pee their pants!”","“You can’t say that! Husband, what do you think?” Huang Yueli looked at her husband.","Li Moying nodded, poured a cup of tea for Huang Yueli, handed it to her, and then said: “Something is really wrong, our eyeliner in the Sacred Phoenix Clan hasn’t heard from us in the past few days, I will send someone else When I went to check their garrison, I found that the perimeter of the garrison was covered with defensive arrays, as if facing a big enemy...”","“Isn’t this just to guard against you?” Liu Buyan was puzzled.","Huang Yueli shook her head, “Clan Chief Li promised the Island Master that he would not tear himself apart with the Sacred Phoenix Clan in the Floating Sea. It is impossible to repent. What are they doing with the Cloudy Qilin Clan?”","“That’s right...” Liu Buyan frowned suspiciously, “Then... what are they afraid of?”","“Who knows? Anyway, nothing good will happen!”","Seeing the solemn look on Huang Yueli’s face, Li Moying walked over and brought her into his arms.","“Little Li’er, don’t worry, no matter what the Sacred Phoenix Clan wants to do, it’s impossible to hurt you. Besides, they can’t keep silent like this. When the day of the finals, people from the Sacred Phoenix Clan will definitely show up, and they can’t give up. Match? When the time comes, we will know what they are thinking.”","Huang Yueli sighed, “I hope so...”","For some reason, she always felt uneasy.","Logically speaking, things should develop as Li Moying said, and there is nothing to worry about.","However, she just felt that another accident happened.","With no result in the discussion, Huang Yueli could only temporarily put this matter aside and, together with Li Moying, concentrate on preparing for the final stage of the God Realm’s Grand Meet.","From the preliminaries, the semi-finals to the finals, it was a process of scouring the sand."]},{"number":4200,"title":"Chapter 4200 Last Bout Of Madness (5)","paragraphs":["0 Last Bout Of Madness (5)","The thousand people who can enter the semi-finals are already the elite among all cultivators, and almost all of them are heaven-level geniuses.","Among the strong ones, the stronger ones must be selected.","Those who can be included in the final list are definitely the first-class talented cultivators in the God Realm.","Even Huang Yueli and Li Moying didn’t dare to deal with it casually.","This time, the Cloudy Qilin Clan has quite a number of cultivators shortlisted. Apart from Li Moying and Li Zijun, there are two other people, including Li Moying’s guard leader Li Tianyi.","Although it sounds a bit small to add up to four people, you must know that there are twelve ancient gods in the God Realm alone. In addition, there are also some small races such as the big forces of the human clan and the monster race. It is not easy to get four places.","Besides, in the eyes of the people of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, Huang Yueli is also one of them.","In this way, there will be five places!","The strength crushed other protoss.","On the day of the competition, Huang Yueli got up early and set off with the team of the Cloudy Qilin Clan.","Except for a few people who entered the finals, all other cultivators who were eliminated were dispatched to watch the most important event in the God Realm live!","Huang Yueli and Li Moying were sitting together in the carriage and were talking when the carriage stopped suddenly.","Moreover, there was a loud noise from ahead.","“Go away, go away! Why are you standing in the middle of the road? Can’t you go to other places to beg for food?”","“That’s right, didn’t you see that we were in a hurry? Aren’t you begging for a fight?”","“Hey, forget it, don’t make trouble today, just give him some money!”","Hearing these weird conversations, Huang Yueli showed a puzzled expression, opened the curtain of the car, and popped her head outside, wanting to see what happened.","As a result, at first glance, a ragged beggar was sitting on the ground directly in front of the Cloudy Qilin Clan convoy, blocking their way.","This person’s hair is disheveled, his body is dirty, and his clothes are still stained with blood.","Huang Yueli’s gaze shifted to his face, and she couldn’t help but gasped.","“What’s going on here?” Huang Yueli couldn’t help shouting.","“Isn’t that right? Where is Floating Sea? How could there be beggars?” Huang Yueli frowned, feeling something was wrong.","Before the guard could speak, the beggar also heard Huang Yueli’s voice, and immediately became excited.","While the guards were not paying attention, he suddenly passed through them and rushed towards the carriage.","At the same time, with his mouth open, he made a whoo-ho sound towards Huang Yueli.","Huang Yueli was taken aback, only then did she realize that this person’s tongue had been cut off, no wonder she was unable to speak.","This beggar looked very miserable, but his skills were astonishingly fast.","The guards of the Cloudy Qilin Clan were all above the Mind Profound Realm, but they rushed forward together, but they couldn’t stop him, allowing him to rush all the way to the front of the carriage.","He stretched out his hand and grabbed the hem of Huang Yueli’s clothes."]}]);
